# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:32
translate english c32s002_noAma_f0705f57:

    # "Después de cenar..."
    "After dinner..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:33
translate english c32s002_noAma_3071531a:

    # mc "¿Qué haces, [ama]?"
    mc "What are you doing, [ama]?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:35
translate english c32s002_noAma_fa46e1a6:

    # ama "Estaba mirando esta foto. Sé que es una foto genérica de un campo con margaritas, pero..."
    ama "I was looking at this picture. I know it's a generic picture of a field with daisies, but..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:36
translate english c32s002_noAma_a82490ef:

    # ama "Si no fuera por esa roca que está ahí en medio, pensaría que es el viejo campo de tiro."
    ama "If it weren't for that rock right in the middle, I'd think it was the old shooting range."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:37
translate english c32s002_noAma_f45c8fd6:

    # mc "¿El viejo campo de tiro?"
    mc "The old shooting range?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:39
translate english c32s002_noAma_8c4dde0d:

    # ama "Supongo que [eva] te ha hablado de cuando nos apuntaban a la cabeza en el campo de tiro en el momento en que nos daban un arma."
    ama "I guess [eva] told you about when they used to aim a gun at our heads at the shooting range the moment they gave us a weapon."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:40
translate english c32s002_noAma_75b75cf1:

    # mc "Sí. Es inhumano."
    mc "Yes. It was inhumane."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:42
translate english c32s002_noAma_26db4307:

    # ama "Las series más mayores pasamos por eso. Los A, B, C, D, y nosotras. Creo que incluso los E."
    ama "The older series went through that. The A's, B's, C's, D's, and us. I think even the E's."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:43
translate english c32s002_noAma_72451634:

    # ama "Cuando los A fueron lo suficientemente mayores como para entrenar al resto de las series, despidieron a aquellos instructores."
    ama "When the A's were old enough to train the rest of the series, the company fired those instructors."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:44
translate english c32s002_noAma_73af92e2:

    # ama "Entonces, los A se negaron a usar ese campo de tiro para entrenarnos nunca más."
    ama "Then, the A's refused to use that shooting range to train us ever again."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:46
translate english c32s002_noAma_69e2182f:

    # ama "La excusa es que se había quedado pequeño para las series nuevas, que eran más numerosas. No cabían 20 Fs disparando allí."
    ama "The excuse is that it had gotten too small for the new series, which were larger. 20 F's couldn't fit on the shooting range at the same time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:47
translate english c32s002_noAma_be0cdaf9:

    # ama "Pero la verdadera razón es que nadie quería volver allí."
    ama "But the real reason is that nobody wanted to go back there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:48
translate english c32s002_noAma_751296a6:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Supongo que lo pasasteis mal."
    mc "I understand. I guess you guys had a hard time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:50
translate english c32s002_noAma_2040272f:

    # ama "Ahora lo usan algunos de los chicos cuando quieren competir entre ellos."
    ama "Now, some of the guys use it when they want to compete with each other."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:51
translate english c32s002_noAma_07b4435e:

    # ama "Por norma, son chicos que no vivieron aquella época y a los que no van a dejar competir en el campo que está en uso."
    ama "Usually, they're guys who didn't live through that era and who aren't allowed to compete on the range that's currently in use."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:52
translate english c32s002_noAma_23ae9f31:

    # ama "El viejo campo de tiro se ha convertido en un oasis de tranquilidad."
    ama "The old shooting range has become an oasis of tranquility."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:53
translate english c32s002_noAma_f7421095:

    # mc "Excepto cuando quieren competir, ¿no?"
    mc "Except when they want to compete, right?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:55
translate english c32s002_noAma_e1898150:

    # ama "No lo hacen a menudo. Los instructores, de los C a los F, los mantienen ocupados."
    ama "They don't do it often. The instructors, from the C's to the F's, keep them busy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:56
translate english c32s002_noAma_944beacd:

    # ama "Pero es un sitio bonito con recuerdos feos. Te lo enseñaré cuando vayamos a la base de entrenamiento... si quieres."
    ama "But it's a beautiful place with ugly memories. I'll show it to you when we go to the training base... if you want."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:57
translate english c32s002_noAma_02848cdf:

    # mc "Si lo vas a pasar mal volviendo allí, no es necesario."
    mc "If you're going to have a hard time going back there, we don't have to."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:59
translate english c32s002_noAma_7598dae1:

    # ama "Creo que volver allí después de tanto tiempo puede ser bueno. Para crear nuevos recuerdos."
    ama "I think going back there after so long might be good. To make new memories."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:60
translate english c32s002_noAma_330ac222:

    # ama "Recuerdos diferentes para una empresa diferente."
    ama "Different memories for a different company."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:61
translate english c32s002_noAma_e803d73e:

    # mc "Si es lo que piensas, de acuerdo. Aceptaré la visita turística al campo de tiro."
    mc "If that's what you think, alright. I'd be glad to go on a tour of the shooting range."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:63
translate english c32s002_noAma_cfdb63b9:

    # ama "Pero ya hablaremos de eso mañana. Me caigo de sueño."
    ama "But we'll talk about that tomorrow. I'm dead tired."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:64
translate english c32s002_noAma_6d00f607:

    # mc "Entonces no te entretengo más. Ve a dormir."
    mc "Then I won't keep you any longer. Go to sleep."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:66
translate english c32s002_noAma_b166bf00:

    # ama "Gracias por todo, [mc]."
    ama "Thanks for everything, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:67
translate english c32s002_noAma_21a7515b:

    # mc "Estoy aquí para lo que necesites."
    mc "I'm here for whatever you need."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:68
translate english c32s002_noAma_d5bbf685:

    # ama "Sabía que ibas a decir eso."
    ama "I knew you were going to say that."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:70
translate english c32s002_noAma_9f2c1078:

    # "Mientras [ama] va al lavabo antes de dormir, miras si hay alguna novedad en los foros de My Residence."
    "While [ama] goes to the bathroom before bed, you check if there's any news on the My Residence forums."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:71
translate english c32s002_noAma_83aae2f9:

    # "Parece que va a haber una cita con una de las humanas que hay infiltradas entre los aliens."
    "It seems there's going to be a date with one of the humans infiltrated among the aliens."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:72
translate english c32s002_noAma_b5a288d9:

    # "Estás seguro de que Clichecita habrá hecho algo interesante con ella."
    "You're sure Clichecita must have done something interesting with her."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:73
translate english c32s002_noAma_fcd27786:

    # "Los niveles más altos entre sus suscriptores, que ya han jugado la actualización, dicen que la cita es muy bonita."
    "The highest tiers among his subscribers, who have already played the update, say the date is really cute."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:74
translate english c32s002_noAma_ebd3af98:

    # "Ha sido la chica que más ha tardado en tener un momento íntimo con el MC y hay mucha expectación en los foros."
    "She's been the girl who took the longest to have an intimate moment with the MC, and there's a lot of hype on the forums."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:82
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_da8c937e:

    # ama "Gracias, [mc]. Y ahora deberíamos irnos."
    ama "Thanks, [mc]. And now we should leave."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:83
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f7212587:

    # mc "¿Ya? ¿Con tanta prisa? Oranjestad va a seguir estando ahí si tardamos cinco minutos más."
    mc "Already? In such a rush? Oranjestad will still be there if we take five more minutes."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:85
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_c93c439e:

    # ama "Al final no iremos a Oranjestad. Le he pedido ayuda a [car], y tenemos una reserva en un pequeño restaurante."
    ama "We're not going to Oranjestad after all. I asked [car] for help, and we have a reservation at a small restaurant."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:86
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b61dfb5b:

    # ama "Me ha dicho que está lejos de los sitios turísticos, con lo que estaremos casi solos. Pero nos tenemos que ir ya."
    ama "She told me it's far from the tourist spots, so we'll be almost alone. But we have to leave now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:87
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_5af7be8b:

    # mc "¿Tienes hambre?"
    mc "Are you hungry?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:89
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1703a995:

    # ama "No, pero no quiero perderme la puesta de sol. ¿Sabes qué? Mejor conduzco yo o llegaremos tarde."
    ama "No, but I don't want to miss the sunset. You know what? I'd better drive or we'll be late."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:90
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7231029a:

    # mc "Eso suena interesante. A mí tampoco me gustaría perdérmela."
    mc "That sounds interesting. I wouldn't want to miss it either."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:92
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_a99d229e:

    # "[ama] conduce como una posesa a través de las estrechas carreteras. Por suerte no hay demasiado tráfico."
    "[ama] drives like a maniac through the narrow roads. Luckily, there isn't too much traffic."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:93
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_53627598:

    # "Realmente tiene prisa por llegar a tiempo para ver el sol esconderse tras el horizonte."
    "She's really in a hurry to get there in time to see the sun hide behind the horizon."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:95
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6a54722a:

    # "Al cabo de unos minutos, aparca el coche y os dirigís a una callejuela peatonal. Te coge de la mano nada más bajar del coche."
    "After a few minutes, she parks the car and you head down a pedestrian alley. She takes your hand as soon as you get out of the car."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:96
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_06a59e27:

    # "La calle tiene los típicos colores que has visto en todas las guías de viaje online sobre Aruba, aunque la arquitectura es algo diferente."
    "The street has the typical colors you've seen in all the online travel guides about Aruba, although the architecture is a bit different."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:97
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_e9fcd934:

    # "Hay una terraza con sombrillas en medio de la calle. Supones que es donde vais a cenar."
    "There's a terrace with parasols in the middle of the street. You assume that's where you're going to have dinner."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:99
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_76a93cba:

    # ama "Ya hemos llegado."
    ama "Here we are."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:100
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_90a91ac6:

    # mc "¿Vamos a ir a ese restaurante de ahí?"
    mc "Are we going to that restaurant over there?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:101
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_eb2d6a0f:

    # ama "Sí, pero no en la terraza. Sígueme."
    ama "Yes, but not on the terrace, from what [car] told me. Follow me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:103
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_131172a3:

    # "Al llegar a la altura de las sombrillas..."
    "When you reach the parasols..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:104
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ce60889d:

    # ama "Espérame un momento aquí. Tengo que entrar dentro."
    ama "Wait here for a moment. I need to go inside."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:105
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_eac27608:

    # mc "No tardes. Ya te echo de menos."
    mc "Don't take too long. I miss you already."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:108
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_3b7e8910:

    # ama "*Risita* Para que la espera se te haga más corta."
    ama "*Giggle* To make the wait a little shorter."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:109
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_57fcd56b:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso te da un par de segundos extra."
    mc "*Laugh* That gives you a couple of extra seconds."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:111
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ef36b3bd:

    # "Miras a tu alrededor mientras esperas. Lo primero que te llama la atención es el letrero del restaurante."
    "You look around while you wait. The first thing that catches your eye is the restaurant's sign."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:112
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b82312d2:

    # "En un país que vive del turismo, hubieras esperado el letrero en inglés, pero parece una mezcla de holandés, italiano, y español."
    "In a country that lives off tourism, you would have expected the sign to be in English, but it looks like a mix of Dutch, Italian, and Spanish."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:113
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_58cde655:

    # "Debe estar en el idioma local. Papiamento o algo por el estilo."
    "It must be in the local language. Papiamento or something like that."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:115
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_49b97d80:

    # "Solo una de las cuatro mesas está ocupada, con lo que, a menos que la gente cene muy tarde aquí, vais a tener intimidad."
    "Only one of the four tables is occupied, so, unless people dine very late here, you're going to have some privacy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:116
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_e64a6722:

    # "Le vas a tener que dar las gracias a [car] por recomendaros el precioso sitio."
    "You'll have to thank [car] for recommending this beautiful place."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:117
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_3b135ebd:

    # "Si hubieras tenido que planificarlo tú, seguramente hubieras mirado las mismas guías de viaje que mira todo el mundo."
    "If you had planned it yourself, you probably would have looked at the same travel guides as every other tourist on the island."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:118
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_47cf6a77:

    # "Y hubieras acabado en un ruidoso restaurante rodeado de turistas que buscan exactamente lo mismo."
    "And you would have ended up in a noisy restaurant surrounded by tourists looking for exactly the same tropical romantic experience."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:121
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_fb922154:

    # "Al cabo de unos minutos, [ama] aparece con la camarera."
    "After a few minutes, [ama] appears with the waitress."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:122
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_27992950:

    # ama "[mc], esta es [saa], la dueña del restaurante."
    ama "[mc], this is [saa], the owner of the restaurant."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:123
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_86321bc6:

    # "Pues parece que no era la camarera."
    "Well, it looks like she isn't the waitress."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:124
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_196abb99:

    # mc "Encantado de conocerte, [saa]."
    mc "Nice to meet you, [saa]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:125
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_10bd9872:

    # saa "Igualmente, [mc]. Seguidme, os he preparado una mesa en el muelle."
    saa "Likewise, [mc]. Follow me, I've prepared a table for you on the pier."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:126
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_490db2e5:

    # mc "¿En el muelle?"
    mc "On the pier?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:127
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_bef705b7:

    # "No has visto ningún muelle cerca, pero parecías un turista despistado fijándote en lo que no era importante."
    "You haven't seen any pier nearby, but you looked like a clueless tourist focusing on unimportant things."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:129
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_53ee9166:

    # saa "Opa [car] me ha dicho que os trate como si fuerais de la realeza."
    saa "Oma [car] told me to treat you guys like royalty."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:130
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_fa393c42:

    # saa "Y el muelle tiene las mejores vistas."
    saa "And the pier has the best views."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:131
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_074cd552:

    # mc "Te seguimos."
    mc "We'll follow you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:134
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6598394a:

    # "El muelle está al final de la calle, tras unos arcos coloniales. Las sombrillas lo tapaban."
    "The pier is at the end of the street, behind some colonial arches. The parasols were blocking it from view."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:135
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b40f67b2:

    # "Las vistas de la puesta de sol sobre el Caribe son alucinantes."
    "The views of the sunset over the Caribbean are mind-blowing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:136
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7abf5ea9:

    # saa "Esa es vuestra mesa. Espero que os guste."
    saa "This is your table. I hope you like it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:137
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_22ff5d85:

    # mc "Es espectacular."
    mc "It's spectacular."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:139
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_8c3b4fba:

    # ama "El sitio es precioso, [saa]. Masha danki."
    ama "The place is gorgeous, [saa]. Masha danki."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:140
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_0506264a:

    # saa "An! Mi no tabata sa ku bo ta papia papiamentu."
    saa "An! Mi no tabata sa ku bo ta papia papiamentu."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:141
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_bc3edc00:

    # ama "Yo hablo un poco de papiamento, pero [mc] no. *Risa* Por la cara que pone, creo que le ha sonado a griego."
    ama "I speak a little Papiamento, but [mc] doesn't. *Laugh* From the look on his face, I think it sounded like Greek to him."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:143
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_09c9a6c1:

    # saa "Perdón, [mc]. Es raro conocer turistas que hablen mi lengua, y he cambiado de idioma instintivamente."
    saa "Sorry, [mc]. It's rare to meet tourists who speak my language, and I switched languages instinctively."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:144
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7a226f94:

    # mc "No te preocupes, [saa]. *Risa* Esta es mi cara de '¿qué está pasando aquí?'"
    mc "Don't worry, [saa]. *Laugh* This is my 'what's going on here?' face."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:145
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_38123692:

    # saa "Bueno, sentaos o si no os vais a perder la puesta de sol."
    saa "Well, sit down or else you're going to miss the sunset."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:147
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b284de32:

    # saa "¿Queréis ver el menú o preferís algún plato típico Arubeño?"
    saa "Do you want to see the menu, or would you prefer a typical Aruban dish?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:148
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_04da265d:

    # mc "Por mí está bien lo del plato típico. Si miro el menú voy a pedir algo que conozca, con lo que sorpréndeme."
    mc "A typical dish is fine by me. If I look at the menu, I'll order something I know, so surprise me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:149
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_5ae1ab75:

    # ama "Yo también prefiero algo típico."
    ama "I prefer something typical too."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:151
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_551cd1b4:

    # saa "¿Os gusta el queso?"
    saa "Do you like cheese?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:152
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_5d196d07:

    # mc "A mí me encanta."
    mc "I love it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:153
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6d34ae6f:

    # ama "¿Keshi yená? Por mí perfecto."
    ama "Keshi yená? Sounds perfect to me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:155
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_2515be4b:

    # saa "Es lo que iba a proponeros. Es un queso holandés relleno, [mc]. Casi es el plato nacional de Aruba."
    saa "That's what I was going to suggest. It's stuffed Dutch cheese, [mc]. It's practically the national dish of Aruba."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:156
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6fbc3ec4:

    # saa "Y es ideal para compartir."
    saa "And it's perfect for sharing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:157
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_4b6ce816:

    # ama "Creo que te va a gustar. Además, NUNCA lleva brócoli."
    ama "I think you'll like it. Plus, it NEVER has broccoli in it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:158
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_107095be:

    # mc "Entonces me parece perfecto."
    mc "Then it sounds perfect to me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:161
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1f3d13f5:

    # "Después de que [saa] os tome nota del resto de la cena..."
    "After [saa] takes the rest of your dinner order..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:162
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7f672bcf:

    # ama "Aunque [saa] es muy agradable, tenía ganas de que se fuera."
    ama "Even though [saa] is very nice, I couldn't wait for her to leave."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:163
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b3961c59:

    # mc "¿Por qué?"
    mc "Why?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:164
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ed50e134:

    # ama "Para pedirte que te levantes. Llevo un rato queriendo besarte."
    ama "To ask you to stand up. I've been wanting to kiss you for a while."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:166
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7ab86280:

    # "Ninguno de los dos necesitáis decir nada. No es una primera cita al uso, y los besos forman parte de vuestra relación."
    "Neither of you needs to say anything. It's not a typical first date, and kisses are part of your relationship."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:167
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ba679b52:

    # "Pero es vuestro primer beso durante una puesta de sol. No será el último."
    "But it's your first kiss during a sunset. It won't be the last one."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:170
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1839c8d8:

    # "Cuando os volvéis a sentar..."
    "When you sit back down..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:171
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6d08fe9f:

    # mc "Supongo que nunca has estado aquí, ¿no? Tu cara de sorpresa al ver el muelle se parecía mucho a la que debía tener yo."
    mc "I guess you've never been here, right? Your surprised face when you saw the pier looked a lot like the one I think I had."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:172
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_a43c6547:

    # ama "Este sitio es precioso. Sabes que no podíamos salir de la base si no era en una misión."
    ama "This place is beautiful. You know we couldn't leave the base unless it was for a mission."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:173
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_047d1d7e:

    # ama "Las chicas éramos un poco diferentes, teníamos una parte de entrenamiento que incluía mezclarnos con la gente."
    ama "Us girls were a bit different, a part of our training included blending in with... normal... people."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:174
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_884c7a26:

    # ama "No todo era combate para nosotras. Pero siempre estábamos supervisadas, y nunca estuve aquí."
    ama "It wasn't all combat for us. But we were always supervised, and I've never been here."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:175
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_912eef03:

    # mc "Entonces me parece un sitio aún más ideal. La primera vez para los dos."
    mc "Then it seems like an even more ideal place. The first time for both of us."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:176
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f8209983:

    # mc "Y lo de hablar papiamento, es otra sorpresa en la infinita caja de sorpresas de [ama], ¿no?"
    mc "And speaking Papiamento, that's another surprise in [ama]'s endless box of surprises, right?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:178
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_208b125e:

    # ama "En Aruba hay muchos idiomas. Nosotras crecimos con holandés, inglés y español como idiomas primarios."
    ama "There are many languages in Aruba. We grew up with Dutch, English, and Spanish as our main languages."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:179
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_0d17775d:

    # ama "Pero también aprendimos papiamento y otros idiomas criollos del Caribe. Aparte de los típicos: alemán, chino, francés..."
    ama "But we also learned Papiamento and other Caribbean Creole languages. Aside from the typical ones: German, Chinese, French..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:180
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_9eba5728:

    # mc "¿Cuántos idiomas hablas?"
    mc "How many languages do you speak?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:182
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6c486d6f:

    # ama "Nunca los he contado. [eva] dice que son 17, pero lleva años diciendo que son 17, y aprendimos más idiomas después de eso."
    ama "I've never counted them. [eva] says it's 17, but she's been saying it's 17 for years, and we learned more languages after that."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:183
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_92047158:

    # ama "Supongo que debo hablar unos 15 idiomas correctamente, con diferentes localismos, y alrededor de otros 15 con un acento bastante marcado."
    ama "I guess I must speak about 15 languages fluently, with different regionalisms, and around another 15 with a pretty heavy accent."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:185
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_78ffd9e0:

    # ama "Pero no quiero hablar de eso. ¿Qué te están pareciendo tus primeros días en la isla?"
    ama "But I don't want to talk about that. How are you liking your first days on the island?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:186
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_54f0f36c:

    # mc "Casi todo ha sido trabajar en cosas para las que no estaba preparado. Pero poco a poco me voy adaptando."
    mc "Most of it has been working on things I wasn't ready for. But, little by little, I'm adapting."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:187
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_e9a81f5a:

    # mc "Esta noche va a ser el mejor momento desde que llegamos."
    mc "Tonight is going to be the best time since we arrived."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:188
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_58a5e581:

    # mc "¿Y tú? ¿Cómo llevas el volver a Aruba?"
    mc "And you? How are you handling being back in Aruba?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:190
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_9a46fb69:

    # ama "Es diferente de cómo había pensado que sería. Cambiar el puesto de operaciones a seguridad..."
    ama "It's different from what I thought it would be. Switching from operations to security..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:191
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_aecc9d35:

    # ama "A veces echo de menos entrenar con los chicos."
    ama "Sometimes I miss training with the guys."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:192
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_401cbcd8:

    # mc "Sabes que puedes hacerlo, ¿no? Que ahora seas la jefa de seguridad, no significa que no puedas ir a disparar con no-tanques."
    mc "You know you can do that, right? Just because you're the head of security now doesn't mean you can't go shoot with non-tanks."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:194
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f246318a:

    # ama "*Risa* ¡Es un...!"
    ama "*Laugh* It's a...!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:195
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_03274b92:

    # mc "*Risa* Un Bradley, un IFV, lo sé. Pero siempre te ríes cuando no me acuerdo del nombre."
    mc "*Laugh* A Bradley, an IFV, I know. But you always laugh when I don't remember the name."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:196
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_dc8d0f44:

    # mc "Bueno, casi siempre. A veces me miras como preguntándote si alguna vez me lo aprenderé."
    mc "Well, almost always. Sometimes you look at me like you're wondering if I'll ever learn it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:198
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_126dd5c5:

    # ama "Y ya lo has hecho. Supongo que para ti también debe ser complicado. Demasiadas cosas nuevas."
    ama "And you already have. I guess it must be complicated for you too. Too many new things."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:199
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_71959540:

    # mc "Yo crecí sabiendo a distinguir entre modelos de coches y de consolas. Tú creciste sabiendo distinguir entre un Bradley y un T-72."
    mc "I grew up knowing how to distinguish between car models and gaming consoles. You grew up knowing how to distinguish between a Bradley and a T-72."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:200
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_24291fd2:

    # mc "Tan solo tengo que aprender en unas semanas lo que tú llevas aprendiendo años."
    mc "I just have to learn in a few weeks what you've spent years learning."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:202
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_826405ad:

    # ama "No es necesario que aprendas cada modelo de arma que hay en el mundo. Eso sería casi imposible en tan poco tiempo, además de todo lo que tienes que hacer."
    ama "You don't need to learn every weapon model in the world. That would be almost impossible in such a short time, besides everything else you have to do."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:203
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_22359eef:

    # ama "Creo que con que aprendas las categorías y para qué sirve cada cosa debería haber suficiente."
    ama "I think learning the categories and what each thing is for should be enough."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:205
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_675aaff2:

    # ama "Tienes personal para diseñar las operaciones, con lo que no necesitas dominarlo perfectamente."
    ama "You have staff to design the operations, so you don't need to master it perfectly."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:206
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_c6f8623e:

    # ama "Pero al menos no pondrías cara de tonto cuando te hablen de rifles, escopetas y carabinas."
    ama "But at least you wouldn't look like an idiot when they talk to you about rifles, shotguns, and carbines."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:207
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_fff47989:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Pongo cara de tonto?"
    mc "*Laugh* Do I look like an idiot?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:209
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f645f345:

    # ama "*Risa* Prefiero no responder a esa pregunta. Es nuestra primera cita y no quiero que te sientas mal."
    ama "*Laugh* I'd rather not answer that. It's our first date and I don't want you to feel bad."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:210
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_38a3de91:

    # ama "*Risa* Quiero que haya una segunda cita algún día."
    ama "*Laugh* I want us to go on a second date someday."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:211
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_88e70f89:

    # mc "*Risa* Me parece bien."
    mc "*Laugh* Sounds good to me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:212
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f702d746:

    # mc "Solo tengo una pregunta. ¿Por qué hoy?"
    mc "I just have one question. Why today?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:214
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_9d4a1e5e:

    # ama "Porque [bet] se quedaba en la base. No me hubiera sentido a gusto dejándola sola en casa."
    ama "Because [bet] was staying at the base. I wouldn't have felt comfortable leaving her home alone."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:215
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_d2a254d7:

    # mc "Si es por eso, podríamos haber tenido la primera cita en Newport."
    mc "If that's why, we could have had our first date in Newport."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:216
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_2f1368a5:

    # mc "Hay algo más, seguro."
    mc "There's something else, I'm sure."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:218
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_d377b642:

    # ama "Sí. Ayer no pensaste que fuera una psicópata por tener... ya sabes."
    ama "Yes. Yesterday, you didn't think I was a psycho for having... you know."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:219
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ee3425b3:

    # ama "No quería tener la primera cita hasta que no te lo hubiera enseñado."
    ama "I didn't want to have our first date until I had shown it to you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:220
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_4bebfb2f:

    # ama "No quería que, cuando te lo enseñara, creyeras que te habías acostado con una loca."
    ama "I didn't want you to think you'd slept with a crazy woman when I showed it to you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:221
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_4e2b5b5b:

    # mc "¿Acostarnos? Solo hemos hablado de salir a cenar."
    mc "Sleep together? We only talked about going out for dinner."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:224
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_64c38b5d:

    # ama "¿QUÉ? ¿No quieres acostarte conmigo?"
    ama "WHAT? You don't want to sleep with me?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:225
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ee19ac53:

    # mc "*Risa* Por supuesto que quiero. Pero también quería ver esa cara de sorpresa."
    mc "*Laugh* Of course I do. But I also wanted to see that surprised face."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:226
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_58517f7e:

    # mc "*Risa* No soy el único en esta mesa que puede poner cara de tonto."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm not the only one at this table who can make an idiot face."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:228
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_90ed2013:

    # ama "*Risa* Pero eres el único en esta mesa que no sabe romper una mano por trece sitios diferentes."
    ama "*Laugh* But you're the only one at this table who doesn't know how to break a hand in thirteen different places."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:229
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7b3c64f8:

    # mc "*Risa* Vale. No más bromas que te hagan poner cara de tonta. Ni que pongan en peligro mis manos."
    mc "*Laugh* Okay. No more jokes that make you look like an idiot. Or that put my hands in danger."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:230
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_543f1f7a:

    # ama "*Risa* No queremos tener que amputarte las falanges y que acabes teniendo unas manos más pequeñas que [vin]."
    ama "*Laugh* We don't want to have to amputate your fingers and have you end up with smaller hands than [vin]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:231
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_50d089ac:

    # mc "*Risa* Nope."
    mc "*Laugh* Nope."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:232
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_53ae1b94:

    # mc "Pero hablando en serio, creo que te preocupabas demasiado por mi reacción."
    mc "But seriously, I think you were worrying too much about my reaction."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:234
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f81c8740:

    # ama "Tampoco sabía cómo me iba a afectar volver a este sitio."
    ama "I also didn't know how coming back to this place would affect me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:235
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f1c86679:

    # ama "Me refiero a la base..."
    ama "I mean the base..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:236
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ac5bd3f4:

    # mc "Creo que lo estás llevando muy bien."
    mc "I think you're handling it really well."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:237
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_8a5f4bc2:

    # mc "Por lo que me habéis explicado, creía que tendríais cuentas pendientes con vuestros antiguos instructores."
    mc "From what you guys explained to me, I thought you'd have some scores to settle with your old instructors."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:239
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_5d4674b4:

    # ama "Los peores no están en la empresa ya. Cuando los A y los C pudieron entrenar al resto de las series, se deshicieron de los exmilitares externos."
    ama "The worst ones aren't with the company anymore. When the A's and C's were able to train the rest of the series, they got rid of the external ex-military guys."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:240
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_8c4dde0d:

    # ama "Supongo que [eva] te ha hablado de cuando nos apuntaban a la cabeza en el campo de tiro en el momento en que nos daban un arma."
    ama "I guess [eva] told you about when they would aim a gun at our heads at the shooting range, the moment they gave us a weapon."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:241
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_31abe2d0:

    # mc "Sí, a eso me refería exactamente. Es inhumano."
    mc "Yes, that's exactly what I meant. It's inhumane."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:243
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_26db4307:

    # ama "Las series más mayores pasamos por eso. Los A, B, C, D, y nosotras. Creo que incluso los E."
    ama "The older series went through that. The A's, B's, C's, D's, and us. I think even the E's."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:244
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_16dc8bb1:

    # ama "Cuando despidieron a esos instructores, los A se negaron a usar ese campo de tiro para entrenarnos nunca más."
    ama "When those instructors were fired, the A's refused to ever use that shooting range to train us again."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:246
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_69e2182f:

    # ama "La excusa es que se había quedado pequeño para las series nuevas, que eran más numerosas. No cabían 20 Fs disparando allí."
    ama "The excuse was that it had become too small for the new series, which were larger. You couldn't fit 20 F's at the shooting range at the same time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:247
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_be0cdaf9:

    # ama "Pero la verdadera razón es que nadie quería volver allí."
    ama "But the real reason is that nobody wanted to go back there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:248
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_751296a6:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Supongo que lo pasasteis mal."
    mc "I get it. I guess you guys had a hard time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:250
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_2040272f:

    # ama "Ahora lo usan algunos de los chicos cuando quieren competir entre ellos."
    ama "Now some of the guys use it when they want to compete with each other."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:251
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_d0ce68a4:

    # ama "Por norma son chicos que no vivieron aquella época y a los que no van a dejar competir en el campo que está en uso."
    ama "Usually, they're guys who weren't around back then, and who aren't allowed to compete in the active range."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:252
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_23ae9f31:

    # ama "El viejo campo de tiro se ha convertido en un oasis de tranquilidad."
    ama "The old shooting range has become an oasis of tranquility."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:253
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f7421095:

    # mc "Excepto cuando quieren competir, ¿no?"
    mc "Except when they want to compete, right?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:255
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_e1898150:

    # ama "No lo hacen a menudo. Los instructores, de los C a los F, los mantienen ocupados."
    ama "They don't do it often. The instructors, from the C's to the F's, keep them busy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:256
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_944beacd:

    # ama "Pero es un sitio bonito con recuerdos feos. Te lo enseñaré cuando vayamos a la base de entrenamiento... si quieres."
    ama "But it's a beautiful place with ugly memories. I'll show it to you when we go to the training base... if you want."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:257
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_02848cdf:

    # mc "Si lo vas a pasar mal volviendo allí, no es necesario."
    mc "If going back there is going to be hard for you, it's not necessary."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:259
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_556a06dd:

    # ama "Como has dicho, creo que lo estoy llevando... bien."
    ama "Like you said, I think I'm handling it... well."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:260
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7d959a14:

    # ama "Creo que volver allí después de tanto tiempo puede ser bueno. Para crear nuevos recuerdos contigo."
    ama "I think going back there after so long could be good. To create new memories with you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:261
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_e803d73e:

    # mc "Si es lo que piensas, de acuerdo. Aceptaré la visita turística al campo de tiro."
    mc "If that's what you think, alright. I'd be glad to take the sightseeing tour of the shooting range."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:263
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_a39ccc8c:

    # ama "El {b}viejo{/b} campo de tiro."
    ama "The {b}old{/b} shooting range."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:264
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7f95a52d:

    # ama "Y si seguimos hablando de cosas que ya no son importantes, nos vamos a perder la puesta de sol."
    ama "And if we keep talking about things that aren't important anymore, we're going to miss the sunset."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:265
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1b203f69:

    # mc "No voy a decidir qué es importante y qué no en este caso."
    mc "I'm not going to decide what's important and what's not in this case."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:266
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_9070dfa5:

    # mc "Demasiado tengo que decidirlo en la empresa."
    mc "I have to decide too much of that every day at the company."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:268
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_791227f7:

    # "Os cogéis de la mano por encima de la mesa mientras miráis como una gigante bola de fuego continúa su inexorable viaje hacia el horizonte."
    "You hold hands across the table while watching a giant ball of fire continue its inexorable journey towards the horizon."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:269
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_577e0109:

    # "A veces te preocupan los cambios repentinos de humor de [ama]. Quizás este viaje ha llegado demasiado pronto para ella."
    "Sometimes you worry about [ama]'s sudden mood swings. Maybe this trip came too soon for her."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:272
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_bfc1334f:

    # saa "Chicos, os traigo la comida justo a tiempo para la puesta de sol. He añadido unas krokechi para que las probéis."
    saa "Guys, I brought your food just in time for the sunset. I added some krokechi for you to try."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:273
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_5400cd44:

    # saa "Espero que os guste el pescado y el marisco."
    saa "I hope you like fish and seafood."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:274
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_235479d8:

    # mc "Por mí está perfecto."
    mc "Sounds perfect to me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:275
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_0058a860:

    # ama "Gracias, [saa]."
    ama "Thank you, [saa]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:276
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_63e7db9a:

    # saa "Buen provecho. Iré saliendo a veros por si necesitáis algo más."
    saa "Enjoy your meal. I'll come check on you in case you need anything else."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:278
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6ecffa80:

    # "Miras la apetitosa comida por un segundo antes de decidir que tiene una pinta estupenda."
    "You look at the appetizing food for a second before deciding it looks amazing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:279
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_e45fc385:

    # "Siempre has pensado que muchos turistas se pierden las delicadezas locales por ir a comer a lo seguro, a un MacDonalds."
    "You've always thought that many tourists miss out on local delicacies by playing it safe and eating at MacDonald's."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:280
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_583d1f30:

    # "Quizás el tragaldabas que llevas dentro es el que está dirigiendo tus pensamientos ahora mismo."
    "Maybe the glutton inside you is the one directing your thoughts right now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:282
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_75b4cdd2:

    # ama "*Risa* Sé lo que vas a decir."
    ama "*Laugh* I know what you're going to say."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:283
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_c40ec18b:

    # mc "¿Qué voy a decir?"
    mc "What am I going to say?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:285
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_d55d42e1:

    # ama "*Fingiendo una voz masculina* Tiene buena pinta, pero estaría igual de a gusto comiéndome una hamburguesa."
    ama "*Faking a manly voice* It looks good, but I'd be just as happy eating a burger."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:286
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_c506ce89:

    # ama "*Fingiendo una voz masculina* Lo importante es que lo voy a compartir contigo."
    ama "*Faking a manly voice* The important thing is that I'm going to share it with you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:287
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1222260d:

    # mc "*Risa* Casi has acertado. La segunda parte sería 'Lo importante es la compañía.'"
    mc "*Laugh* You almost got it. The second part would be 'The important thing is the company.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:288
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f5699506:

    # mc "Pero precisamente estaba pensando en el desperdicio que sería comer una hamburguesa ahora mismo."
    mc "But I was just thinking what a waste it would be to eat a burger right now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:289
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_11e13a2d:

    # mc "¡Esto tiene una pinta excelente! Y hamburguesas podemos comer las que queramos cuando volvamos a casa."
    mc "This looks excellent! And we can eat all the burgers we want when we get back home."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:291
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ebb631bc:

    # ama "El Keshi yená está muy bueno. Las krokechi son como croquetas de pescado, pero redondas. No es mi plato favorito, pero también están buenas."
    ama "The Keshi yená is really good. The krokechi are like fish croquettes, but round. It's not my favorite dish, but they're good too."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:292
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_d63c5db5:

    # mc "No te he preguntado nunca cuál es tu plato favorito. Y es la pregunta típica de la primera cita."
    mc "I've never asked you what your favorite dish is. And it's the typical first date question."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:294
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7ca4113a:

    # ama "*Risa* Cualquier cosa que cocinen [mar] o [nor]. Cocinan genial, pero es que además... su comida sabe a hogar."
    ama "*Laugh* Anything [mar] or [nor] cook. They are great cooks, but also... their food tastes like home."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:295
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f90fff0d:

    # mc "¿Ya las echas de menos? Conozco la sensación."
    mc "Do you miss them already? I know the feeling."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:297
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7f81a1de:

    # ama "Echo de menos a todas, pero especialmente a ellas dos y a [eva]."
    ama "I miss everyone, but especially those two and [eva]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:298
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_59191d5b:

    # ama "No me malinterpretes. Me encanta estar aquí contigo y con Tía [bet], poder dormir contigo cada noche..."
    ama "Don't get me wrong. I love being here with you and Aunt [bet], being able to sleep with you every night..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:299
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_8d44a29b:

    # mc "Pero no hay nada como estar en casa."
    mc "But there's nothing like being home."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:301
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_4d4e4d47:

    # ama "Exacto. Aunque haga poco tiempo que formo parte de la familia... Newport es más mi hogar de lo que nunca lo fue Aruba."
    ama "Exactly. Even though I've only been part of the family for a short time... Newport is more my home than Aruba ever was."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:302
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_5fe77f18:

    # mc "Me alegra que te sientas así respecto a Newport. Tenemos que conseguir que tu concepto de Aruba cambie."
    mc "I'm glad you feel that way about Newport. We have to change your perception of Aruba."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:303
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_54396300:

    # mc "Tenemos que crear recuerdos nuevos, como has dicho sobre el viejo campo de tiro."
    mc "We need to make new memories, like what you said about the old shooting range."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:304
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_03377b16:

    # mc "Y vamos a empezar a hacerlo hoy."
    mc "And we're going to start doing that today."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:306
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_bea5db30:

    # "Y creáis recuerdos nuevos."
    "And you create new memories."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:307
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_03babefe:

    # "Parece que la puesta de sol se detiene para daros el momento perfecto para cenar bajo su luz."
    "It seems like the sunset pauses to give you the perfect moment to have dinner under its light."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:308
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_465be367:

    # "Para crear un recuerdo nuevo."
    "To create a new memory."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:309
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_a82ac7a3:

    # "Disfrutáis de la exquisita cena que [saa] os ha preparado."
    "You enjoy the exquisite dinner that [saa] has prepared for you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:310
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_4a43aaaf:

    # "Realmente te daría lo mismo si fuera una hamburguesa. Lo importante es la compañía."
    "You really wouldn't care if it were a burger. The important thing is the company."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:312
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_cfa87aec:

    # "Ni siquiera la aparición de un barco turístico en el último minuto puede estropear la magia del momento."
    "Not even the appearance of a tourist boat at the last minute can ruin the magic of the moment."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:313
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_48aa883a:

    # "Ninguno de los dos sois capaces de verlo."
    "Neither of you is able to see it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:315
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_3b61fbcc:

    # "Solo tenéis ojos el uno para el otro."
    "You only have eyes for each other."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:316
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_09994c39:

    # "Tendréis que volver para ver la puesta de sol otro día."
    "You'll have to come back to watch the sunset another day."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:317
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_78aefecf:

    # "Lo haréis."
    "And you will."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:318
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_f22f5d53:

    # "Y volveréis a perdérosla."
    "And you'll miss it again."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:321
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_9537abf0:

    # "Ni siquiera os habéis dado cuenta de que [saa] ha encendido las luces en algún momento."
    "You didn't even notice that [saa] turned on the lights at some point."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:322
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_a0c3a3d5:

    # mc "Parece que nos hemos perdido la puesta de sol."
    mc "Looks like we missed the sunset."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:323
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_9b0f8974:

    # ama "Había algo más interesante que mirar."
    ama "There was something more interesting to look at."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:324
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_2ebb5df0:

    # mc "Esa debería haber sido mi frase..."
    mc "That should've been my line..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:325
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1704db63:

    # ama "Somos un equipo. Da lo mismo quién diga las frases."
    ama "We're a team. It doesn't matter who says the lines."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:327
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7fdab66d:

    # ama "¿Sabes bucear?"
    ama "Do you know how to dive?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:328
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ae23b10c:

    # mc "¿En plan bombonas de oxígeno y esas cosas? No lo he hecho nunca, pero no debe ser {b}tan{/b} difícil, ¿no?"
    mc "Like with oxygen tanks and stuff? I've never done it, but it can't be {b}that{/b} hard, right?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:329
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_da5e3d4c:

    # ama "Es más difícil de lo que parece. Pero me refería a hacer snorkel."
    ama "It's harder than it looks. But I meant snorkeling and skin diving."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:330
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_339ee637:

    # mc "¡Ah, sí! Eso sí que sé hacerlo."
    mc "Oh, yeah! I definitely know how to do that."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:332
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_a1363d08:

    # ama "Entonces vámonos. [car] me ha enviado la dirección de un sitio donde hacen inmersiones nocturnas."
    ama "Then let's go. [car] sent me the address of a place where they do night dives."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:333
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_9b5dddfb:

    # mc "¿Ahora?"
    mc "Now?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:335
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_c3531e5a:

    # ama "*Risa* Hacer inmersiones nocturnas cuando es de día no tiene demasiada gracia. Aparte de que es imposible."
    ama "*Laugh* Doing night dives during the day isn't very fun. Besides, it's impossible."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:336
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6f56ef04:

    # mc "*Risa* Vale, soy tonto. ¡Pero [car] quiere matarme!"
    mc "*Laugh* Okay, I'm an idiot. But [car] wants to kill me!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:338
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_e161fd1b:

    # ama "Ha sido idea mía. Le he preguntado a ella si sabía de algún sitio donde pudiéramos hacer snorkel."
    ama "It was my idea. I asked her if she knew a place where we could do it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:339
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6a5fdb75:

    # ama "Estoy segura de que ninguna de tus citas ha tenido una sesión de buceo."
    ama "I'm sure none of your dates have included a diving session."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:340
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_29f1bdca:

    # mc "Una vez más aciertas. Y una vez más, la caja de sorpresas de [ama] parece que no tiene fondo."
    mc "Once again, you're right. And once again, [ama]'s box of surprises seems bottomless."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:342
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_4a189bfb:

    # "Antes de que puedas ir a pagar, [ama] te da un apasionado beso a la luz de las estrellas."
    "Before you can go pay, [ama] gives you a passionate kiss under the light of the stars."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:343
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_011d3867:

    # "La cita está siendo fantástica."
    "The date is going fantastic."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:346
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b6211181:

    # "Una vez pagas la cuenta y os despedís de [saa], de vuelta en el coche..."
    "Once you pay the bill and say goodbye to [saa], back in the car..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:347
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_0f007347:

    # ama "¿Te lo estás pasando bien? ¿La cita está yendo como pensabas?"
    ama "Are you having a good time? Is the date going as you expected?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:348
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_52af21d5:

    # mc "La cena y el sitio han sido geniales. Y la compañía inmejorable."
    mc "The dinner and the place were great. And the company was unbeatable."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:349
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_bbe48600:

    # mc "Pero, otra vez, esa debía ser mi frase."
    mc "But, again, that was supposed to be my line."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:350
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_bf1c000c:

    # mc "¿Qué tal tu primera cita?"
    mc "How's your first date?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:352
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_9eed93bf:

    # ama "Con ganas de que no termine nunca. Y con ganas de que acabe."
    ama "Wanting it to never end. And wanting it to be over."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:353
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_3af1be9b:

    # mc "Sabes que no tenemos por qué ir a hacer snorkel si no quieres, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You know we don't have to go snorkeling if you don't want to, right?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:354
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_feba2e80:

    # mc "Si tienes ganas de que acabe, habrá más días en los que podamos hacerlo."
    mc "If you want it to end, there will be other days we can do it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:356
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_4e4dc524:

    # ama "Pero entonces no sería una primera cita memorable."
    ama "But then it wouldn't be a memorable first date."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:357
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_c9346d2d:

    # mc "*Risa* Esta vez te equivocas. Ya es memorable."
    mc "*Laugh* You're wrong this time. It's already memorable."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:359
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b3e22bf7:

    # ama "Dentro de 20 años, si tenemos hijos y te preguntan cómo fue nuestra primera cita..."
    ama "In 20 years, if we have kids and they ask how our first date was..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:360
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ffb3119e:

    # ama "¿Quieres decirles 'fuimos a cenar y ya está'?"
    ama "Do you want to tell them 'we went to dinner and that was it'?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:361
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_25b5c5de:

    # mc "*Risa* Me da lo mismo lo que piensen esos pequeños granujas sobre nuestra primera cita."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't care what those little rascals think about our first date."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:362
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_90bf980e:

    # mc "Además, no ha sido solo una cena."
    mc "Besides, it wasn't just a dinner."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:364
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ef922001:

    # ama "*Risa* Sí, sí. *Imitando a [mc]* 'Me pasé dos horas viendo cómo el sol poniente se reflejaba en los ojos de vuestra madre.'"
    ama "*Laugh* Yeah, yeah. *Imitating [mc]* 'I spent two hours watching the setting sun reflecting in your mother's eyes.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:365
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_825d0bce:

    # ama "'El mar palidecía de envidia ante tanta belleza. El universo paró el tiempo para que la puesta de sol durara más solo para nosotros.'"
    ama "'The sea paled with envy before such beauty. The universe stopped time so the sunset would last longer just for us.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:366
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_77e751de:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿De verdad sueno tan cursi?"
    mc "*Laugh* Do I really sound that cheesy?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:368
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_8502cadb:

    # ama "Eso era una imitación diluida de tu cursilería. Pero no por ello me gusta menos."
    ama "That was a watered-down imitation of your cheesiness. But I don't like it any less for it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:369
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_014601af:

    # mc "*Imitando a un tipo rudo* A ver, tú, conductora. ¿Falta mucho para llegar? ¡Conduces como una abuela!"
    mc "*Imitating a tough guy* Hey, you, driver. Are we there yet? You drive like a grandma!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:371
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b936ee4d:

    # ama "*Risa* Ni intentándolo te sale bien, [mc]. No va en tu carácter hablar así."
    ama "*Laugh* You can't even get it right when you try, [mc]. It's not in your character to talk like that."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:372
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_603a1586:

    # ama "Y nadie quiere que lo hagas o ni siquiera que intentes cambiar. Eres un tipo duro en muchos otros sentidos."
    ama "And nobody wants you to, or even wants you to try to change. You're a tough guy in many other ways."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:373
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_5bcf09f4:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que es la primera vez que alguien me llama tipo duro."
    mc "*Laugh* I think that's the first time anyone's called me a tough guy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:375
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_e0f88d70:

    # ama "Poca gente ha visto cómo trataste a [kev] o a [sol]."
    ama "Few people have seen how you dealt with [kev] or [sol]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:376
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_d9ff6e54:

    # ama "Alguien no es duro por cómo habla, sino por cómo se comporta cuando de verdad importa."
    ama "Someone isn't tough because of how they talk, but because of how they act when it really matters."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:377
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_c53c0510:

    # mc "Bueno, con [sol] me tuvisteis que salvar el culo [eva] y tú. Y si no hubieras llegado a casa de [sca]..."
    mc "Well, with [sol], [eva] and you had to save my ass. And if you hadn't shown up at [sca]'s house..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:379
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_e8c9cbd6:

    # ama "Eso no es importante. Lo que importa es que [kia] formaba parte de la familia y la defendiste."
    ama "That's not important. What matters is that [kia] was part of the family and you defended her."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:380
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_5cd8c9d0:

    # ama "Que defendiste a [sca] en su casa, enfrentándote a [kev]. Yo solo evité que te denunciaran."
    ama "That you defended [sca] in her house, confronting [kev]. I just stopped him from pressing charges against you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:381
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_72dd2ab2:

    # ama "Que te enfrentaste a unos mercenarios armados cuando [erc] os retuvo en casa de [nor]."
    ama "That you faced armed mercenaries when [erc] held you hostage at [nor]'s house."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:383
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ab03d45d:

    # ama "Que le paraste los pies a [ich] cuando fue necesario para defender a [kim]."
    ama "That you stopped [ich] in his tracks when it was necessary to defend [kim]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:384
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1b59a524:

    # ama "Muchos de esos tipos rudos a los que intentabas imitar se hubieran arrugado en esas circunstancias."
    ama "A lot of those tough guys you were trying to imitate would have folded under those circumstances."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:386
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1c3a390f:

    # ama "Y, por cierto, ya hemos llegado. No vuelvas a decir que conduzco como una abuela."
    ama "And, by the way, we've arrived. Don't ever say I drive like a grandma again."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:387
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_d2645100:

    # mc "*Risa* Mientras no te diga que cocinas como una abuela, no te puedes quejar."
    mc "*Laugh* As long as I don't say you cook like a grandma, you can't complain."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:389
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_94fb603e:

    # "Pagáis por la excursión y subís a un precioso velero en el que os ponéis unos trajes de neopreno."
    "You pay for the excursion and board a beautiful sailboat where you put on some wetsuits."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:390
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_ce1d816b:

    # "El tipo del barco os dice que habéis tenido suerte. Estaréis solos durante la excursión."
    "The guy on the boat tells you that you got lucky. You'll be alone during the excursion."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:391
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_be06eba6:

    # "En la excursión anterior había ocho turistas rusos. Algunos borrachos. Dice que no ha sido una experiencia agradable."
    "On the previous excursion, there were eight Russian tourists. Some of them drunk. He says it wasn't a pleasant experience."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:393
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_eedc870d:

    # "Después de navegar un rato..."
    "After sailing for a while..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:394
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b69a5b0c:

    # usn "Bueno, hemos llegado. Tan solo tenéis que disfrutar."
    usn "Well, we've arrived. All you have to do now, is to enjoy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:395
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_a5d3b85c:

    # "Habla con un acento colombiano tan fuerte que hace que [oma] parezca una nativa de Oxford."
    "He speaks with a Colombian accent so thick it makes [oma] sound like an Oxford native."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:396
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_47df0b8f:

    # usn "Yo iluminaré las zonas más chulas con ese reflector de ahí atrás. Tenéis 45 minutos para disfrutar."
    usn "I'll light up the coolest areas with that spotlight back there. You have 45 minutes to enjoy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:398
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_fa5a7068:

    # ama "¿Hay alguna indicación de seguridad?"
    ama "Are there any safety guidelines?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:399
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_6ec9608d:

    # "Desde luego, a [ama] le queda mejor su traje de neopreno que a ti el tuyo."
    "Of course, [ama] looks better in her wetsuit than you do in yours."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:401
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_2768801e:

    # usn "*Risa* No os olvidéis de subir a la superficie a respirar."
    usn "*Laugh* Don't forget to come up to the surface to breathe."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:402
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_b446bb87:

    # usn "Hablo en serio. No esperéis a que os falte el aire."
    usn "I'm serious. Don't wait until you run out of air."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:403
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_8dc5f1df:

    # usn "Es fácil perder la noción del tiempo ahí abajo, rodeados de tanta belleza."
    usn "It's easy to lose track of time down there, surrounded by so much beauty."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:404
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1c66e79f:

    # "Por la mirada del marinero, que recorre a [ama] de arriba a abajo, sabes a qué belleza se refiere."
    "By the sailor's gaze, which looks at [ama] up and down, you know what beauty he's referring to."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:405
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_c8e651fa:

    # mc "Avísanos a {b}mi esposa{/b} y a mí cuando el tiempo se esté agotando, por favor."
    mc "Please let {b}my wife{/b} and me know when time is running out."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:407
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_c9f46f43:

    # "Se da cuenta de que le has pillado mirando a tu esposa y responde visiblemente nervioso."
    "He realizes you've caught him staring at your wife and replies, visibly nervous."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:408
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7dbc1dc1:

    # usn "S-sí, sí... hare p-parpadear las l-luces cuando se e-empiece a agotar el t-tiempo..."
    usn "Y-yeah, yeah... I'll f-flash the l-lights when t-time starts running o-out..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:409
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_7215a44c:

    # "Quizás no necesites hablar como un tipo duro después de todo."
    "Maybe you don't need to talk like a tough guy after all."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:412
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_0383fa8f:

    # ama "*Susurrando* ¿Ves como no te hace falta parecer un leñador para impresionar a la gente?"
    ama "*Whispering* See? You don't need to look or talk like a lumberjack to impress people."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:413
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_1e075c3c:

    # mc "No quería impresionar a nadie. Quería dejar claro que ahora eres mi esposa."
    mc "I didn't want to impress anyone. I wanted to make it clear that you're my wife now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:416
translate english c32s001_AmaDate_5b9eaca9:

