    # ama "Le he preguntado a [car], y tienes la agenda despejada durante toda la mañana."
    ama "I asked [car], and your schedule is clear for the whole morning."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1152
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_c9c869d9:

    # mc "¿Dónde vamos?"
    mc "Where are we going?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1154
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3089f2d7:

    # ama "Querías ver el campo de entrenamiento, ¿no?"
    ama "You wanted to see the training camp, right?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1155
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1042eedd:

    # ama "Ahora está casi vacío, con lo que es un buen momento."
    ama "It's almost empty right now, so it's a good time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1156
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_35c82184:

    # mc "¿Casi vacío? No tenemos demasiadas misiones en marcha."
    mc "Almost empty? We don't have that many missions going on."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1158
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5cef495a:

    # ama "*Risa* Es posible que le haya dicho a [aar] que mande a los chicos de maniobras hasta la tarde."
    ama "*Laugh* I might have told [aar] to send the boys on maneuvers until the afternoon."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1159
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_102ad838:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿No quieres que me junte con tipos duros?"
    mc "*Laugh* You don't want me hanging out with tough guys?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1161
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_7f2f6e54:

    # ama "No quiero que te juntes con NIÑOS duros. Aún no están preparados para conocerte."
    ama "I don't want you hanging out with tough KIDS. They aren't ready to meet you yet."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1162
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_78a2e242:

    # mc "¿Todavía entrenamos a los niños?"
    mc "We're still training the kids?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1163
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_0452cf97:

    # ama "Sí. Aún no has decidido qué hacer con ellos y [aar] no quiere que estén ociosos y perdiendo el tiempo."
    ama "Yes. You haven't decided what to do with them yet, and [aar] doesn't want them sitting idle and wasting time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1164
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_0a135cd4:

    # mc "Decidir qué hacer con ellos se acaba de convertir en una de mis principales prioridades. Yo creía que..."
    mc "Deciding what to do with them just became one of my top priorities. I thought..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1166
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3781b298:

    # ama "¿Creías que [aar] iba a tomar esa decisión por ti? No puede hacerlo."
    ama "Did you think [aar] was going to make that decision for you? He can't."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1167
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5beb8d55:

    # ama "Es una orden que tiene que salir de este despacho. Sólo la puedes tomar tú."
    ama "It's an order that has to come from this office. Only you can make it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1168
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_29c99abf:

    # mc "¿Nos reunimos mañana y hablamos de eso? También tenemos que hablar del resto de peticiones que hicieron los operativos."
    mc "Should we meet tomorrow and talk about it? We also need to discuss the rest of the requests the operatives made."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1169
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5394274e:

    # mc "Pero quiero a los chicos más jóvenes lejos de las armas lo antes posible."
    mc "But I want the younger kids away from weapons as soon as possible."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1171
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e79f43ef:

    # ama "Creo que es una buena idea. Hay que buscar algo que hacer con ellos."
    ama "I think it's a good idea. But we need to find something to do with them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1172
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_91ec79dd:

    # ama "El problema lo tendrás con quien quiera ser operativo de campo. ¿Qué vas a hacer si uno de ellos quiere seguir entrenando con armas?"
    ama "You'll have a problem with anyone who wants to be a field operative. What are you going to do if one of them wants to keep training with weapons?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1173
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_52ee661c:

    # mc "Creo que ese es un puente que deberemos cruzar cuando se den las circunstancias."
    mc "I think that's a bridge we'll cross when we get to it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1174
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b57a80cf:

    # mc "Pero me parece que voy a tener que actuar como si fueran chicos normales. Hay una edad para el colegio y una edad para tomar decisiones."
    mc "But I think I'm going to have to act like they're normal kids. There's an age for school and an age for making decisions."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1176
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a45ddc36:

    # ama "*Risa* ¿Te das cuenta de que acabas de usar la palabra 'normales' para dejar a nuestros chicos fuera de ella?"
    ama "*Laugh* Do you realize you just used the word 'normal' to leave our kids out of it?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1177
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_32990a61:

    # mc "No me había dado cuenta. Y no me parece gracioso."
    mc "I didn't realize it. And I don't think it's funny."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1178
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ba32d449:

    # ama "Lo que me parece gracioso a mí es que hace unos días querías echarle la bronca a [alb] por lo mismo."
    ama "What I think is funny is that a few days ago you wanted to tell [alb] off for the exact same thing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1179
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_54283b73:

    # mc "Tienes razón. A veces el lenguaje nos juega malas pasadas porque estamos acostumbrados a usarlo de una forma concreta."
    mc "You're right. Sometimes language plays tricks on us because we're used to using it in a specific way."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1180
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_c58e2da7:

    # mc "Pero nunca me oirás usar 'humanos' para dejar a los clones fuera de esa palabra. O al menos eso espero."
    mc "But you'll never hear me use 'humans' to leave clones out of that word. Or at least I hope not."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1182
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_f9c39b1b:

    # ama "Yo también lo espero. Y ahora vístete. Los tejanos no son un buen atuendo para el campo de entrenamiento."
    ama "I hope so too. Now get dressed. Jeans aren't a good outfit for the training camp."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1183
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_006b4b86:

    # mc "¿Me vas a poner a correr alrededor de los muros?"
    mc "Are you going to make me run around the walls?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1185
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_45da8c5a:

    # ama "¿Ya sabes lo de los muros? ¿[aar] te ha llevado allí?"
    ama "You already know about the walls? Did [aar] take you there?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1186
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e8a68b02:

    # mc "No, pero he consultado planos. Y me he quedado impresionado."
    mc "No, but I've checked the blueprints. And I was impressed."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1187
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_c8bbda3f:

    # mc "Los muros parecen lo suficientemente extensos como para que no sea agradable correr alrededor con este calor."
    mc "The walls seem extensive enough that it wouldn't be pleasant to run around them in this heat."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1189
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_9cf08c40:

    # ama "Entonces será mejor que te vistas rápido. O tendré que ponerte a correr."
    ama "Then you'd better get dressed quickly. Or I'll have to make you run."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1190
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_507f27d6:

    # mc "¡A sus órdenes, mi comandante!"
    mc "At your command, Ma'am!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1192
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_83d048aa:

    # "Esta vez, [ama] conduce el mismo destartalado Humvee por una carretera normal."
    "This time, [ama] drives the same beat-up Humvee down a normal road."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1193
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_7a72735a:

    # "Supones que los camiones de transporte necesitan asfalto por el que circular."
    "You assume the transport trucks need asphalt to drive on."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1195
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_9377038d:

    # "Tras pocos minutos, llegáis a la base principal. Es grande, pero no tanto como creías."
    "After a few minutes, you arrive at the main base. It's big, but not as big as you thought."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1196
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_2a23c3a3:

    # "Los planos parecen haberte engañado. Aquí no cabe una pista de aterrizaje."
    "The blueprints seem to have fooled you. An airstrip wouldn't fit here."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1197
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4758d1c4:

    # "La base está vacía, excepto por unos cuantos guardias en las torres de vigilancia."
    "The base is empty, except for a few guards in the watchtowers."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1199
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_92862130:

    # mc "Creía que sería más grande."
    mc "I thought it would be bigger."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1200
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_0c46102b:

    # ama "Seguramente los planos que consultaste están desactualizados."
    ama "The blueprints you checked are probably outdated."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1201
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_f7b9a57f:

    # ama "Esto se construyó hace un par de años, para imitar un puesto avanzado estadounidense en Jordania."
    ama "This was built a couple of years ago to mimic an American outpost in Jordan."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1202
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_dd973a24:

    # ama "Excepto por el desierto, claro."
    ama "Except for the desert, of course."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1203
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a9f7e2b1:

    # mc "Entonces, ¿la pista de aterrizaje y los hangares...?"
    mc "So, the airstrip and the hangars...?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1205
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_0e384c41:

    # ama "Están más allá del muro norte. Un par de aviones de transporte, tres de entrenamiento, y un par más de helicópteros están allí."
    ama "They're beyond the north wall. A couple of transport planes, three training planes, and a couple more helicopters are there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1206
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_0b0708ad:

    # ama "Los veremos cuando acabe de enseñarte esto."
    ama "We'll see them when I'm done showing you this."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1207
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5bf71cb7:

    # ama "Y no, no tenemos aviones de combate por la misma razón por la que no tenemos tanques."
    ama "And no, we don't have fighter jets for the same reason we don't have tanks."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1208
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_082b3008:

    # ama "Lo más parecido que verás es esa belleza negra de ahí."
    ama "The closest thing you'll see is that black beauty over there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1209
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_819af20e:

    # mc "¿Eso es un helicóptero de ataque?"
    mc "Is that an attack helicopter?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1211
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_d4e01ea4:

    # ama "Ahora más bien es un helicóptero de apoyo a tierra. Es un AH-60L."
    ama "Now it's more of a ground support helicopter. It's an AH-60L."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1212
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8546ac1d:

    # ama "Este lo... robaron unos D en Riohacha. Tiene ametralladoras y cohetes, pero no misiles Hellfire. Otra vez, no tenemos y no los necesitamos."
    ama "This one was... stolen by some D's in Riohacha. It has machine guns and rockets, but no Hellfire missiles. Again, we don't have them and we don't need them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1213
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5511b27c:

    # mc "*Jadeo de sorpresa* ¿Robamos equipo a nuestros clientes?"
    mc "*Surprised Gasp* We steal equipment from our customers?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1215
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_2d4448b2:

    # ama "Robo o pago en especie. Como prefieras llamarlo."
    ama "Theft or payment in kind. Whatever you prefer to call it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1216
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_25261f89:

    # ama "No es política oficial de la empresa, pero si se niegan a pagar... No arriesgamos la vida por nada."
    ama "It's not official company policy, but if they refuse to pay... We don't risk our lives for nothing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1217
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_bb0d884a:

    # "Te das cuenta de que, pese a todo, esa frase demuestra una lealtad a la empresa difícil de entender en el mundo fuera de NTR."
    "You realize that, despite everything, that sentence shows a loyalty to the company that's hard to understand in the world outside of NTR."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1219
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_fd08b1fe:

    # ama "No ha habido más problemas con los pagos de Colombia."
    ama "There haven't been any more problems with payments from Colombia."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1220
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8091043c:

    # ama "La pérdida de ese helicóptero les dolió más a ellos del beneficio que nos aporta a nosotros."
    ama "The loss of that helicopter hurt them more than the benefit it brings us."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1221
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b3961c59:

    # mc "¿Por qué?"
    mc "Why?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1223
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e9f6640a:

    # ama "Tenemos una capacidad de despliegue limitada. No nos lo podemos llevar a una misión a Camboya, por ejemplo."
    ama "We have limited deployment capabilities. We can't take it on a mission to Cambodia, for example."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1224
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5d434da7:

    # ama "Bueno, podríamos, pero el gobierno americano no estaría muy contento si lo hiciéramos. Demasiado cerca de China, por si lo perdemos."
    ama "Well, we could, but the American government wouldn't be very happy if we did. Too close to China, in case we lose it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1225
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_f9d06dcf:

    # ama "Y no tenemos la infraestructura para sacarle todo el partido posible. Recambios, armamento, etc."
    ama "And we don't have the infrastructure to get the most out of it. Spare parts, weaponry, etc."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1226
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_15a161b6:

    # ama "Pero nos sirve para entrenar, por si necesitamos volar en uno algún día."
    ama "But it's useful for training, in case we need to fly one someday."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1227
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5a02179d:

    # mc "O si necesitamos robar otro."
    mc "Or if we need to steal another one."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1229
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_63310262:

    # ama "*Risa* Exacto. La próxima vez, intentaremos no matar a ningún soldado en el proceso."
    ama "*Laugh* Exactly. Next time, we'll try not to kill any soldiers in the process."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1230
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1de43f72:

    # "Lo casual de la frase, dicha entre risas, te hiela la sangre en las venas."
    "The casualness of the phrase, said between laughs, makes your blood run cold."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1231
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_6389fc17:

    # ama "*Risa* Pero no aseguramos nada. Paga para asegurarte de que no necesitamos hacerlo."
    ama "*Laugh* But we make no promises. Pay up to make sure we don't need to."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1232
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3f645419:

    # "No habías caído en la cuenta de que, para robar un helicóptero, los D tuvieron que matar a soldados colombianos."
    "You hadn't realized that, to steal a helicopter, the D's had to kill Colombian soldiers."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1235
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_90d4ac56:

    # ama "¡Oh! ¡Mierda!"
    ama "Oh! Shit!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1236
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e8bdf55d:

    # ama "¿He dicho eso riéndome?"
    ama "Did I say that laughing?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1237
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ebb33a63:

    # mc "Me temo que sí..."
    mc "I'm afraid so..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1239
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a495d38f:

    # ama "Ahora mismo me siento inhumana..."
    ama "Right now I feel inhuman..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1241
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8ed395fb:

    # ama "Tanto como nos ven los que consideran que los clones no somos personas..."
    ama "Just like how those who don't consider clones to be people see us..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1242
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_57f14506:

    # ama "Esos soldados tendrían madres y familia que los echarán de menos..."
    ama "Those soldiers must have had mothers and families who will miss them..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1243
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_65f9676b:

    # mc "Sí..."
    mc "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1246
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ca5334ee:

    # ama "Todos celebramos cuando Dax y [dec] trajeron ese helicóptero."
    ama "We all celebrated when Dax and [dec] brought that helicopter back."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1247
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_fd4f4e50:

    # ama "Colombia nos había intentado robar y nosotros les habíamos robado a ellos."
    ama "Colombia had tried to rob us and we had robbed them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1248
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e73abae1:

    # ama "Nadie pensó en los 14 soldados que mataron entre los dos para llevarse el pájaro. A nadie le importaba."
    ama "No one thought about the 14 soldiers they killed between the two of them to take the bird. No one cared."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1249
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_6700eb92:

    # mc "No sabíais lo que era una familia más allá de estos muros. Era vosotros contra el resto del mundo."
    mc "You didn't know what a family was beyond these walls. It was you against the rest of the world."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1250
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e7668583:

    # mc "Tú ahora lo sabes. Y entiendes lo que es la pérdida, o lo que sentirían [mar], [nor] o [emm] si no volvieras a casa de una misión."
    mc "Now you know. And you understand what loss is, or what [mar], [nor], or [emm] would feel if you didn't come home from a mission."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1252
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_7456d26c:

    # ama "En [mar] es en la primera que he pensado."
    ama "[mar] is the first one I thought of."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1253
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_15784a87:

    # ama "Y me he sentido avergonzada por lo que ella pensaría si me oyera decir eso..."
    ama "And I feel ashamed of what she would think if she heard me say that while I was laughing..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1254
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_12748f12:

    # mc "Estás cambiando, [ama]. Y eso es bueno. Pero es un proceso. No esperes ser una persona diferente de hoy para mañana."
    mc "You're changing, [ama]. And that's good. But it's a process. Don't expect to be a different person overnight."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1256
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8af89b15:

    # ama "Es... tan difícil."
    ama "It's... so hard."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1257
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_26fbc775:

    # mc "No es difícil, [ama]. Es algo que requiere aprendizaje."
    mc "It's not hard, [ama]. It's something that requires learning."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1258
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3c091858:

    # mc "Mientras tú aprendías a disparar bazookas y a hablar 30 idiomas, nosotros aprendíamos a vivir en familia, a sentir empatía."
    mc "While you were learning to shoot bazookas and speak 30 languages, we were learning to live as a family, to feel empathy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1259
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_7cecae76:

    # mc "En menos de un mes has hecho un curso intensivo sobre familia y empatía, pero..."
    mc "In less than a month you've taken a crash course on family and empathy, but..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1261
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a66b9a63:

    # ama "Pero aún hablo el idioma de la empatía con un acento extraño, ¿no?"
    ama "But I still speak the language of empathy with a weird accent, right?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1262
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e62dd4bb:

    # mc "Me gusta la analogía. Sí, es exactamente eso. Y de vez en cuando se te escapa una palabra en tu idioma nativo."
    mc "I like the analogy. Yes, that's exactly it. And every now and then a word in your native language slips out."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1263
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3bc0cfcd:

    # mc "Pero eso se arregla con la práctica."
    mc "But that gets fixed with practice."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1265
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e0260a26:

    # "En ese momento, oís cómo se abren las puertas de la copia del puesto avanzado."
    "At that moment, you hear the gates of the replica outpost open."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1266
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ccd8fce5:

    # "Un camión de transporte de tropas hace su aparición."
    "A troop transport truck makes its appearance."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1268
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_09eeff9d:

    # mc "Creía que íbamos a estar solos..."
    mc "I thought we were going to be alone..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1269
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1d7c36fe:

    # ama "Yo también. Nadie tenía que volver en dos horas más, al menos."
    ama "Me too. No one was supposed to be back for another two hours, at least."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1271
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a903f090:

    # mc "Hola, [dam]... Espera, tú no eres [dam]."
    mc "Hey, [dam]... Wait, you're not [dam]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1276
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_c35ea246:

    # dec "Hola, Señor. Soy [dec]. ¿Cómo lo ha sabido?"
    dec "Hello, Sir. I'm [dec]. How did you know?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1278
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_522a4dbc:

    # dam "Porque soy inconfundible, [dec]. Creo que no me cansaré de decirlo."
    dam "Because I'm unmistakable, [dec]. I don't think I'll ever get tired of saying it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1280
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_eeaa3e2f:

    # dam "Hey, [ama] y [mc]."
    dam "Hey, [ama] and [mc]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1281
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b8710cc5:

    # mc "Hola, [dam]. Tenía entendido que estaríais de maniobras todo el día."
    mc "Hey, [dam]. I thought you guys would be on maneuvers all day."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1282
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4555acbd:

    # dam "Uno de los chicos se ha hecho daño."
    dam "One of the guys got hurt."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1284
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e5b8eb24:

    # dam "Llevad a Henry a la enfermería mientras yo hablo con el... jefe."
    dam "Take Henry to the infirmary while I talk to the... boss."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1285
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a6c4ce43:

    # "Los 'chicos' que han bajado del camión podrían tener tu edad. Se han quedado mirando tu interacción con [dam] y [dec]."
    "The 'guys' who got off the truck could be your age. They've been staring at your interaction with [dam] and [dec]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1286
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b1d39e06:

    # dec "No te preocupes, Dam. Ya les acompaño yo."
    dec "Don't worry, Dam. I'll go with them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1287
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_c578bcfc:

    # dec "Chicos, dejad de mirar embobados y seguidme."
    dec "Guys, stop gawking at the boss and follow me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1290
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_52fc87e2:

    # mc "¿El chico está bien?"
    mc "Is the kid okay?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1291
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_abbbed43:

    # dam "Sí, una torcedura de tobillo. Los H son pequeños pero duros. Estará andando en un par de horas."
    dam "Yeah, a sprained ankle. The H's are small but tough. He'll be walking in a couple of hours."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1292
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_70936128:

    # dam "Hemos avisado a la base y Doc ha dicho que estará aquí en cinco o seis minutos."
    dam "We've notified the base and Doc said he'll be here in five or six minutes."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1293
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_7f952e9c:

    # "Algunos de los H y un G, crees que es [gid], se han refugiado a la sombra de una tienda. Observándoos."
    "Some of the H's and a G, you think it's [gid], have taken shelter in the shade of a tent. Watching you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1295
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_74226d1c:

    # "Ni [dam] ni [ama] se molestan en presentártelos. Susurran con poco disimulo."
    "Neither [dam] nor [ama] bother to introduce you to them. They whisper with little subtlety."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1296
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_13e3bbec:

    # cl1 "*Susurrando* ¿Cómo se atreve a vestirse como uno de nosotros? ¿Se va a poner a entrenar?"
    cl1 "*Whispering* How dare he dress like one of us? Is he going to train?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1297
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_fd7edea0:

    # cl2 "*Susurrando* [gav] y [fred] dicen que es diferente, pero hasta que no lo vea..."
    cl2 "*Whispering* [gav] and [fred] say he's different, but until I see it..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1299
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_7966bd9f:

    # mc "¿No hay médico en el puesto avanzado?"
    mc "Isn't there a doctor at the outpost?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1300
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_eee74502:

    # dam "[carl] actúa como enfermero. Los C son buenos con las cosas técnicas y él ya no puede combatir."
    dam "[carl] acts as a nurse. The C's are good with technical stuff and he can't fight anymore."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1301
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_be52efb0:

    # mc "¿Sólo tenéis un enfermero?"
    mc "You only have one nurse?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1302
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a1f246ea:

    # gid "*Susurrando* Yo lo vi en la sala de espera mientras lo operaban..."
    gid "*Whispering* I saw him in the waiting room while [gav] was in surgery..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1303
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_55b3d01b:

    # cl1 "*Susurrando* Seguro que lo único que le importaba era si la operación salía bien y podía vender el brazo."
    cl1 "*Whispering* I bet the only thing he cared about was if the surgery went well and he could sell the arm."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1304
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1226a41c:

    # cl2 "*Susurrando* A mí me dijeron que se quedó hasta el último momento. Incluso cuando la operación ya había acabado."
    cl2 "*Whispering* I was told he stayed until the very last moment. Even after the surgery was already over."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1305
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a8c05bbf:

    # cl3 "*Susurrando* Yo también lo vi. Y no era la cara de preocupación de alguien que piensa cuánto dinero puede sacar."
    cl3 "*Whispering* I saw him too. And it wasn't the worried face of someone thinking about how much money they can make."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1307
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_82a8419d:

    # ama "No es una zona de combate, sino de entrenamiento. Seguramente [carl] no ve a más de un chico al día."
    ama "It's not a combat zone, it's a training ground. [carl] probably doesn't see more than one guy a day."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1308
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1ac44143:

    # ama "Y Doc posiblemente no tenga que venir más de una vez al mes."
    ama "And Doc probably doesn't have to come more than once a month."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1309
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_386896de:

    # cl1 "*Susurrando* Seguro que quiere ahorrar la gasolina que usa Doc cuando viene."
    cl1 "*Whispering* I bet he just wants to save on the gas Doc uses when he comes."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1310
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1a2de688:

    # cl3 "*Susurrando* ¿No lo has oído? Lo primero que ha hecho es preguntar por Henry."
    cl3 "*Whispering* Didn't you hear? The first thing he did was to ask about Henry."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1311
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_46228ead:

    # cl2 "*Susurrando* Parecía preocupado..."
    cl2 "*Whispering* He looked worried..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1313
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e2c47665:

    # dam "Chicos, ¿queréis ver cómo se desenvuelve el jefe en el viejo campo de tiro?"
    dam "Guys, you wanna see how the boss handles himself at the old shooting range?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1314
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_66b631dd:

    # mc "*Susurrando* ¿Qué haces?"
    mc "*Whispering* What are you doing?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1315
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_d80ccc61:

    # cl2 "¡Sí!"
    cl2 "Yeah!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1316
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_74435f2a:

    # cl1 "Si viste así, que se gane el derecho a hacerlo."
    cl1 "If he dresses like that, he should earn the right to do so."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1317
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_381504a5:

    # cl3 "No es necesario, pero me gustaría ver de qué pasta está hecho."
    cl3 "It's not necessary, but I'd like to see what he's made of."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1318
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_13416aa7:

    # dam "Creo que voy a darles una paliza a él y a [ama]."
    dam "I think I'm going to kick his and [ama]'s asses."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1320
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_f960e63f:

    # ama "*Susurrando* [dam], ¿qué estás haciendo? No está preparado."
    ama "*Whispering* [dam], what are you doing? He's not ready."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1322
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_73e30a03:

    # ama "No es necesario que lo hagas, [mc]. Creo que [dam] quiere dejarte en ridículo."
    ama "You don't have to do this, [mc]. I think [dam] wants to make a fool out of you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1323
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_df6d2739:

    # ama "Y a mí de paso también."
    ama "And out of me too, while he's at it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1324
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_40de2197:

    # mc "Lo voy a hacer, [ama]. No voy a fingir que soy alguien diferente de quién soy."
    mc "I'm going to do it, [ama]. I'm not going to pretend to be someone I'm not."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1326
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_475c75cb:

    # dam "Vamos al viejo campo de tiro. Señoritas, suban al camión."
    dam "Let's go to the old shooting range. Ladies, get in the truck."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1328
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_9de2bbd1:

    # "[dam] conduce durante unos minutos hasta llegar al campo de tiro."
    "[dam] drives for a few minutes until reaching the shooting range."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1329
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_0c63ec9d:

    # "El viaje en la parte trasera del camión es incómodo. Aparte de los tres H, sólo está [gid], el G al que conociste en la sala de espera."
    "The ride in the back of the truck is uncomfortable. Aside from the three H's, there's only [gid], the G you met in the waiting room."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1330
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_79ad38b7:

    # "Ninguno os dirige la palabra a [ama] o a ti. [ama] está sumida en un silencio extraño."
    "No one says a word to [ama] or you. [ama] is lost in a strange silence."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1331
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8a3bb6db:

    # "Ella seguramente está preguntándose que vehículo va a usar para atropellar a [dam]. Y arrepintiéndose de no tener un tanque."
    "She's probably wondering what vehicle she's going to use to run over [dam]. And regretting not having a tank."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1333
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_2f31eedc:

    # "Al llegar al campo de tiro, los clones se quedan a vuestra espalda, excepto [dam]..."
    "Upon arriving at the shooting range, the clones stay behind you, except for [dam]..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1334
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a108674e:

    # dam "Vamos a ponerlo fácil. 10 disparos, de pie, a 25 metros y sumamos puntuaciones."
    dam "Let's make it easy. 10 shots, standing, at 25 meters and we add up the scores."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1335
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_278f4e71:

    # ama "*Susurrando* Nunca ha disparado a 25 metros, [dam]."
    ama "*Whispering* He's never shot at 25 meters, [dam]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1337
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_69799174:

    # dam "Si se quiere vestir como nosotros, tiene que demostrar que es uno de nosotros. ¿Verdad, chicos?"
    dam "If he wants to dress like us, he has to prove he's one of us. Right, boys?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1339
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a23a6e36:

    # cl4 "*Gritando* ¡Sí!"
    cl4 "*Shouting* Yeah!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1341
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_16a67e4d:

    # dam "Que sea el original del viejo [aar] no va a eximirle de tener que enseñarnos lo bueno que es."
    dam "Him being old [aar]'s original isn't going to exempt him from having to show us how good he is."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1342
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_7446952a:

    # dam "Hank, trae mi pistola del camión y algunos cargadores."
    dam "Hank, get my gun from the truck and some magazines."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1344
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_0bf6647d:

    # cl2 "¿Qué?"
    cl2 "What?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1345
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_794b0a75:

    # cl1 "¿Tú lo sabías?"
    cl1 "Did you know?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1346
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_04bfcb4f:

    # gid "Yo los vi juntos el domingo... [dam] tiene razón."
    gid "I saw them together on Sunday... [dam] is right."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1347
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_93cac421:

    # cl3 "Os dije que era diferente..."
    cl3 "I told you he was different..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1349
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ee477e51:

    # dam "Las damas primero."
    dam "Ladies first."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1350
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3047d0c2:

    # ama "*Susurrando* Sigo sin entender qué quieres conseguir, capullo."
    ama "*Whispering* I still don't get what you're trying to pull, asshole."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1351
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_dfc207a7:

    # dam "Mueve ese culo hasta la posición de tiro y demuéstranos que no te has oxidado con la vida cómoda en Newport."
    dam "Move that ass to the shooting position and show us you haven't gotten rusty with your comfy life in Newport."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1352
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a9b9aa4d:

    # dam "Aquí tienes mi arma."
    dam "Here's my gun."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1354
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8fcfd3d3:

    # dam "*Risa* ¿Veis, chicos? Hay que ser delicados cuando se le da algo a una dama."
    dam "*Laugh* See, boys? You have to be gentle when you give something to a lady."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1356
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ee71ee81:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1357
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_96aef4f9:

    # "Ver a [ama] disparar sin esfuerzo aparente eso como ver a un leopardo persiguiendo a una gacela."
    "Watching [ama] shoot with no apparent effort is like watching a leopard chase a gazelle."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1358
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b812fa12:

    # "Concentrada, haciendo un arte de la economía de movimientos."
    "Focused, making an art out of economy of movement."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1360
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_070f6b7f:

    # "Preciosa y mortífera a la vez."
    "Beautiful and deadly at the same time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1362
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_967be4be:

    # "Mortífera."
    "Deadly."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1364
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ca34ba5e:

    # ama "Hecho. Hank, ve a contar las puntuaciones. Por favor."
    ama "Done. Hank, go count the scores. Please."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1368
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_cce713a9:

    # cl1 "Sí, Señora."
    cl1 "Yes, Ma'am."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1370
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_7446f74b:

    # "[cl1] vuelve al cabo de un minuto. Ha ido y ha vuelto corriendo. Ni siquiera ha empezado a sudar bajo el sol veraniego del Caribe."
    "[cl1] returns after a minute. He ran there and back. He hasn't even started sweating under the Caribbean summer sun."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1371
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_179b7413:

    # "Tú estás empapado en sudor. En parte por el calor, en parte por el nerviosismo de lo que está pasando."
    "You are drenched in sweat. Partly from the heat, partly from the nervousness of what is happening."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1372
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5905370c:

    # cl1 "97.5 puntos, [ama]. Dos de los disparos ha dado en el 9 y otro en la línea entre el 9 y el 10. El resto en el 10."
    cl1 "97.5 points, [ama]. Two of the shots hit the 9 and another on the line between the 9 and the 10. The rest in the 10."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1373
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e45d6dd6:

    # ama "Gracias, Hank."
    ama "Thanks, Hank."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1374
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_acda52cf:

    # dam "*Risa* ¿Estás desentrenada? Dame el arma."
    dam "*Laugh* Are you out of practice? Give me the gun."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1376
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_bc518237:

    # "[ama] descarga el arma y se la entrega a [dam]. Estás seguro de que ese cañón tiene que estar muy caliente."
    "[ama] unloads the gun and hands it to [dam]. You're sure that barrel must be really hot."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1377
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_d5ef2e16:

    # dam "Veo que te enseñamos bien. Seguridad ante todo."
    dam "I see we taught you well. Safety first."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1378
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_220dc0f6:

    # ama "*Susurrando* Sabes que quedan 7 balas en ese cargador, ¿verdad? No me hagas decir por dónde te las quiero meter ahora mismo."
    ama "*Whispering* You know there are 7 bullets left in that magazine, right? Don't make me say where I want to shove them right now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1379
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b391b72f:

    # mc "[ama]..."
    mc "[ama]..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1381
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_263a634e:

    # "Ambos te ignoran. [dam] vuelve a comprobar que la recámara está vacía antes de sacar un nuevo cargador."
    "They both ignore you. [dam] checks again that the chamber is empty before pulling out a new magazine."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1383
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_70ff9d7f:

    # dam "Tu turno, jefe..."
    dam "Your turn, boss..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1384
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1114cc9a:

    # "Hace el gesto de darte el arma en 'modo damisela' como ha dicho antes. No crees que sea la forma más segura de darle un arma a nadie."
    "He makes the gesture of handing you the gun in 'damsel mode' as he said before. You don't think it's the safest way to hand a gun to anyone."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1385
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_f2dda412:

    # dam "*Susurrando* Voy a dejar caer la pistola. No la cojas."
    dam "*Whispering* I'm going to drop the gun. Don't catch it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1386
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_969c08b9:

    # mc "*Susurrando* ¿Qué?"
    mc "*Whispering* What?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1388
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8d77159f:

    # "Sin dejarte reaccionar, [dam] deja caer el arma descargada de forma disimulada."
    "Without letting you react, [dam] discreetly drops the unloaded gun."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1389
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b43a6143:

    # "No entiendes nada de lo que está pasando."
    "You don't understand what's going on."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1391
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_80e5a899:

    # dam "Lo siento, jefe. Culpa mía. La he soltado antes de que la hubieras cogido. Pensaba que tendrías más reflejos."
    dam "Sorry, boss. My bad. I let it go before you grabbed it. I thought you'd have better reflexes."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1392
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_19b901d1:

    # mc "¿Gracias?"
    mc "Thanks?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1393
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4dc455aa:

    # "No entiendes a qué juega el mercenario."
    "You don't understand what game the mercenary is playing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1395
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ffa0f3d2:

    # dam "Tu turno, {b}jefe{/b}. Recuerda que las balas salen por el agujero de delante."
    dam "Your turn, {b}boss{/b}. Remember that the bullets come out of the hole in the front."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1396
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_62c6f937:

    # dam "*Susurrando* Haz muy desviado el primer disparo."
    dam "*Whispering* Make the first shot go way off."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1397
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a7583bcd:

    # dam "Y así es cómo se le entrega un arma a una {b}damisela con experiencia{/b}, chicos."
    dam "And that's how you hand a gun to an {b}experienced damsel{/b}, boys."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1398
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_430d4dfc:

    # dam "No lo intentéis con novatos. Ya veis lo que puede pasar."
    dam "Don't try this with rookies. You see what can happen."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1400
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_75aec83f:

    # "Te sitúas en la posición que te enseñó [eva], pero esta vez decides usar las dos manos."
    "You get into the stance [eva] taught you, but this time you decide to use both hands."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1401
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_20b86b0b:

    # "No se trata sólo de impresionar a una chica, sino a rudos mercenarios. Aunque la chica sea una ruda mercenaria."
    "It's not just about impressing a girl, but tough mercenaries. Even if the girl there is a tough mercenary."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1402
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e0a5ff4e:

    # "Y sabes que no te vas a acercar a la puntuación de [ama]. Si consigues acertar al blanco a esta distancia, claro."
    "And you know you're not going to get anywhere near [ama]'s score. If you even manage to hit the target from that distance, of course."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1403
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e10fbc1a:

    # "Una gota de sudor recorre tu nuca hasta juntarse con el mar de sudor que hay en tu espalda."
    "A drop of sweat runs down the back of your neck to join the sea of sweat on your back."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1404
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_63aac271:

    # "El blanco se ve lejísimos."
    "The target looks incredibly far away."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1406
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ee71ee81_1:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1407
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_218541ad:

    # "Intentas disparar bajo, tal y como [dam] te ha indicado. Obviamente, el blanco no se mueve."
    "You try to shoot low, just like [dam] told you to. Obviously, the target doesn't move."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1409
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_6de95574:

    # "Aparece una nube de polvo a la derecha del blanco, bastante arriba."
    "A dust cloud appears to the right of the target, pretty high up."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1411
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_865fa0cd:

    # dam "*Risa* ¿Eso es lo mejor que puedes hacer? Si algún día te enfrentas a un ejército de topos, a lo mejor les aciertas."
    dam "*Laugh* Is that the best you can do? If you ever face an army of moles, maybe you'll hit them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1412
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e0d54415:

    # cl1 "*Susurro risueño* Creo que desde que tenía siete años no he fallado tan estrepitosamente."
    cl1 "*Laughing whisper* I don't think I've missed that miserably since I was seven."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1413
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e68282f9:

    # cl2 "*Susurrando* No mientas. Por lo menos tenías ocho."
    cl2 "*Whispering* Don't lie. You were at least eight."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1414
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5c2c25ff:

    # cl3 "*Susurrando* Parece mentira que sea el original del viejo."
    cl3 "*Whispering* Hard to believe he's the old man's original."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1415
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1c899f33:

    # gid "*Susurrando* A lo mejor no está acostumbrado al peso de la Glock..."
    gid "*Whispering* Maybe he isn't used to the weight of the Glock..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1417
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1c30c8d9:

    # "Esto debía ser lo que quería [dam]. Dejarte en ridículo delante del resto de los chicos."
    "This must be what [dam] wanted. To make a fool of you in front of the rest of the guys."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1418
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_de2fa46e:

    # "Ajustas la puntería lo mejor que puedes. Con nueve balas no vas a poder llegar a la puntuación de [ama]."
    "You adjust your aim as best you can. With nine bullets you won't be able to reach [ama]'s score."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1419
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_2d8e903d:

    # "Posiblemente no lo conseguirías con 90 balas."
    "You probably wouldn't manage it with 90 bullets."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1420
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_00a996b8:

    # "Te concentras en el blanco, tal y como te enseñó [eva]."
    "You focus on the target, just like [eva] taught you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1422
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ee71ee81_2:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1423
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_cd78e42a:

    # "Haces los nueve disparos en rápida sucesión, ajustando levemente la posición entre disparos."
    "You fire the nine shots in quick succession, slightly adjusting your position between shots."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1424
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e11a2b20:

    # "Jurarías que la nube de polvo se ha levantado por detrás de la diana en cada uno de ellos, pero estabas demasiado concentrado para estar seguro."
    "You could swear the dust cloud kicked up behind the target on every single one of them, but you were too focused to be sure."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1427
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_df04cecb:

    # "Descargas el arma y se la entregas a [dam], mirándole directamente a los ojos desafiante."
    "You unload the weapon and hand it to [dam], looking him straight in the eyes defiantly."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1428
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_6f9d9285:

    # "Sabes que ha ganado, sea cual sea el juego al que está jugando."
    "You know he's won, whatever game he's playing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1429
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4d4a0b0d:

    # mc "Hecho."
    mc "Done."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1430
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b4729405:

    # dam "*Risa* Ten cuidado, no se te vaya a caer la pistola."
    dam "*Laugh* Careful, don't drop the gun."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1431
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_bf7c647c:

    # "Sin retirar la mirada de los ojos del mercenario..."
    "Without breaking eye contact with the mercenary..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1432
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_0f3b981c:

    # mc "[gid], ¿puedes ir a comprobar, por favor?"
    mc "[gid], can you go check the score, please?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1434
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_dec27729:

    # "Un minuto después..."
    "A minute later..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1435
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4e8b7ccc:

    # gid "48.5, Señor. Menos de la mitad que [ama]."
    gid "48.5, Sir. Less than half of [ama]'s."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1436
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_dbfa764d:

    # "En cualquier otra circunstancia te sentirías orgulloso de ti mismo. Pero aún no entiendes a qué está jugando [dam]."
    "Under any other circumstances, you'd feel proud of yourself. But you still don't understand what game [dam] is playing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1437
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ca327555:

    # "[ama] te mira con incredulidad y orgullo."
    "[ama] looks at you with disbelief and pride."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1439
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_85a87ecd:

    # dam "No está mal para un novato. Y menos aún teniendo en cuenta que has desperdiciado la primera bala."
    dam "Not bad for a rookie. Especially considering you wasted the first bullet."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1440
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e8a14f9f:

    # dam "*Susurrando* No contestes."
    dam "*Whispering* Don't answer."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1441
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_166632e1:

    # dam "Ahora te voy a enseñar lo que hace un hombre de verdad."
    dam "Now I'm going to show you what a real man does."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1442
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_dd29310d:

    # "Sigues su consejo y no respondes a su provocación. Crees que empiezas a ver su juego."
    "You follow his advice and don't respond to his provocation. You think you're starting to see his game."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1444
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b8f2d890:

    # dam "Atentos, chicos. Mirad cómo se hace."
    dam "Pay attention, boys. Watch how it's done."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1446
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_f75f79fc:

    # ama "*Susurrando* Me dan ganas de matarlo ahora mismo. ¿Dónde hay un Bradley cuando una lo necesita?"
    ama "*Whispering* I feel like killing him right now. Where's a Bradley when you need one?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1447
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_efeb9587:

    # mc "*Susurrando* Aún no estoy seguro, pero creo que hay más de lo que estamos viendo."
    mc "*Whispering* I'm not sure yet, but I think there's more to this than what we can see."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1448
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_9814655f:

    # ama "*Susurrando* [dam] es bastante simple. No creo que haya pensado nada complicado."
    ama "*Whispering* [dam] is pretty simple. I don't think he's thought of anything complicated."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1449
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b267efde:

    # mc "*Susurrando* Dale el beneficio de la duda..."
    mc "*Whispering* Give him the benefit of the doubt..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1451
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_07a1dfb7:

    # "[dam] se pone en posición de disparo con una mano."
    "[dam] gets into a one-handed shooting stance."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1452
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_2e83baa6:

    # "Está claro que se está exhibiendo delante de los otros clones."
    "It's clear he's showing off in front of the other clones."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1454
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ee71ee81_3:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1455
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b2b3e98a:

    # "Dispara la primera bala."
    "He fires the first bullet."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1457
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4ce8d8ce:

    # "La nube de polvo se levanta lejos del blanco, en una posición parecida a la de tu primer disparo."
    "The dust cloud rises far from the target, in a position similar to your first shot."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1458
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_546b9e13:

    # "Ahora entiendes su juego perfectamente."
    "Now you understand his game perfectly."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1460
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ee71ee81_4:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1461
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_97d3991b:

    # "Dispara por segunda vez."
    "He fires for the second time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1463
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1eecee43:

    # "La nube se levanta exactamente en el mismo sitio."
    "The cloud rises in exactly the same spot."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1465
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ee71ee81_5:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1466
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e69bc401:

    # "Dispara por tercera vez."
    "He fires for the third time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1468
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_70ae0ece:

    # "Esta vez, la nube de polvo se levanta detrás del blanco."
    "This time, the dust cloud rises behind the target."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1470
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_d7da26e2:

    # dam "[cl2], dame tu pistola. Me parece que la mira de la mía se ha torcido cuando se ha caído."
    dam "[cl2], give me your gun. I think my sight got misaligned when the boss dropped it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1471
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_0daa77dc:

    # dam "Tengo que corregir el disparo hacia abajo y a la izquierda."
    dam "I have to correct my aim down and to the left."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1473
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ebb93b56:

    # "Tras cambiar de pistola, vuelve a la posición de disparo."
    "After swapping guns, he returns to the shooting position."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1475
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ee71ee81_6:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1476
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_c4ac4da5:

    # "Realiza siete disparos uno detrás de otro."
    "He fires seven shots, one after the other."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1478
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_dbbbf1aa:

    # dam "Ahora sí. Tendré que revisar mi pistola al volver al puesto avanzado."
    dam "That's better. I'll have to check my gun when we get back to the outpost."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1479
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_2f23ab16:

    # dam "[cl3], ve a mirar las puntuaciones. Con sólo 8 disparos buenos, no puedo haber alcanzado a [ama]."
    dam "[cl3], go check the scores. With only 8 good shots, I couldn't have caught up to [ama]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1481
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_904e2706:

    # "Al cabo de un par de minutos..."
    "After a couple of minutes..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1482
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a122138c:

    # cl3 "62 puntos, [dam]. Uno de los tres primeros disparos ha dado en el objetivo, pero... en el uno. Debe haber sido el tercer disparo."
    cl3 "62 points, [dam]. One of the first three shots hit the target, but... on the one. It must have been the third shot."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1483
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_96dbd380:

    # cl3 "Del resto, un diez, tres nueves y tres ochos."
    cl3 "Of the rest, one ten, three nines, and three eights."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1485
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3b69c48a:

    # dam "[cl2], me quedo tu arma. Parece que está un poco desviada también. Le echaré un vistazo."
    dam "[cl2], I'm keeping your weapon. It seems a bit off too. I'll take a look at it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1486
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_516803cc:

    # dam "No he ganado a [ama], pero está claro que estoy varios niveles por encima del... {b}jefe{/b}."
    dam "I didn't beat [ama], but it's clear I'm several levels above the... {b}boss{/b}."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1488
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3f2ce5d4:

    # gid "No seas injusto, [dam]. Con tu pistola averiada, él ha hecho... más de cinco puntos por disparo una vez lo corrigió."
    gid "Don't be unfair, [dam]. With your faulty gun, he scored... more than five points per shot once he adjusted."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1489
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_333527c6:

    # gid "Y solo necesitó un disparo para corregir. Tú has usado dos y has sacado un miserable uno al tercero."
    gid "And he only needed one shot to adjust. You used two and got a miserable one on the third."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1491
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_05887a0a:

    # dam "Creo que te voy a poner a correr cuando volvamos al puesto avanzado. Pero tienes {b}algo{/b} de razón."
    dam "I think I'm going to make you run laps when we get back to the outpost. But you're {b}somewhat{/b} right."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1492
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_bcc1a34b:

    # dam "Por suerte, su función no es combatir, sino tomar decisiones."
    dam "Luckily, his role isn't to fight, but to make decisions."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1494
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_84e0fe8c:

    # dam "Volvemos a la base, chicos. Creo que el jefe se ha ganado el derecho de ir delante conmigo."
    dam "We're heading back to base, guys. I think the boss has earned the right to ride up front with me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1495
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_10c8e61e:

    # dam "Vosotros vais detrás como damiselas. Y nada de armar follón. La damisela más mortífera de la base os estará vigilando."
    dam "You guys ride in the back like damsels. And no causing trouble. The deadliest damsel on the base will be watching you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1498
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_895151c4:

    # "En el camión..."
    "In the truck..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1499
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_a60ad23a:

    # mc "*Susurrando* ¿Por qué, [dam]?"
    mc "*Whispering* Why, [dam]?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1500
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_67852316:

    # dam "¿Por qué, qué?"
    dam "Why what?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1501
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5e7c2edc:

    # mc "*Susurrando* ¿Por qué has hecho el paripé con la pistola cayéndose?"
    mc "*Whispering* Why did you put on that act with the gun dropping?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1503
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3f1c365c:

    # dam "No hace falta que susurres. Ahí detrás no se oye nada."
    dam "No need to whisper. You can't hear anything back there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1504
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ab518dac:

    # dam "[ama] me dijo que [eva] te había dado clases y quería ver cómo de bueno eras."
    dam "[ama] told me that [eva] had been teaching you, and I wanted to see how good you were."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1506
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_00bd99ba:

    # dam "Sabía que alguien te iba a retar tarde o temprano. ¿Por qué no yo?"
    dam "I knew someone was going to challenge you sooner or later. Why not me?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1507
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_78556c65:

    # dam "Todo el mundo dice que los D somos unos fanfarrones, no demasiado listos, y tenemos problemas con la autoridad. Con lo que era una buena opción."
    dam "Everyone says us D's are show-offs, not too bright, and have problems with authority. So I was a good choice."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1509
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8f252dd6:

    # dam "*Risa* Pero no podía dejarte en ridículo delante de los chicos."
    dam "*Laugh* But I couldn't make a fool out of you in front of the guys."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1510
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4d505fd7:

    # dam "Te hubieran perdido el respeto."
    dam "They would have lost respect for you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1511
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_313980c0:

    # mc "Pero sabías que no podría igualar a [ama]..."
    mc "But you knew I couldn't match [ama]..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1513
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_88d2c2dc:

    # dam "Ni tú, ni yo, ni nadie, excepto [eva]. Y las otras chicas, claro. Pero ya no están."
    dam "Not you, not me, not anyone, except [eva]. And the other girls, of course. But they're not here anymore."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1514
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8d14edb3:

    # dam "¿Sabes algo de baloncesto?"
    dam "Do you know anything about basketball?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1515
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_54eef042:

    # mc "Un poco..."
    mc "A little..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1517
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_c48eac61:

    # dam "Tú serías un jugador de instituto. No serías la estrella de tu equipo, pero por lo que he visto hoy, serías bueno."
    dam "You'd be a high school player. You wouldn't be the star of your team, but from what I've seen today, you'd be good."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1518
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5b3bd0f8:

    # dam "Si entrenaras muchísimo, podrías llegar a jugar en la NCAA."
    dam "If you trained your ass off, you might make it to the NCAA."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1519
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_77b0e51f:

    # dam "Un soldado regular, sería un jugador correcto en la NCAA."
    dam "A regular soldier would be a decent NCAA player."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1520
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ac74606f:

    # dam "Los SEAL, los Boinas verdes, etc., serían jugadores de la NBA. Algunos titulares, otros suplentes."
    dam "SEALs, Green Berets, and the like would be NBA players. Some starters, some benchwarmers."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1521
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_46ba947d:

    # dam "La mayoría de los clones seríamos las estrellas de nuestros equipos en la NBA."
    dam "Most of us clones would be the star players of our NBA teams."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1523
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e0028ce1:

    # dam "[ama] y [eva] son como si Kareem, Magic, Michael, Larry, Lebron, y Kobe hubieran tenido una noche de sexo loca y hubieran nacido ellas."
    dam "[ama] and [eva] are like if Kareem, Magic, Michael, Larry, Lebron, and Kobe had a crazy night of sex and gave birth to them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1524
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b701ed4e:

    # mc "¿Tan buenas son? Sé que son buenas, pero..."
    mc "Are they really that good? I know they're good, but..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1526
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1ca4d774:

    # dam "¿Buenas? Son lo mejor que hay en el mercado de la muerte."
    dam "Good? They're the best there is in the killing business."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1527
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_1df0d75f:

    # dam "Saben hacer de todo, y todo bien. Te aseguro que me he esforzado en los siete últimos disparos."
    dam "They know how to do everything, and they do it well. I promise you I tried my hardest on those last seven shots."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1528
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_33b00cd1:

    # dam "Soy bueno, y no he llegado a una media de 9. [ama] lo ha hecho casi perfecto."
    dam "I'm good, and I didn't even average a 9. [ama] did it almost perfectly."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1530
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_21a1ff26:

    # dam "Nivel de tirador olímpico. Pero ella podría hacer lo mismo con un rifle, con un cuchillo, o con un lanzagranadas. Un tirador olímpico no."
    dam "Olympic shooter level. But she could do the same with a rifle, a knife, or a grenade launcher. An Olympic shooter couldn't."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1531
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_06b407f6:

    # dam "Tampoco podría pilotar un avión o un helicóptero como [eva] o diseñar un puesto de defensa improvisado como [ama]."
    dam "They also couldn't fly a plane or a helicopter like [eva], or design an improvised defense post like [ama]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1532
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b2e12b56:

    # dam "Aunque con un lanzagranadas seguramente les ganaría yo. A ellas dos y al tirador olímpico."
    dam "Although with a grenade launcher I'd probably beat them. Both of them and the Olympic shooter."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1533
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ce4f99cf:

    # mc "*Risa* Y tendríamos que cambiar los blancos después de cada disparo."
    mc "*Laugh* And we'd have to change the targets after every shot."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1535
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_567cf30e:

    # dam "*Risa* Me gusta tu sentido del humor. Creo que es la primera vez que te oigo reír."
    dam "*Laugh* I like your sense of humor. I think it's the first time I've heard you laugh."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1536
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_9732a5e6:

    # mc "Pero aún no me has dicho por qué. Lo de que querías ver lo bueno que era no me lo creo."
    mc "But you still haven't told me why. That thing about wanting to see how good I was, I don't buy it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1537
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b43ddd82:

    # mc "Podías haberme pedido ir los dos juntos y... examinarme."
    mc "You could have asked me to go together and... test me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1539
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_bb501a4f:

    # dam "No lo entiendes. Ya te he dicho que alguien tenía que retarte tarde o temprano."
    dam "You don't get it. I already told you someone had to challenge you sooner or later."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1540
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8d01d0d8:

    # dam "Desde que tuvimos la reunión y te vimos junto a [aar], sabemos de quién es el clon el viejo. Y los chicos hablan de eso."
    dam "Ever since we had the meeting and saw you with [aar], we know whose clone the old man is. And the guys are starting to talk about it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1541
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_5a2df039:

    # dam "El viejo era muy bueno en el campo de ahí atrás."
    dam "The old man was really good on the range back there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1543
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_46c5f32f:

    # dam "Además, estuviste en la operación de [gav]. Alguien te vio marcharte de la sala de espera el último."
    dam "Besides, you were at [gav]'s surgery. Someone saw you leave the waiting room last."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1544
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_43d5c0b9:

    # dam "Estuviste más de 20 minutos ahí solo."
    dam "You were in there alone for over 20 minutes."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1545
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_12e114a8:

    # mc "Quería hablar con [bet], la cirujana. No sólo porque sea mi tía y quisiera saber cómo estaba."
    mc "I wanted to talk to [bet], the surgeon. Not just because she's my aunt and I wanted to know how she was doing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1546
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_2cd1eb53:

    # mc "Quería saber detalles sobre [gav]. No sólo un 'Todo ha salido según lo esperado.'"
    mc "I also wanted to know details about [gav]. Not just an 'Everything went as expected.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1547
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e5757408:

    # dam "A eso me refiero."
    dam "That's what I mean."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1549
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_b5c17d6e:

    # dam "Y, además, te has dado cuenta de que [dec] no era yo. ¿Cómo lo has hecho? Solo me viste una hora en una reunión."
    dam "And besides, you realized that [dec] wasn't me. How did you know? You only saw me for an hour in a meeting."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1550
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8f695b74:

    # mc "No lo sé. Sabía que no eras tú un segundo después de pronunciar tu nombre."
    mc "I don't know. I knew it wasn't you a second after saying your name."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1551
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e2ba9e50:

    # dam "¿Y eso es importante para ti?"
    dam "And is that important to you?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1552
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4c9a4f2c:

    # mc "Por supuesto que lo es. He dicho que no sois esclavos. Sois tan personas como yo, y tenéis que mantener vuestra individualidad."
    mc "Of course it is. I said you aren't slaves. You're just as human as I am, and you have to maintain your individuality."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1553
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e04bcd7e:

    # mc "Y yo tengo que ser el primero que os trate como individuos."
    mc "And I have to be the first to treat you as individuals."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1555
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_7f7be5ed:

    # dam "¿Sabes cómo me llamaba Daniels después de más de 15 años de verme casi todos los días?"
    dam "Do you know what Daniels called me after more than 15 years of seeing me almost every day?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1556
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_cc761816:

    # mc "No..."
    mc "No..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1558
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_bcd9ff64:

    # dam "*Fingiendo un acento despectivo* 'Eh, tú. Ese D de ahí.'"
    dam "*Faking a derogatory tone* 'Hey, you. That D over there.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1559
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_525ea951:

    # mc "No soy Daniels."
    mc "I'm not Daniels."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1561
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_888ebbb1:

    # dam "Lo sé. Lo demostraste el otro día en la reunión y lo has demostrado hoy. Por eso quiero ayudarte."
    dam "I know. You proved it the other day at the meeting and you've proved it today. That's why I want to help you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1562
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_3df83acc:

    # dam "Daniels hubiera venido con traje y no hubiera aceptado el reto del campo de tiro."
    dam "Daniels would have come in a suit and wouldn't have accepted the shooting range challenge."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1563
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_6c3949fc:

    # dam "Y él no hubiera sabido que [dec] no era yo."
    dam "And he wouldn't have known that [dec] wasn't me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1564
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_528348ad:

    # mc "*Risa* Bueno, [dec] no me ha pedido un Ferrarini."
    mc "*Laugh* Well, [dec] didn't ask me for a Ferrarini."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1566
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8be9b251:

    # dam "*Risa* Te he dicho que me gustaba tu sentido del humor. Creo que me voy a arrepentir de haberlo dicho."
    dam "*Laugh* I told you I liked your sense of humor. I think I'm going to regret saying that."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1567
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_25ef46ee:

    # dam "Pero a lo que iba. Eres diferente a Daniels, aunque nunca serás uno de los nuestros."
    dam "But back to my point. You're different from Daniels, even though you'll never be one of us."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1569
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_ef9c9507:

    # dam "Pero llevas los genes de [aar] y te intentas integrar con nosotros. Nos escuchas y demuestras que te preocupamos."
    dam "But you carry [aar]'s genes and you try to fit in with us. You listen to us and show that you care about us."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1570
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_09460c0a:

    # dam "Esos chicos de ahí detrás dirán que casi me has dado una paliza en el campo de tiro con una pistola defectuosa."
    dam "Those guys back there will say you almost kicked my ass at the shooting range with a defective gun."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1572
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4bebf0f9:

    # dam "Aunque te haya ganado con mis siete balas contra tus nueve. Pero van a exagerar y, en unos días, alguien dirá que hiciste 70 puntos."
    dam "Even though I beat you with my seven bullets against your nine. But they're going to exaggerate and, in a few days, someone will say you scored 70 points."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1573
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_8d5f9a05:

    # dam "Al menos nadie es tan tonto como para decir que le has ganado a [ama]. Eso no se lo creería nadie."
    dam "At least no one is dumb enough to say you beat [ama]. No one would believe that."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1574
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_6dd6f2ee:

    # mc "Podían haberse dado cuenta de tu trampa."
    mc "They could have noticed you playing tricks."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1576
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_c007af19:

    # dam "Los G, excepto [gav] y Grant, no son muy listos. Sabía que [gid] estaba predispuesto a apoyarte porque te vio en la sala de espera."
    dam "The G's, except for [gav] and Grant, aren't very smart. I knew [gid] was predisposed to support you because he saw you in the waiting room."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1577
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_4ba72e84:

    # dam "Los H son un poco más listos, pero en el momento en que [gid] ha caído en la trampa, ellos le han seguido."
    dam "The H's are a bit smarter, but the moment [gid] fell into the trap, they followed him."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1579
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e4a5568d:

    # dam "El equipo se jode todos los días y los chicos lo saben. Es más fácil pensar en eso que en que yo te estoy ayudando."
    dam "Gear gets fucked up in the field every day, and the guys know it. It's easier to think about that than me helping you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1580
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_44d390b5:

    # dam "No vas a tener que demostrarle nada a nadie más."
    dam "You're not going to have to prove anything to anyone else."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1581
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_39e82539:

    # mc "Sí. Voy a tener que demostrar que todo lo que has dicho es cierto. Y pienso hacerlo."
    mc "Yes. I'm going to have to prove that everything you said is true. And I plan to do it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1583
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_c284c804:

    # dam "*Risa* Más te vale hacerlo. Recuerda que yo soy el de los lanzagranadas y los cañones."
    dam "*Laugh* You better. Remember I'm the one who knows how to use grenade launchers and cannons."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1584
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_2ebf26db:

    # mc "*Risa* Si me atacas con eso, no te daré el Ferrarini."
    mc "*Laugh* If you attack me with that, I won't give you the Ferrarini."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1586
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_e2564258:

    # dam "¿Qué? ¿Me vas a conceder el Ferrarini?"
    dam "What? You're going to give me the Ferrarini?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1587
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_50d089ac:

    # mc "*Risa* Nope."
    mc "*Laugh* Nope."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1589
translate english c32s002_trainingCamp_79bfddef:

    # dam "*Gruñido* Odio tu sentido del humor."
    dam "*Grunt* I hate your sense of humor."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1593
translate english c32s002_choices_94fcc3b1:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 44 – MIÉRCOLES{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 44 – WEDNESDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1595
translate english c32s002_choices_31e7a1d4:

    # mcp "(Mañana hará una semana que llegué a Aruba.)"
    mcp "(Tomorrow marks a week since I arrived in Aruba.)"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1596
translate english c32s002_choices_6b1bf788:

    # mcp "(Hay muchísimas cosas que hacer, pero tengo que ir paso a paso.)"
    mcp "(There's a ton of things to do, but I have to take it one step at a time.)"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1598
translate english c32s002_choices_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1599
translate english c32s002_choices_3e597b1c:

    # mc "Pasa, [ama]."
    mc "Come in, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1601
translate english c32s002_choices_ddb8a5e8:

    # ama "Sabes que das grima cuando haces eso, ¿verdad?"
    ama "You know it's creepy when you do that, right?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1602
translate english c32s002_choices_05bc6133:

    # mc "¿Hacer qué?"
    mc "Do what?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1603
translate english c32s002_choices_60e2acf7:

    # ama "Saber quién está llamando a la puerta por cómo suenan sus nudillos en la madera."
    ama "Know who's knocking on the door just by how their knuckles sound on the wood."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1604
translate english c32s002_choices_f8a95736:

    # mc "Es lógico. Tú eres suave, aunque no tanto como [car]. [vin] es tímido. [flo] y [mael] son decididos, pero de una forma distinta."
    mc "It makes sense. You're soft, though not as much as [car]. [vin] is shy. [flo] and [mael] are assertive, but in different ways."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1605
translate english c32s002_choices_9acceccf:

    # mc "Y [aar] no llama nunca a la puerta."
    mc "And [aar] never knocks."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1606
translate english c32s002_choices_5044cb74:

    # mc "No me visita nadie más, excepto [geo], de informática. Y puedo oír su voz desde aquí cuando le pregunta a [car] si estoy."
    mc "No one else visits me, except [geo] from IT. And I can hear his voice from here when he asks [car] if I'm around."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1608
translate english c32s002_choices_84d8ad22:

    # ama "Tienes cara de estar sobrepasado. ¿Ha pasado algo?"
    ama "You look overwhelmed. Did something happen?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1609
translate english c32s002_choices_a2bfa642:

    # mc "[vin] y sus diminutas manos se acaban de ir. Esta mañana me ha enviado los tres informes que le pedí el otro día."
    mc "[vin] and his tiny hands just left. This morning he sent me the three reports I asked for the other day."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1611
translate english c32s002_choices_65e9afd8:

    # ama "Eso es más eficiente de lo que esperaba... ¿Por qué estás así, entonces?"
    ama "That's more efficient than I expected... Why are you like this, then?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1612
translate english c32s002_choices_e1821513:

    # mc "Porque he estado mirando los números, y creo que no voy a poder cumplir con las expectativas que se crearon en la reunión con los operativos."
    mc "Because I've been looking at the numbers, and I don't think I'll be able to meet the expectations set during the meeting with the operatives."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1613
translate english c32s002_choices_d004ed67:

    # mc "No hay dinero para hacerlo todo, y no van a estar contentos. Tengo que dejar fuera una de las promesas que hicimos."
    mc "There's not enough money to do it all, and they're not going to be happy. I have to leave out one of the promises we made."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1615
translate english c32s002_choices_6d115153:

    # ama "Si te puedo ayudar... Explícame cómo está la situación."
    ama "If I can help... Explain the situation to me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1616
translate english c32s002_choices_687a3364:

    # ama "Ya les diste el estilo personal y el poder salir de la base. Este fin de semana saldrán los primeros."
    ama "You already gave them personal style and the ability to leave the base. The first ones will go out this weekend."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1617
translate english c32s002_choices_757c50f3:

    # mc "Pero quedan las prótesis, el salario, el salario retroactivo, las posibles rescisiones de contrato, las promociones internas, y los pasaportes."
    mc "But there are still prosthetics, salaries, back pay, potential contract terminations, internal promotions, and passports."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1619
translate english c32s002_choices_cffed37b:

    # ama "Bueno, no creo que sepamos el coste de cada una de esas cosas."
    ama "Well, I don't think we know the cost of each of those things."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1620
translate english c32s002_choices_e2352b74:

    # mc "¡Oh, sí! Sí que lo sabemos. Hay unas manos enanas que teclean muy rápido."
    mc "Oh, yes! We do know. There are some tiny hands that type very fast."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1622
translate english c32s002_choices_860b0df6:

    # "Te está costando concentrarte con la nueva blusa que lleva [ama]. ¿Le han crecido las tetas en los últimos tres días?"
    "You're having a hard time concentrating with the new blouse [ama] is wearing. Did her tits grow in the last three days?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1624
translate english c32s002_choices_3942ae45:

    # ama "¿El tema de los pasaportes también?"
    ama "The passport issue too?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1625
translate english c32s002_choices_0b7cfa00:

    # mc "Sí. Hablé con [flo] para ver si se le ocurría algo, al tener contactos con gobiernos extranjeros."
    mc "Yeah. I talked to [flo] to see if he could think of anything, since he has contacts with foreign governments."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1626
translate english c32s002_choices_4556bcda:

    # mc "Le pasó las cifras a [vin] de lo que nos va a costar... en sobornos."
    mc "He gave [vin] the numbers on what it's going to cost us... in bribes."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1627
translate english c32s002_choices_40942838:

    # mc "Y sobre el resto, [vin] ha hecho una estimación. Y no llegamos a todo."
    mc "And as for the rest, [vin] has made an estimate. And we can't afford it all."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1628
translate english c32s002_choices_38cf63f7:

    # mc "Si al menos supiera cómo iba a afectar la opinión de los operativos si incumplo cada una de las promesas..."
    mc "If only I knew how it would affect the operatives' opinion if I break each of these promises..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1630
translate english c32s002_choices_2c4da2b2:

    # ama "Creo que en eso te puedo ayudar. Al fin y al cabo, soy un operativo más... o lo era hasta hace unos meses."
    ama "I think I can help you with that. After all, I'm just another operative... or I was until a few months ago."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1631
translate english c32s002_choices_51ef8059:

    # ama "Si tuviera que puntuar del uno al diez cuánta infelicidad crea cada promesa que dejes fuera..."
    ama "If I had to rate from one to ten how much unhappiness each promise you leave out creates..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1633
translate english c32s002_choices_9b0e52c3:

    # ama "Las prótesis serían un 9 para los que la necesitan, pero un 1 para el resto."
    ama "The prosthetics would be a 9 for those who need them, but a 1 for the rest."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1634
translate english c32s002_choices_455ef5af:

    # ama "Si vamos a dejar de hacer misiones peligrosas, van a pensar que no las necesitarán nunca."
    ama "If we're going to stop doing dangerous missions, they're going to think they'll never need them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1635
translate english c32s002_choices_aba4f93f:

    # ama "Con lo que diría que un 3 en general."
    ama "So I'd say a 3 overall."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1636
translate english c32s002_choices_6105f3e2:

    # mc "Eso me sirve. No me lo había planteado así."
    mc "That helps. I hadn't thought of it that way."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1637
translate english c32s002_choices_f003b06f:

    # mc "Pero me fastidiaría dejar a [cal] sin su prótesis. Ha trabajado mucho para la de [gav]."
    mc "But it would suck to leave [cal] without his prosthetic. He worked hard on [gav]'s."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1638
translate english c32s002_choices_399fde01:

    # ama "Por eso no envidio tu trabajo. No son decisiones fáciles."
    ama "That's why I don't envy your job. These aren't easy decisions."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1640
translate english c32s002_choices_8e984af3:

    # mc "¿Y si dejamos fuera el salario?"
    mc "What if we leave the salary out?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1641
translate english c32s002_choices_0dc6f52f:

    # ama "Seguramente se te tirarían al cuello. Un 10, desde luego. Para todos."
    ama "They'd probably jump at your throat. A 10, for sure. For everyone."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1642
translate english c32s002_choices_55b7c020:

    # ama "Además, esa iba ligada al salario retroactivo. ¿Qué vas a hacer con eso?"
    ama "Besides, that was tied to the retroactive pay. What are you going to do about that?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1643
translate english c32s002_choices_966728e7:

    # mc "No lo sé aún. No puedo darles las dos cosas sin dejar otra cosa fuera."
    mc "I don't know yet. I can't give them both without leaving something else out."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1644
translate english c32s002_choices_8e41c56e:

    # mc "Había pensado que darles el salario podría ser una buena idea."
    mc "I thought giving them the salary might be a good idea."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1645
translate english c32s002_choices_f7b95eaa:

    # mc "No solo sería lo justo, sino también sería una forma de decir 'A partir de ahora, las cosas cambian.'"
    mc "Not only would it be fair, but it would also be a way of saying 'From now on, things are changing.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1647
translate english c32s002_choices_0f886ed8:

    # ama "Es buena idea. Y puedes negarles el salario retroactivo diciendo que eso es un problema de la dirección anterior."
    ama "That's a good idea. And you can deny them the retroactive pay by saying that's a problem from the previous management."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1648
translate english c32s002_choices_276f2f87:

    # ama "Eso crearía... unos 6 puntos de infelicidad."
    ama "That would create... about 6 points of unhappiness."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1649
translate english c32s002_choices_017c6753:

    # mc "No podemos hacer eso. Es la empresa quien se lo debe. Y ahora la empresa somos nosotros."
    mc "We can't do that. It's the company that owes them. And now we are the company."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1650
translate english c32s002_choices_afe105b3:

    # mc "Había pensado que, si es lo que dejamos fuera, que sea de forma temporal."
    mc "I was thinking that, if that's what we leave out, it should be temporary."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1651
translate english c32s002_choices_48532c43:

    # mc "En plan, no os vamos a dar un millón a cada uno de la serie A, más lo que sea a los C, más lo que les toque a los D..."
    mc "Like, we're not going to give a million to the A series, plus whatever to each of the C's, plus whatever the D's get..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1653
translate english c32s002_choices_01f03d7e:

    # ama "*Risa* Y no te olvides de [eva] y de mí..."
    ama "*Laugh* And don't forget about [eva] and me..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1654
translate english c32s002_choices_ae6332de:

    # mc "*Risa* No me olvido. Estáis en el informe de 'Dedos de Halfling'."
    mc "*Laugh* I haven't forgotten. You're in the 'Halfling Fingers' report."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1655
translate english c32s002_choices_2c712dc7:

    # mc "Me refiero a no pagarlo todo de golpe. Darlo como un complemento al salario hasta que saldemos las cuentas con cada uno de ellos."
    mc "I mean not paying it all at once. Giving it as a salary supplement until we settle the accounts with each of them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1656
translate english c32s002_choices_6fa8024f:

    # mc "Estoy seguro de que sé en qué se gastaría el dinero [dam] si lo recibiera todo a la vez."
    mc "I'm sure I know what [dam] would spend the money on if he got it all at once."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1658
translate english c32s002_choices_2ec02901:

    # ama "Eso no es asunto nuestro. Pero creo que me gusta tu idea."
    ama "That's none of our business. But I think I like your idea."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1659
translate english c32s002_choices_c406347e:

    # ama "Cuando [eva] y yo recibimos el dinero de las acciones acudimos a [mar] y [nor] para que nos orientaran sobre cómo gastarlo."
    ama "When [eva] and I received the money from the shares, we went to [mar] and [nor] for guidance on how to spend it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1661
translate english c32s002_choices_369e6a74:

    # ama "Los chicos no van a tenerlas a ellas aquí para preguntarles."
    ama "The guys aren't going to have them here to ask."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1662
translate english c32s002_choices_a75a49e4:

    # ama "Pero si ligas la recepción del complemento a... no sé... algún tipo de clases de economía doméstica..."
    ama "But if you link receiving the supplement to... I don't know... some kind of home economics lessons..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1663
translate english c32s002_choices_45946b11:

    # ama "Creo que eso rebajaría la infelicidad de 6 a 2 puntos. Saben que lo recibirán, aunque no de golpe."
    ama "I think that would lower the unhappiness from 6 to 2 points. They know they'll get it, even if not all at once."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1664
translate english c32s002_choices_f5271567:

    # mc "Me parece una buena idea."
    mc "Sounds like a good idea to me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1666
translate english c32s002_choices_a0298ab4:

    # ama "Claro, que podrías no darles el salario y darles los atrasos."
    ama "Of course, you could just not pay their salary and give them the back pay."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1667
translate english c32s002_choices_4bec6998:

    # ama "*Risa* Casi apostaría que muchos dejarían la empresa y nos ahorraríamos sus sueldos."
    ama "*Laugh* I'd almost bet many would leave the company and we'd save on their salaries."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1668
translate english c32s002_choices_0e4a7c10:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Abandonarían la empresa antes o después de matarme?"
    mc "*Laugh* Would they leave the company before or after killing me?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1669
translate english c32s002_choices_806401e9:

    # mc "Has dicho que me saltarían al cuello, y enfadar a 400 tíos que están entrenados para matar no me parece buena idea."
    mc "You said they'd jump at my throat, and pissing off 400 guys who are trained to kill doesn't sound like a good idea."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1671
translate english c32s002_choices_23783ce4:

    # ama "*Risa* [aar] y yo te defenderíamos."
    ama "*Laugh* [aar] and I would defend you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1672
translate english c32s002_choices_7b0c4e87:

    # mc "*Risa* Vosotros dos os quedaríais también sin cobrar."
    mc "*Laugh* You two wouldn't get paid either."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1673
translate english c32s002_choices_31174db0:

    # ama "*Risa* Entonces voy a rectificar. [car] te defendería."
    ama "*Laugh* Then I'll correct myself. [car] would defend you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1674
translate english c32s002_choices_353e4ea1:

    # mc "*Risa* Entonces estoy a salvo, mientras no salga del despacho."
    mc "*Laugh* Then I'm safe, as long as I don't leave the office."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1675
translate english c32s002_choices_e2728bc7:

    # mc "Nadie se atrevería a pasar por encima de ella."
    mc "No one would dare cross her."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1677
translate english c32s002_choices_f367cf65:

    # ama "Bueno, sigamos antes de que digamos demasiadas tonterías y [car] entre a ver qué nos pasa."
    ama "Well, let's move on before we spout too much nonsense and [car] comes in to see what's wrong with us."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1678
translate english c32s002_choices_40000b84:

    # ama "¿Cuál es la siguiente promesa?"
    ama "What's the next promise?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1679
translate english c32s002_choices_52599a5d:

    # mc "Las rescisiones de contrato. Lo de que os podáis ir cuando queráis de la empresa."
    mc "Contract terminations. The part about you being able to leave the company whenever you want."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1681
translate english c32s002_choices_105c6197:

    # ama "¡Uff! Creo que si tuviera que puntuar la infelicidad que provocaría eso... Un 5 en general."
    ama "Oof! I think if I had to rate the unhappiness that would cause... A 5 overall."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1682
translate english c32s002_choices_6a258d65:

    # mc "¿Sólo un 5?"
    mc "Only a 5?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1684
translate english c32s002_choices_41645337:

    # ama "Hay algunos que es difícil que vayan a querer irse nunca. [aar], los C, los D..."
    ama "There are some who will probably never want to leave. [aar], the C's, the D's..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1685
translate english c32s002_choices_75c47816:

    # ama "Son muy... mayores... para empezar a buscarse la vida fuera de aquí. Y pasa lo mismo que con las prótesis. Para ellos sería un 1."
    ama "They're too... old... to start making a living outside of here. And it's the same as with the prosthetics. For them, it would be a 1."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1686
translate english c32s002_choices_59d5d9da:

    # ama "Para los más jóvenes, quizás se acerque al 10. Si se lo niegas, se seguirían sintiendo esclavos. He hecho la media."
    ama "For the younger ones, it might be closer to a 10. If you deny them that, they'd still feel like slaves. I just averaged it out."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1687
translate english c32s002_choices_2d8b5842:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Un 5 entonces."
    mc "I get it. A 5 then."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1689
translate english c32s002_choices_dd541633:

    # ama "Estamos avanzando. ¿Siguiente?"
    ama "We're making progress. Next?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1690
translate english c32s002_choices_ae585396:

    # mc "Lo siguiente sería el sistema de promociones internas y opositar a puestos diferentes."
    mc "Next would be the internal promotion system and applying for different positions."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1691
translate english c32s002_choices_22346e53:

    # mc "Yo creía que eso iba a ser barato, pero cuando se lo expliqué a [vin] dijo que no era tan fácil."
    mc "I thought that was going to be cheap, but when I explained it to [vin], he said it wasn't that easy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1692
translate english c32s002_choices_1ef53656:

    # mc "Debería haber un programa de formación para los diversos puestos. E hizo el presupuesto. ¡Le encanta hacer presupuestos!"
    mc "There would have to be a training program for the various positions. And he made the budget. He loves making budgets!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1693
translate english c32s002_choices_c39aa0d6:

    # mc "No se debería aceptar que tú pidas el puesto de contable, por ejemplo, si no tienes formación para ello."
    mc "We shouldn't accept that you ask for the accountant position, for example, if you don't have the training for it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1695
translate english c32s002_choices_8a2bcda6:

    # ama "Me jode estar de acuerdo con [vin]."
    ama "It pisses me off to agree with [vin]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1696
translate english c32s002_choices_0eae8b01:

    # ama "Si lo planteas como algo a largo plazo, con programas de formación, vas a hacer muy felices a los más jóvenes."
    ama "If you present it as a long-term thing, with training programs, you're going to make the younger ones very happy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1697
translate english c32s002_choices_65bf15d4:

    # mc "Eso si no es la idea que dejamos fuera..."
    mc "That is, if it's not the idea we leave out..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1699
translate english c32s002_choices_6da0627d:

    # ama "Exacto. Si la dejas fuera enfadaría a muchos. Un 7 diría yo. Y tendría ramificaciones."
    ama "Exactly. If you leave it out, it would anger a lot of people. A 7, I'd say. And it would have ramifications."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1700
translate english c32s002_choices_64c0c948:

    # ama "Por ejemplo, para el equipo de Newport. En vez de elegir voluntarios deberíamos elegir a dedo."
    ama "For example, for the Newport team. Instead of choosing volunteers, we should handpick them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1701
translate english c32s002_choices_43bd7f7f:

    # mc "Pero si hay voluntarios suficientes podríamos elegir entre ellos."
    mc "But if there are enough volunteers, we could choose from among them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1703
translate english c32s002_choices_0c5f88a8:

    # ama "Estarías mandando un mensaje ambiguo. 'Para proteger a mi familia sí, para el resto no.'"
    ama "You'd be sending a mixed message. 'To protect my family, yes, for the rest, no.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1704
translate english c32s002_choices_32f8f8f4:

    # mc "No lo había pensado así, pero tienes razón. No lo miraba desde la psicología de los chicos."
    mc "I hadn't thought of it like that, but you're right. I wasn't looking at it from the kids' psychology."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1706
translate english c32s002_choices_870bc08c:

    # ama "Aunque podrías implementar el sistema de promociones para las cosas que estén preparados, como seguridad."
    ama "Although you could implement the promotion system for things they are prepared for, like security."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1707
translate english c32s002_choices_bf533a1e:

    # ama "Y dejar los puestos que necesiten formación para más adelante. Imagina alguien de la Serie P que quiera ser médico."
    ama "And leave the positions that need training for later. Imagine someone from the P Series who wants to be a doctor."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1708
translate english c32s002_choices_83e8d4c5:

    # ama "Ahora tienen cinco años, aunque sus cuerpos tengan ocho. Da tiempo a que se formen para lo que quieran ser."
    ama "They are five years old now, even if their bodies are eight. It gives them time to prepare for whatever they want to be."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1710
translate english c32s002_choices_e14d3140:

    # ama "Si lo hacemos así, sería un... ¿posiblemente un 2?"
    ama "If we do it like that, it would be a... possibly a 2?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1711
translate english c32s002_choices_62df770a:

    # ama "Habrá alguno que quiera ser director financiero mañana, pero el resto lo entenderán."
    ama "There might be someone who wants to be a CFO tomorrow, but the rest will understand."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1712
translate english c32s002_choices_b5e5ca31:

    # mc "Me gusta esa idea."
    mc "I like that idea."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1713
translate english c32s002_choices_aa942b95:

    # mc "Además, podemos unirlo con un programa de educación normal para los más pequeños. Ya te dije ayer que no los quiero cerca de las armas."
    mc "Besides, we can combine it with a normal education program for the little ones. I told you yesterday I don't want them near weapons."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1715
translate english c32s002_choices_e2ffec41:

    # ama "Podemos crear algo parecido a una escuela rural con profesores propios."
    ama "We can create something similar to a rural school with our own teachers."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1716
translate english c32s002_choices_b4c994f7:

    # ama "No puedes mandar a 20 chicos de la serie Q al mismo colegio."
    ama "You can't send 20 Q-series kids to the same school."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1717
translate english c32s002_choices_878fcbb9:

    # mc "Lo sé. Ya tengo presupuesto para ello, cortesía de [vin]. Esa opción ya está aprobada en mi cabeza."
    mc "I know. I already have the budget for it, courtesy of [vin]. That option is already approved in my head."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1718
translate english c32s002_choices_904513b8:

    # mc "Y sólo queda la última. Pasaportes."
    mc "And only the last one is left. Passports."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1720
translate english c32s002_choices_78fa534d:

    # ama "No tiene sentido que les dejes rescindir el contrato y que no les des pasaportes. Ni a la inversa."
    ama "It makes no sense for you to let them terminate the contract and not give them passports. Nor vice versa."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1721
translate english c32s002_choices_8ef72c39:

    # mc "Lo sé. Son dos elecciones que van ligadas entre ellas. La una sin la otra no serviría de nada."
    mc "I know. They are two choices that are linked together. One without the other would be useless."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1722
translate english c32s002_choices_378afdc8:

    # mc "Pero, ya que estamos ordenándolas por impopularidad, ¿cuántos puntos le darías a esto si lo dejáramos fuera?"
    mc "But, since we're ranking them by unpopularity, how many points would you give this if we left it out?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1724
translate english c32s002_choices_4aed6620:

    # ama "Es complicado. Condenarías a una vida de parias a quien quisiera abandonar la empresa."
    ama "It's complicated. You'd condemn anyone who wanted to leave the company to a life as a pariah."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1725
translate english c32s002_choices_e4568a61:

    # ama "Aunque sería una forma de que no quisieran irse."
    ama "Although it would be a way to make them not want to leave."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1726
translate english c32s002_choices_862b697e:

    # mc "Eso es juego sucio, [ama]. No quiero parecerme a Daniels ni a Richards en eso."
    mc "That's playing dirty, [ama]. I don't want to be like Daniels or Richards in that regard."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1728
translate english c32s002_choices_998e98ee:

    # ama "Lo sé, sólo pensaba en voz alta."
    ama "I know, I was just thinking out loud."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1729
translate english c32s002_choices_8c2ea8cb:

    # ama "Creo que un 6."
    ama "I think a 6."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1730
translate english c32s002_choices_99c784a0:

    # mc "¿Más que no dejarles rescindir sus contratos? No lo entiendo."
    mc "More than not letting them terminate their contracts? I don't get it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1732
translate english c32s002_choices_578b616c:

    # ama "Si podemos abandonar la empresa y no vivir una vida normal, nos estarías jodiendo más que si no nos dejas irnos."
    ama "If we can leave the company but not live a normal life, you'd be fucking us over more than if you didn't let us leave."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1733
translate english c32s002_choices_2ed1354b:

    # ama "Además, algunos pensarían lo mismo que tú, que es juego sucio."
    ama "Besides, some would think the same as you, that it's playing dirty."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1734
translate english c32s002_choices_4fda04ae:

    # mc "Vale. Un 6 entonces. Recapitulemos..."
    mc "Okay. A 6 then. Let's recap..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1735
translate english c32s002_choices_f1fddce4:

    # mc "Si dejamos fuera las prótesis, un 3. El salario un 10."
    mc "If we leave out the prosthetics, a 3. The salary a 10."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1736
translate english c32s002_choices_4a125ac8:

    # mc "El salario retroactivo un 6, pero si lo aplicamos con complementos mensuales a largo plazo, un 2."
    mc "Retroactive pay is a 6, but if we apply it with long-term monthly bonuses, it's a 2."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1737
translate english c32s002_choices_bf9e9b45:

    # mc "Las rescisiones de contrato un 5. Las promociones internas, si aseguramos un programa de formación, un 2. Y los pasaportes un 6."
    mc "Contract terminations are a 5. Internal promotions, if we secure a training program, a 2. And passports a 6."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1739
translate english c32s002_choices_a79d5f13:

    # ama "Creo que está claro. Tienes que elegir entre el salario retroactivo y las promociones internas."
    ama "I think it's clear. You have to choose between retroactive pay and internal promotions."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1740
translate english c32s002_choices_6bc58a8b:

    # ama "Son las dos cosas a más largo plazo. El coste sería distribuido en el tiempo y les daría algo por lo que quedarse en la empresa."
    ama "They're both longer-term things. The cost would be distributed over time and it would give them a reason to stay in the company."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1741
translate english c32s002_choices_05f0e4b9:

    # mc "Tienes razón. No me gusta dejar fuera de la lista ninguna de las dos, pero son las mejores candidatas."
    mc "You're right. I don't like leaving either off the list, but they're the best candidates."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1743
translate english c32s002_choices_040de9eb:

    # ama "Pero hay una petición de la que no hemos hablado."
    ama "But there's one request we haven't talked about."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1744
translate english c32s002_choices_77c47ed2:

    # mc "¿Cuál?"
    mc "Which one?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1745
translate english c32s002_choices_f8979f1b:

    # ama "[erc]."
    ama "[erc]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1746
translate english c32s002_choices_9812bb0a:

    # mc "Eso lo voy a cumplir. Dije que tendría una revisión justa y la tendrá."
    mc "I'm going to fulfill that. I said he'd get a fair review and he will."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1747
translate english c32s002_choices_e4f9fd90:

    # mc "La semana que viene tengo planeado hablar con él."
    mc "I plan to talk to him next week."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1749
translate english c32s002_choices_f6e252b9:

    # ama "[eva] va a querer estar presente."
    ama "[eva] is going to want to be there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1750
translate english c32s002_choices_195b5051:

    # mc "Lo sé, pero va a ser imposible retrasarlo hasta que llegue."
    mc "I know, but it's going to be impossible to delay it until she gets here."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1751
translate english c32s002_choices_ad5bfb96:

    # mc "Había pensado que estuviera por video conferencia."
    mc "I thought she would join by video conference."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1752
translate english c32s002_choices_18468d4b:

    # mc "Y eso me ha dado una idea. Pero acabemos antes con la decisión que tenemos que dejar fuera."
    mc "And that gave me an idea. But let's finish first with the decision we have to leave out."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1754
translate english c32s002_choices_442ed32e:

    # ama "La decisión que TIENES que dejar fuera. Yo sólo soy la jefa de seguridad. Eso es responsabilidad del CEO."
    ama "The decision YOU have to leave out. I'm just the head of security. That's the CEO's responsibility."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1755
translate english c32s002_choices_7ab88910:

    # mc "*Risa* Así me gusta. Sin presión. Como tú puedes defenderte de los clones..."
    mc "*Laugh* That's how I like it. No pressure. Since you can defend yourself against the clones..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1756
translate english c32s002_choices_2ef1da78:

    # mc "Según tu ránking de impopularidad, las dos decisiones serían igual de impopulares, pero mucho menos que las otras."
    mc "According to your unpopularity ranking, the two decisions would be equally unpopular, but much less than the others."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1763
translate english c32s002_choices_a2cf0a9f:

    # ama "Creo que has tomado una buena decisión."
    ama "I think you made a good decision."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1765
translate english c32s002_choices_7df8f792:

    # ama "Si les vas dando los salarios atrasados a lo largo de unos años van a estar contentos durante esos años."
    ama "If you keep giving them their back pay over a few years, they're going to be happy during those years."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1766
translate english c32s002_choices_e46690a8:

    # ama "Imagínate que [dam] pudiera comprarse tres Ferrarinis de golpe."
    ama "Imagine if [dam] could buy three Ferrarinis at once."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1767
translate english c32s002_choices_2f664a1c:

    # ama "Seguramente después habría envidias entre los que todavía tienen el dinero y los que lo han malgastado."
    ama "Surely afterwards there would be envy between those who still have the money and those who have squandered it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1768
translate english c32s002_choices_3f0c5e93:

    # mc "Tu idea de los cursos de economía es lo que me ha hecho decantarme por esa opción."
    mc "Your idea about the economics courses is what made me choose that option."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1769
translate english c32s002_choices_37aaee9f:

    # mc "Sabemos que, de esta forma, van a recibir su dinero igualmente, pero van a tener tiempo para aprender a administrarlo."
    mc "We know that, this way, they'll still receive their money, but they'll have time to learn how to manage it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1771
translate english c32s002_choices_ffa03737:

    # ama "Si lo hubieras implementado y alguien hubiera pedido el puesto de [mael] sin tener los conocimientos..."
    ama "If you had implemented it and someone had asked for [mael]'s position without having the knowledge..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1772
translate english c32s002_choices_8f5f7bdb:

    # mc "Hubiera tenido que rechazar la petición y parecería una promesa cumplida en falso."
    mc "I would have had to reject the request and it would look like an empty promise."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1773
translate english c32s002_choices_6dcb76b4:

    # ama "Pero sin embargo, les dejas la puerta abierta para formarse para esos puestos. Y para optar a los que sí saben desempeñar."
    ama "But nevertheless, you leave the door open for them to train for those positions. And to apply for the ones they do know how to perform."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1774
translate english c32s002_choices_297cb421:

    # mc "Por eso me he decantado por esta opción. Creo que va a ser más seguro para todos y vamos a evitar decepciones."
    mc "That's why I opted for this option. I think it's going to be safer for everyone and we'll avoid disappointments."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1776
translate english c32s002_choices_d710593c:

    # ama "¿Cuándo se lo vas a decir?"
    ama "When are you going to tell them?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1777
translate english c32s002_choices_7810c46b:

    # mc "Después de lo de [erc]."
    mc "After the [erc] thing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1778
translate english c32s002_choices_481700e4:

    # mc "[fred] me dijo ayer que estaban pensando en reducir aún más el comité y delegar las conversaciones conmigo en [carl]."
    mc "[fred] told me yesterday that they were thinking of reducing the committee even more and delegating the conversations with me to [carl]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1779
translate english c32s002_choices_814476f6:

    # mc "Creo que quieren evitar otra reunión en la que esté [dam]."
    mc "I think they want to avoid another meeting where [dam] is present."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1781
translate english c32s002_choices_da9606b0:

    # ama "*Risa* No les culpo."
    ama "*Laugh* I don't blame them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:1782
translate english c32s002_choices_f74a1a14:

    # mc "*Risa* Yo tampoco, te lo aseguro. Aún estoy decidiendo si tenías razón en el avión cuando dijiste que querría atropellar a [dam]."
    mc "*Laugh* Me neither, I assure you. I'm still deciding if you were right on the plane when you said I'd want to run over [dam]."

