translate english c32s004_Eric_60d946b5:

    # "Recoges el portátil, porque decir que recoges a [eva] quedaría raro, y te diriges a la puerta sin esperar respuesta."
    "You pick up the laptop, because saying you're picking up [eva] would sound weird, and head for the door without waiting for an answer."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2646
translate english c32s004_Eric_3bfdcce0:

    # "Te sientes como el detective pelirrojo de aquella serie de cuando eras un niño. Solo falta que la cabeza de [erc] explote a tu espalda."
    "You feel like the red-haired detective from that show when you were a kid. The only thing missing is [erc]'s head exploding behind your back."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2647
translate english c32s004_Eric_84f59513:

    # "La última vez que te sentiste así fue cuando conociste a la madre de [mad.nick]."
    "The last time you felt like this was when you met [mad.nick]'s mother."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2650
translate english c32s004_Eric_fee505d3:

    # aar "¿Cuándo ibas a decirnos lo del medicamento?"
    aar "When were you going to tell us about the medication?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2651
translate english c32s004_Eric_d90d9db5:

    # mc "Me enteré hace dos días de que existía. Ni Richards ni Daniels consideraron necesario dároslo."
    mc "I found out it existed two days ago. Neither Richards nor Daniels thought it was necessary to give it to you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2652
translate english c32s004_Eric_3ba0397e:

    # mc "Hoy he conseguido que [vin] asigne el dinero para fabricarlo."
    mc "Today I got [vin] to allocate the funds to manufacture it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2654
translate english c32s004_Eric_bbd28b37:

    # ama "¿De dónde va a salir el dinero? Tuvimos que rechazar algunas de las promesas que hiciste en la reunión con los operativos..."
    ama "Where is the money going to come from? We had to walk back some of the promises you made in the meeting with the operatives..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2655
translate english c32s004_Eric_ac8b1d33:

    # mc "He hablado con [mar] y con [nor]. Aceptarán un retraso en el cobro del dinero que la empresa les debe."
    mc "I've spoken with [mar] and [nor]. They'll accept a delay in collecting the money the company owes them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2656
translate english c32s004_Eric_a60341d9:

    # mc "Eso dará para unos meses de tratamiento para todos los clones. Todos menos uno. Después de eso, ya encontraremos el dinero."
    mc "That will cover a few months of treatment for all the clones. All but one. After that, we'll find the money."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2658
translate english c32s004_Eric_f75af7a8:

    # eva "¡Hey! ¡Estoy aquí! ¿Podéis cambiarme de posición? Sólo veo el sobaco de [mc]."
    eva "Hey! I'm here! Can you move me? I can only see [mc]'s armpit."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2659
translate english c32s004_Eric_fd98ea7c:

    # mc "Perdón, [eva]."
    mc "Sorry, [eva]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2661
translate english c32s004_Eric_1e6f8569:

    # eva "Gracias. Ya he cortado la retransmisión a las salas."
    eva "Thanks. I've already cut the broadcast to the meeting rooms."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2662
translate english c32s004_Eric_b74b71ac:

    # eva "Me alegro mucho por los chicos, pero lo que más me alegra es cómo has llevado a [erc] a tu terreno."
    eva "I'm really happy for the guys, but what makes me happiest is how you played [erc] right into your hands."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2663
translate english c32s004_Eric_b954ddb3:

    # mc "Yo no he hecho nada. En el momento en que se ha sentido traicionado, él mismo se ha enterrado."
    mc "I didn't do anything. The moment he felt betrayed, he dug his own grave."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2665
translate english c32s004_Eric_ea09bec3:

    # eva "¿Cuándo lo vas a ejecutar? Espero que lo retrases hasta que esté ahí."
    eva "When are you going to execute him? I hope you hold off until I'm there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2666
translate english c32s004_Eric_d5c05c27:

    # mc "No voy a ejecutar a nadie, [eva]. Decidiremos qué hacer con él."
    mc "I'm not going to execute anyone, [eva]. We'll decide what to do with him."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2667
translate english c32s004_Eric_1f4aaadf:

    # mc "El cargo de asesinato debería ser suficiente para meterlo en una prisión... normal."
    mc "The murder charge should be enough to put him in a... normal prison."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2669
translate english c32s004_Eric_7081a17d:

    # ama "Pero no lo hemos grabado..."
    ama "But we didn't record it..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2670
translate english c32s004_Eric_468d8298:

    # mc "Lo sé. No esperaba que confesara un asesinato en el primer interrogatorio."
    mc "I know. I wasn't expecting him to confess to a murder in the first interrogation."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2672
translate english c32s004_Eric_f04c798b:

    # eva "*Tos* No lo {b}habéis{/b} grabado. Todos estos programas de videoconferencia tienen un pequeño botoncito rojo."
    eva "*Cough* {b}You{/b} didn't record it. All these video conferencing programs have a little red button."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2673
translate english c32s004_Eric_6fc8354b:

    # eva "*Risita* Es posible que lo haya presionado por 'error'."
    eva "*Giggle* I might have pressed it by 'mistake'."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2674
translate english c32s004_Eric_3ae11115:

    # mc "*Risa* A veces eres adorable, [eva]."
    mc "*Laugh* Sometimes you're adorable, [eva]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2676
translate english c32s004_Eric_0ebd4423:

    # aar "Los operativos de casi todas las series más mayores han visto el interrogatorio."
    aar "The operatives from almost all the older series have seen the interrogation."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2677
translate english c32s004_Eric_90f498ac:

    # aar "Creo que ellos también deberían opinar sobre qué hacer con [erc]. Ha dejado claro lo que piensa de ellos."
    aar "I think they should also have a say in what to do with [erc]. He's made it clear what he thinks of them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2678
translate english c32s004_Eric_50eb87d4:

    # mc "[aar], estamos haciendo cambios en la empresa, pero esto no es una democracia."
    mc "[aar], we're making changes in the company, but this isn't a democracy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2679
translate english c32s004_Eric_11e2ab21:

    # mc "No voy a permitir que [erc] salga de esta sin un castigo sólo porque el resto de las series lo pida."
    mc "I'm not going to let [erc] get away unpunished just because the rest of the series ask for it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2681
translate english c32s004_Eric_ab5d7ac2:

    # aar "Lo entiendo, pero no te preocupes."
    aar "I understand, but don't worry."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2682
translate english c32s004_Eric_91abcba3:

    # aar "Después de lo que han escuchado, creo que pedirán un castigo más severo del que quieres aplicar."
    aar "After what they've heard, I think they'll ask for a harsher punishment than what you want to apply."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2683
translate english c32s004_Eric_da4aa847:

    # aar "Pero pienso que deberías escuchar sus propuestas, aunque no te ates a ellas."
    aar "But I think you should listen to their proposals, even if you don't commit to them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2684
translate english c32s004_Eric_fa79daaa:

    # mc "Me parece una buena idea. Hablaré con [carl]. No quiero pasar por esto en una reunión con [dam]."
    mc "Sounds like a good idea. I'll talk to [carl]. I don't want to go through this in a meeting with [dam]."

