# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2769
translate english c32s004_routine_0f7faab0:

    # "Los días se suceden y cada vez consigues adaptar más tu agenda para acomodar más llamadas a casa."
    "Days go by, and you manage to adapt your schedule step by step to accommodate more calls home."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2770
translate english c32s004_routine_3ae21cee:

    # "Echas de menos a las chicas y a Jamaal, pero sobre todo echas de menos el sentimiento de una gran familia."
    "You miss the girls and Jamaal, but most of all, you miss the feeling of a big family."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2773
translate english c32s004_routine_c1068ce2:

    # "Habláis de los bebés que están en camino y de cómo las diferentes chicas están llevando su embarazo."
    "You talk about the babies on the way and how the different girls are handling their pregnancies."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2775
translate english c32s004_routine_767c42e0:

    # "Habláis del bebé en camino y de cómo se está desarrollando el embarazo."
    "You talk about the baby on the way and how the pregnancy is coming along."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2776
translate english c32s004_routine_f52e073c:

    # "Habláis de cómo van las cosas en casa y habláis de la empresa."
    "You talk about how things are going at home and you talk about the company."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2777
translate english c32s004_routine_a5b5cb2b:

    # "Habláis de las preparaciones para la llegada de las estudiantes nuevas."
    "You talk about the preparations for the arrival of the new students."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2778
translate english c32s004_routine_0cbcc95c:

    # "Y, cuando no hay nada nuevo de lo que hablar, tan sólo disfrutáis de poder veros y escucharos."
    "And, when there's nothing new to talk about, you just enjoy being able to see and hear each other."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2780
translate english c32s004_routine_5edecc86:

    # "Mientras tanto, en la casa del CEO se ha instaurado una rutina nocturna."
    "Meanwhile, a nighttime routine has been established at the CEO's house."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2782
translate english c32s004_routine_8663e29d:

    # "Todas las noches acabáis durmiendo los tres en tu cama, como reforzando el lazo familiar que os falta con las chicas de casa."
    "Every night the three of you end up sleeping in your bed, as if reinforcing the family bond you're missing with the girls back home."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2784
translate english c32s004_routine_52ec13a4:

    # "Algunas noches acabáis durmiendo los tres en tu cama, como reforzando el lazo familiar que os falta con las chicas de casa."
    "Some nights the three of you end up sleeping in your bed, as if reinforcing the family bond you're missing with the girls back home."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2787
translate english c32s004_routine_16a82ebb:

    # "El resto de las noches las repartes entre las dos mujeres con las que convives."
    "The rest of the nights you split between the two women you live with."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2788
translate english c32s004_routine_b43d4424:

    # "Algunas veces parece que se ponen de acuerdo en quién tiene que pasar la noche contigo."
    "Sometimes it seems like they agree on who gets to spend the night with you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2789
translate english c32s004_routine_395c7f15:

    # "En otras ocasiones, un beso en algún lugar de la casa acaba en tu habitación, mientras la otra mujer desaparece discretamente."
    "On other occasions, a kiss somewhere in the house ends up in your room, while the other woman discreetly disappears."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2790
translate english c32s004_routine_0a5d5aba:

    # "[ama] disfruta de su recién descubierta sexualidad, mientras que [bet] recupera los años perdidos."
    "[ama] enjoys her newfound sexuality, while [bet] makes up for lots of years without sex."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2792
translate english c32s004_routine_e9434601:

    # "El día que les propusiste un trío, sus miradas te hicieron pasar más miedo del que pasaste cuando [erc] entró en casa de [nor]."
    "The day you proposed a threesome to them, their glares scared you more than when [erc] broke into [nor]'s house."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2794
translate english c32s004_routine_9a971442:

    # "No todas las mujeres quieren hacer un trío con todas las otras chicas del harén."
    "Not all women want to have a threesome with all the other girls in the harem."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2795
translate english c32s004_routine_e15fc081:

    # "El trío con [bet] y [ama] no se produjo durante vuestra estancia en Aruba."
    "The threesome with [bet] and [ama] didn't happen during your stay in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2798
translate english c32s004_routine_9f8e3b7c:

    # "El resto de las noches las pasas con [ama], que está disfrutando de su recién descubierta sexualidad."
    "You spend the rest of the nights with [ama], who is enjoying her newfound sexuality."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2799
translate english c32s004_routine_67507e9f:

    # "[bet] suele desaparecer discretamente cuando ve que empezáis a besaros apasionadamente."
    "[bet] usually disappears discreetly when she sees you start kissing passionately."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2802
translate english c32s004_routine_221f4f70:

    # "El resto de las noches las pasas con [bet], que está disfrutando de su recién redescubierta sexualidad y recuperando los años perdidos."
    "You spend the rest of the nights with [bet], who is enjoying her newly rediscovered sexuality and making up for lots of years without sex."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2803
translate english c32s004_routine_2e2880e9:

    # "[ama] suele desaparecer discretamente cuando ve que empezáis a besaros apasionadamente."
    "[ama] usually disappears discreetly when she sees you start kissing passionately."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2806
translate english c32s004_routine_02fabee4:

    # "Una mañana, después del desayuno, [bet] te informa de que está embarazada. Al final se ha decidido a hacer el test de embarazo."
    "One morning, after breakfast, [bet] informs you that she's pregnant. She finally decided to take the pregnancy test."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2809
translate english c32s004_routine_c93aaeb5:

    # "Por la noche, es [ama] quien te informa de su embarazo."
    "At night, it's [ama] who informs you of her pregnancy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2812
translate english c32s004_routine_d6482ace:

    # "Una noche, después de cenar, [ama] te informa de que está embarazada."
    "One night, after dinner, [ama] informs you that she's pregnant."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2814
translate english c32s004_routine_8dcd9e38:

    # "Quiere hablar con [mael] para saber si hay alguna implicación por ser un clon. Por suerte, no la hay."
    "She wants to talk to [mael] to find out if there are any implications due to being a clone. Luckily, there aren't any."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2816
translate english c32s004_routine_708fc72e:

    # "Salís los tres a cenar para celebrarlo al día siguiente."
    "The three of you go out to dinner to celebrate the next day."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2818
translate english c32s004_routine_78321954:

    # "Y la rutina continúa."
    "And the routine continues."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2823
translate english c32s004_routine_c883c67f:

    # "Y, algunos domingos, las partidas de DnD continúan por videoconferencia."
    "And, on some Sundays, the DnD sessions continue via video call."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2824
translate english c32s004_routine_8b56f67a:

    # "[dap] ha convencido a todas las chicas para que se unan a las partidas."
    "[dap] has convinced all the girls to join the games."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2829
translate english c32s004_routine_d125adf7:

    # "Es una forma de pasar más tiempo en familia y la mayoría de las chicas se unen encantadas."
    "It's a way to spend more time as a family, and most of the girls are happy to join."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2830
translate english c32s004_routine_ebd325c4:

    # "Como era de esperar, la partida se convierte en un caos con tanta gente y [sca] deja de ser DM asistente para serlo a tiempo completo."
    "As expected, the game turns into chaos with so many people, and [sca] goes from being an assistant DM to a full-time one."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2835
translate english c32s004_routine_42b442a2:

    # "Aunque la mayoría se hace personajes que se parecen a ellas, las elecciones de algunas de las chicas son extrañas."
    "Although most of them make characters that look like themselves, some of the girls' choices are strange."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2836
translate english c32s004_routine_c0d639c0:

    # "Como, por ejemplo, la clériga de [bet] y su temible rodillo de combate."
    "Like, for example, [bet]'s cleric and her fearsome combat rolling pin."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2840
translate english c32s004_routine_c092bf5a:

    # "O que [mar] decida que quiere jugar con el personaje de Marzia. O la enana de [deb.nick], obviamente, sin barba."
    "Or that [mar] decides she wants to play Marzia's character. Or [deb.nick]'s dwarf, obviously without a beard."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2841
translate english c32s004_routine_93b344a1:

    # "No todas las chicas encuentran el juego tan divertido como tú, pero todas continúan jugando."
    "Not all the girls find the game as fun as you do, but they all keep playing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2845
translate english c32s004_routine_9784811b:

    # "Incluso [eva], que se enfada cada vez que su personaje falla un disparo 'fácil' con el arco. Fallar a una moneda a 50 pasos..."
    "Even [eva], who gets mad every time her character misses an 'easy' shot with the bow. Missing a coin at 50 paces..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2846
translate english c32s004_routine_6bfa9611:

    # "Nadie quiere perderse lo que ha pasado en la partida y quedarse fuera de la conversación del día siguiente."
    "No one wants to miss what happened in the game and be left out of the conversation the next day."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2850
translate english c32s004_routine_833ef42b:

    # "Y, a menos que sea por razones de trabajo, ninguna de las chicas quiere perderse una actividad en familia."
    "And, unless it's for work reasons, none of the girls want to miss a family activity."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2851
translate english c32s004_routine_ead61bb8:

    # "Comida en familia, tarde en la piscina, cena, y partida de DnD se convierten en vuestra rutina más de la mitad de los domingos."
    "Family lunch, an afternoon at the pool, dinner, and a game of DnD become your routine on more than half of the Sundays."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2852
translate english c32s004_routine_47a83f05:

    # "Incluso una vez vuelvas a casa."
    "Even once you return home."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2866
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_862bf023:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 60 – VIERNES{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 60 – FRIDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2868
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_2fbe6d6b:

    # "Cuando llevas poco más de tres semanas en la isla, aprovechando un viaje para llevar suministros a [eva], el avión trae un regalo de Newport."
    "When you've been on the island for just over three weeks, taking advantage of a trip to bring supplies to [eva], the plane brings a gift from Newport."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2869
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_bb485d76:

    # "Acudes al hangar junto con [ama] y [bet] a recibir vuestro regalo."
    "You go to the hangar along with [ama] and [bet] to receive your gift."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2871
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_8e67b0d2:

    # "[mar] aparece en lo alto de la escalera tras unos eternos segundos de espera."
    "[mar] appears at the top of the stairs after a few eternal seconds of waiting."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2874
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_c0372c4b:

    # "Un momento después está entre tus brazos, presionando sus labios contra los tuyos."
    "A moment later she's in your arms, pressing her lips against yours."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2877
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_57c19b2f:

    # "Un momento después está entre tus brazos, dándote uno de esos abrazos que tanto has echado de menos."
    "A moment later she's in your arms, giving you one of those hugs you've missed so much for almost a month."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2879
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_cee85f1f:

    # mom "Te he echado mucho de menos."
    mom "I've missed you so much."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2880
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_e8cce6d8:

    # mc "Yo también. Las tres semanas aquí se me han hecho más largas que los tres años en Portland."
    mc "Me too. The three weeks here have felt longer than the three years in Portland."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2882
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_dd8527be:

