    "The nurse takes over your arms the moment [mar] frees them. Your lips, too."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2892
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_96bbbf2b:

    # "La enfermera ocupa tus brazos en el momento en que [mar] los deja libres."
    "The nurse takes over your arms the moment [mar] frees them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2894
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a9269717:

    # sam "No sé si echaba más de menos estos abrazos o a ti. En casa nadie abraza tan bien como tú."
    sam "I don't know if I missed these hugs more, or you. No one at home hugs as well as you do."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2895
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a8033ed5:

    # mc "Yo echaba de menos las dos cosas. Y eso que Tía [bet] y [ama] abrazan muy bien."
    mc "I missed both. Even though Aunt [bet] and [ama] give great hugs."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2897
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_b482f55f:

    # bet "Pero parece que nadie quiere abrazarme a mí. *Risa* ¡Me siento sola!"
    bet "But it seems like no one wants to hug me. *Laugh* I feel lonely!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2899
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_c5834025:

    # "Los abrazos entre las cuatro mujeres se suceden, y es el momento en que sientes tus brazos extrañamente vacíos."
    "The four women continue hugging each other, switching arms, and that's when you feel your arms strangely empty."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2901
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a80fe51d:

    # ama "Deberíamos irnos si queréis dejar las cosas en casa antes de que vayamos a comer."
    ama "We should get going if you want to drop your things off at the house before we go to have lunch."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2902
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_5c1dfd8b:

    # mom "Si es seguro dejar las maletas en el coche, no hace falta."
    mom "If it's safe to leave the bags in the car, there's no need."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2903
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_918c7e3b:

    # mc "Todavía tenemos tiempo, ¿no? Hemos hecho la reserva para dentro de más de una hora."
    mc "We still have time, right? We made the reservation for over an hour from now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2905
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_6a5478fd:

    # bet "Pero a lo mejor quieren ducharse y cambiarse antes de ir."
    bet "But maybe they want to shower and change before we go."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2906
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_097ce9a0:

    # mc "*Risa* Vale. Voy a llamar al restaurante y decirles que cambiamos la comida por una cena."
    mc "*Laugh* Okay. I'll call the restaurant and tell them we're changing lunch to dinner."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2907
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_541f8735:

    # sam "*Risa* No todas las mujeres tardamos dos horas en estar listas."
    sam "*Laugh* Not all women take two hours to get ready."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2908
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_1a169c20:

    # mc "*Risa* Tienes razón. No todas las mujeres tardan tanto. Tú sí."
    mc "*Laugh* You're right. Not all women take that long. You do."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2909
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_d7c1ebae:

    # sam "*Risa* Creo que voy a coger el avión de vuelta, si esta es la bienvenida que me espera."
    sam "*Laugh* I think I'm going to catch a flight back if this is the welcome I get."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2910
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_c24cdc35:

    # bet "Dejaos de bromas. Hay comida esperando."
    bet "Enough joking around. There's food waiting."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2913
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a867c9a2:

    # mc "Antes de nada, ¿cómo están nuestras pequeñajas?"
    mc "First of all, how are our little girls doing?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2920
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_ce5c2bc1:

    # mc "Antes de nada, ¿cómo está nuestra pequeñaja?"
    mc "First of all, how is our little girl doing?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2922
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_f0f3dd24:

    # mom "Todo va genial. El martes acompañé a [sam.nick] al hospital y no hay nada de lo que preocuparse."
    mom "Everything's going great. I went with [sam.nick] to the hospital on Tuesday, and there's nothing to worry about."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2923
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a3adb3e0:

    # sam "Estos padres primerizos... Hasta que no estés cambiando pañales no dejarás de preocuparte."
    sam "These first-time dads... You won't stop worrying until you're changing diapers."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2924
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_b0967253:

    # mc "*Risa* Y entonces me preocuparé por otras cosas."
    mc "*Laugh* And then, I'll worry about other things."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2926
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_396d0aed:

    # "Una vez en el coche..."
    "Once in the car..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2927
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_d0764ff6:

    # bet "Me alegró mucho cuando [mc] me dijo que veníais. Pero, ¿por qué habéis venido?"
    bet "I was so happy when [mc] told me you were coming. But, why did you come?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2928
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_288e7802:

    # mc "*Risa* Ha sonado como si te molestara."
    mc "*Laugh* That sounded like it bothered you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2930
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_cf92202c:

    # mom "No le hagas caso, Tía [bet]."
    mom "Don't listen to him, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2931
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_973f2d06:

    # mom "Hacía siglos que [sam.nick] no tenía tres días libres seguidos."
    mom "It's been ages since [sam.nick] had three days off in a row."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2933
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_47a855ba:

    # sam "Y [mar] no estará disponible a partir de la semana que viene, con la llegada de las estudiantes nuevas."
    sam "And [mar] won't be available starting next week, with the arrival of the new students."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2934
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_826d9f05:

    # sam "Cuando [eva] nos dijo que el avión volvía hoy y que podíamos aprovecharlo, no nos lo pensamos."
    sam "When [eva] told us the plane was coming back today and we could take advantage of it, we didn't think twice about it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2935
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a5d08602:

    # mc "Recordadme que le dé un beso extra a [eva] la semana que viene."
    mc "Remind me to give [eva] an extra kiss next week."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2937
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_e1f99348:

    # ama "¿Cómo está [eva]? A veces la noto rara por video conferencia, pero siempre me dice que no le pasa nada."
    ama "How is [eva]? Sometimes she seems weird on video calls, but she always tells me nothing's wrong."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2938
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_1d6b0a45:

    # ama "¿Sabéis algo más de las estudiantes nuevas? ¿Siguen mandando fotos?"
    ama "Do you know anything else about the new students? Are they still sending pictures?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2940
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_f234131b:

    # mom "[eva] está bien, pero está muy cansada. Ahora tiene que hacer el trabajo que hacíais las dos y duerme muy poco."
    mom "[eva] is fine, but she's very tired. Now she has to do the work you two used to do and she sleeps very little."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2942
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_b149502c:

    # mom "Le hemos dicho que tiene que cuidarse y descansar, por el bebé, pero siempre dice que no tiene tiempo."
    mom "We've told her she has to take care of herself and rest, for the baby, but she always says she doesn't have time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2943
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_877b54bf:

    # mc "Bueno, cuando volváis el domingo os llevaréis a seis chicos que la ayudarán. Creo que eso le dará un poco de descanso."
    mc "Well, when you go back on Sunday you'll take seven guys with you to help her. I think that will give her some rest."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2945
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_696d8aab:

    # sam "Estoy segura de que seguirá siendo una cabezona y no querrá descansar. Lo querrá hacer todo ella misma."
    sam "I'm sure she'll still be stubborn and won't want to rest. She'll want to do everything herself."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2946
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_464fa25d:

    # sam "Y sobre las estudiantes nuevas..."
    sam "And about the new students..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2947
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_54ec21bd:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa? ¿Hay algún problema con ellas? [eri] me dijo que eran muy simpáticas."
    mc "What's wrong? Is there a problem with them? [eri] told me they were very nice."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2949
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_05ff15a0:

    # mom "*Risa* [sam.nick] se siente un poco dejada de lado con ellas."
    mom "*Laugh* [sam.nick] feels a bit left out with them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2950
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_ba7e34d4:

    # mom "Desde que [eri] creó el grupo de WhatsUp para ellas, han ido entrando todas las chicas de casa."
    mom "Ever since [eri] created the WhatsUp group for them, all the girls in the house have been joining."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2951
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_ce07e56f:

    # mom "Pero a las ancianas nos han dejado fuera."
    mom "But they left us old ladies out."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2953
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_d9d1f0f8:

    # bet "Es normal. [nor] y tú sois sus caseras. [dap], [eri] y [sca] van a ser sus compañeras de piso hasta cierto punto."
    bet "It makes sense. [nor] and you are their landladies. [dap], [eri], and [sca] are going to be their roommates to some extent."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2954
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_24962687:

    # bet "Y las chicas de tu casa, incluyendo a [emm], [eil] y [sim] son estudiantes como ellas."
    bet "And the girls in your house, including [emm], [eil], and [sim], are students just like them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2955
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_99f98cf2:

    # mc "Si os sirve de consuelo, a mí tampoco me han metido en el grupo de WhatsUp. ¡Ni siquiera estoy en vuestro grupo!"
    mc "If it's any consolation, they haven't added me to the WhatsUp group either. I'm not even in your group!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2957
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a172a838:

    # ama "*Risa* ¿Dónde íbamos a poder criticarte si estuvieras?"
    ama "*Laugh* Where would we be able to criticize you if you were in it?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2958
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_97a7f1f1:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Usáis el grupo en el que no estoy para criticarme?"
    mc "*Laugh* You guys use the group I'm not in to criticize me?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2959
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_966f470d:

    # ama "*Risa* No me hagas responder a esa pregunta."
    ama "*Laugh* Don't make me answer that question."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2960
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_24fceda1:

    # mc "*Risa* Y tú no me hagas decirle a [geo] que te hackee el móvil y me mande los mensajes."
    mc "*Laugh* And don't make me tell [geo] to hack your phone and send me the messages."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2962
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_b3b94564:

    # todas "*Risa*"
    todas "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2963
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_906f033f:

    # "[mar] y [sam] saben quién es [geo], y saben cómo son sus camisetas. Igual que saben quiénes son [mael], [cal], [dam] y [car]."
    "[mar] and [sam] know who [geo] is, and they know what his shirts look like. Just like they know who [mael], [cal], [dam], and [car] are."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2964
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_04353ee7:

    # "Incluso saben quién es [vin] y el tamaño que tienen sus manos."
    "They even know who [vin] is and the size of his hands."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2965
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a263462a:

    # "Hablar de las personas a las que has conocido en Aruba no centra las conversaciones, pero es una parte de ellas."
    "Talking about the people you've met in Aruba isn't the focus of the conversations, but it's a part of them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2968
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_c284664c:

    # "Al final, ninguna de las dos mujeres necesita cambiarse, con lo que vais directamente al restaurante."
    "In the end, neither of the two women needs to change, so you go straight to the restaurant."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2969
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_8f1b382e:

    # "Vais a comer a un sitio que descubrió [bet]. Es la que más tiempo libre tiene de los tres y ha estado explorando la isla."
    "You go eat at a place [bet] discovered. She has the most free time out of the three of you, and has been exploring the island."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2970
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_cde35350:

    # "Especialmente los restaurantes."
    "Especially the restaurants."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2971
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_7151639b:

    # "Habláis sobre todo y sobre nada. La mayoría de lo que decís os lo habéis dicho previamente por videoconferencia."
    "You talk about everything and nothing. Most of what you say, you've already told each other over video calls."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2972
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_82d8e6c1:

    # "Pero es agradable hacerlo en persona en vez de a través de una pantalla."
    "But it's nice to do it in person instead of through a screen."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2973
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_6fb0099b:

    # "Hay muchas risas. También hay mucho más contacto del habitual. Como si todos quisierais aseguraros de que [mar] y [sam] están realmente allí."
    "There are a lot of laughs. There's also a lot more touching than usual. As if you all wanted to make sure [mar] and [sam] are really there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2974
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_b2cced98:

    # "Ni siquiera [bet] se queja porque el servicio sea lento. Todos disfrutáis del momento sin prisas."
    "Not even [bet] complains about the slow service. You all enjoy the moment without rushing."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2975
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_1d160eb8:

    # "La rama de la familia en Aruba ha crecido, aunque sólo sea por un par de días."
    "The Aruba branch of the family has grown, even if only for a couple of days."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2976
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_6ab4542c:

    # "Es la excusa perfecta para cogerte tus primeros días libres desde que has llegado."
    "It's the perfect excuse to take your first days off since you arrived."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2978
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_6b76642f:

    # "Al llegar a la casa del CEO, después de enseñarles un poco la ciudad, hay un coche de NTR esperándoos."
    "Upon arriving at the CEO's house, after showing them around the city a bit, there's an NTR car waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2979
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_0d6658ce:

    # "[aar] tiene cara de preocupación."
    "[aar] has a worried look on his face."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2981
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_adf94adf:

    # mc "No esperaba verte aquí hoy."
    mc "I didn't expect to see you here today."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2982
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_170e8dfa:

    # aar "No podía dejar de saludar a [mar]."
    aar "I couldn't miss saying hi to [mar]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2983
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_937b9978:

    # mc "¿Y esa cara? ¿Ha pasado algo?"
    mc "What's with that look? Did something happen?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2984
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_c4f5e91b:

    # aar "Me preocupa que..."
    aar "I'm worried about..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2987
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_58173ecc:

    # mom "¡No puede ser!"
    mom "It can't be true!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2990
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_8b094493:

    # aar "Esto..."
    aar "This..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2991
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_2432cf35:

    # mom "¿Por qué no me habíais dicho que eras el clon de [mc]?"
    mom "Why didn't you tell me you were [mc]'s clone?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2992
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_920373fb:

    # mc "No es algo que se pueda decir por videoconferencia."
    mc "It's not exactly something you can say over a video call."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2994
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_985e95b0:

    # mom "Deja que te mire..."
    mom "Let me look at you..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2995
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_eb462752:

    # mom "No sé cómo no me di cuenta el día que te conocí..."
    mom "I don't know how I didn't realize it the day I met you..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2996
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_e491ba55:

    # mc "Sólo tenías ojos para [ama] y [eva]. Supongo que no nos miraste ni a [aar] ni a mí más de un segundo."
    mc "You only had eyes for [ama] and [eva]. I guess you didn't look at [aar] or me for more than a second."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2997
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_7d4e6ac7:

    # mc "A ellas les pasó lo mismo, y lo conocen desde hace más tiempo."
    mc "The same thing happened to them, and they've known him for a long time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:2998
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_bf0dd462:

    # mc "Déjame que le presente a [sam.nick]."
    mc "Let me introduce him to [sam.nick]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3000
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_9c5546c8:

    # aar "*Susurrando* Gracias..."
    aar "*Whispering* Thank you..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3001
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_15f092e0:

    # mc "No me lo agradezcas todavía."
    mc "Don't thank me yet."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3004
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_e40df1f9:

    # sam "Encantada de conocerte por fin, [aar]."
    sam "Nice to finally meet you, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3005
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_80223504:

    # aar "*Resignado* Igualmente, [sam]."
    aar "*Resigned* Likewise, [sam]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3006
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_7a11fc71:

    # sam "Llámame [sam.nick]."
    sam "Call me [sam.nick]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3007
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_c76d8b20:

    # mc "*Risa* Te he dicho que no me lo agradecieras."
    mc "*Laugh* I told you not to thank me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3009
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_85768376:

    # "[bet] y [ama] miran la escena con expresiones risueñas que las otras dos mujeres no pueden entender."
    "[bet] and [ama] watch the scene with amused expressions that the other two women can't understand."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3010
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_55a245e8:

    # "[aar] y tú las entendéis perfectamente. Estás seguro de que han hecho apuestas sobre cuándo [aar] se acostumbrará a los abrazos de la familia."
    "[aar] and you understand them perfectly. You're sure they've made bets on when [aar] will get used to the family hugs."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3012
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_d3258720:

    # mom "[sam.nick], recuerda que no has traído el ungüento para los moretones."
    mom "[sam.nick], remember you didn't bring the ointment for bruises."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3013
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_10db7439:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso suena a 'Suéltalo, que no lo he abrazado lo suficiente.'"
    mc "*Laugh* That sounds like 'Let him go, I haven't hugged him enough.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3015
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_ffc28542:

    # mom "No es eso... del todo. Quiero hablar con [aar] de algunas cosas. Me parece que no se alimenta bien."
    mom "It's not that... entirely. I want to talk to [aar] about a few things. It doesn't seem like he's eating well."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3016
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a3e4b40e:

    # mom "[ama], Tía [bet], y tú parece que sí que lo hacéis."
    mom "[ama], Aunt [bet], and you seem to be eating well, though."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3018
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_de0c1d2b:

    # bet "De nosotros se ocupa [car], aunque a veces pida combinaciones... controvertidas... en la pizza."
    bet "[car] takes care of us, even though she sometimes orders... controversial... pizza combinations."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3019
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_5f8b40e2:

    # bet "Creo que aún se está vengando por el día en que nos conocimos."
    bet "I think she's still getting revenge for the day we met."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3021
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_06a70a9d:

    # ama "[aar] come lo mismo que el resto de los chicos."
    ama "[aar] eats the same as the rest of the guys."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3022
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_fbaae3d1:

    # ama "Es nutritivo, pero ni es variado ni tiene nada que ver con lo que cocinas tú en casa, ... [mar]."
    ama "It's nutritious, but it's not varied, nor is it anything like what you cook at home, ... [mar]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3024
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_9bdc45d9:

    # mom "Si me decís qué ingredientes soléis usar, puedo diseñar menús semanales y mandároslos por email."
    mom "If you tell me what ingredients you usually use, I can design weekly menus and email them to you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3025
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_788b4ad4:

    # mom "Al menos será comida más variada."
    mom "At least it'll be more varied food."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3027
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_84820aed:

    # "El pobre [aar] no sabe por dónde le están viniendo los tiros."
    "Poor [aar] has no idea about what hit him."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3028
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_224f8a52:

    # "[mar] ni tan siquiera ha pisado la base de NTR y ya se quiere hacer cargo de la cocina."
    "[mar] hasn't even set foot in the NTR base and she already wants to take charge of the kitchen."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3029
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_7eeaf67e:

    # mc "Voy a ir bajando las maletas a vuestras habitaciones."
    mc "I'm going to take the bags down to your rooms."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3031
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_4587df50:

    # sam "Te acompaño. *Susurrando* Tengo que pelearme contigo."
    sam "I'll come with you. *Whispering* I have a bone to pick with you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3032
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_3ff5d0f1:

    # mc "¿Algo grave?"
    mc "Anything serious?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3033
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_5b15ffb1:

    # sam "*Susurrando* En privado."
    sam "*Whispering* In private."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3036
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_7fdaf1fb:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa, [sam.nick]?"
    mc "What's wrong, [sam.nick]?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3037
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_c1f4f9b6:

    # sam "Estoy MUY enfadada contigo. Te dije que dejaras mis deudas en paz y que no quería que las pagaras."
    sam "I am VERY angry with you. I told you to leave my debts alone and that I didn't want you to pay them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3038
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_ade0037b:

    # mc "No las he pagado. Las he comprado. Sabía que no querías que las pagara y no lo hubiera hecho a tus espaldas."
    mc "I didn't pay them. I bought them. I knew you didn't want me to pay them and I wouldn't have done it behind your back."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3040
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_e4114ab0:

    # sam "*Grrr* ¡Es casi lo mismo!"
    sam "*Grrr* It's almost the same thing!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3041
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_ab97623c:

    # mc "No. Antes tenías cuatro préstamos con dos bancos diferentes."
    mc "No. Before, you had four loans with two different banks."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3042
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_2ed26177:

    # mc "Ahora tienes cuatro préstamos conmigo."
    mc "Now you have four loans with me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3044
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_24d96832:

    # sam "Y en vez de pagar más de $3,000 al mes en préstamos tengo que pagar $20. ¿Tú crees que es lógico?"
    sam "And instead of paying over $3,000 a month in loans, I only have to pay $20? Do you think that makes sense?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3045
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_2eefeb79:

    # mc "Yo lo hubiera dejado en un dólar al mes, pero [nor] pensó que era muy poco y que te ofenderías."
    mc "I would have left it at a dollar a month, but [nor] thought that was too little and you'd get offended."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3046
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_d6653a31:

    # mc "Lo dejamos en cinco dólares por préstamo."
    mc "We left it at five dollars per loan."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3048
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_3dad7ad3:

    # sam "¿Sois idiotas? ¿Creíais que no me iba a ofender con esto? ¡Te dije que no aceptábamos caridad!"
    sam "Are you idiots? Did you think I wouldn't get offended by this? I told you we don't accept charity!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3049
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_b83f4d48:

    # mc "No es caridad. Vas a pagar todo lo que debes. Bueno, tú y tus herederos, durante los próximos cuatrocientos años más o menos."
    mc "It's not charity. You're going to pay everything you owe. Well, you and your heirs, for the next four hundred years or so."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3051
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a0c0de0c:

    # mc "Y si nuestro bebé quiere condonar su parte de la deuda cuando herede, será decisión suya. Se deberá dinero a sí mismo."
    mc "And if our baby wants to forgive their part of the debt when they inherit, that'll be their decision. They'll owe money to themselves."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3053
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_dbf26180:

    # sam "Voy a contestar a mi pregunta. Sí, sois idiotas. ¡No tenías por qué haberlo hecho!"
    sam "I'm going to answer my own question. Yes, you're idiots. You didn't have the right to do this!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3055
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_8e3150bf:

    # mc "Te equivocas. Si tengo los medios para que mi orgullosa y cabezota mujer pueda vivir más desahogada, no me voy a quedar de brazos cruzados."
    mc "You're wrong. If I have the means for my proud and stubborn wife to live more comfortably, I'm not going to just sit idly by."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3057
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a0985f49:

    # mc "Te equivocas. Si tengo los medios para que mi orgullosa y cabezota pseudo-madre pueda vivir más desahogada, no me voy a quedar de brazos cruzados."
    mc "You're wrong. If I have the means for my proud and stubborn pseudo-mother to live more comfortably, I'm not going to just sit idly by."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3058
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_943e4b14:

    # mc "No he pagado tus deudas. *Risa* Ahora me debes el dinero a mí y no voy a perdonarte ni un centavo."
    mc "I haven't paid off your debts. *Laugh* Now you owe the money to me, and I'm not going to forgive a single cent."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3059
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_8ca69812:

    # mc "Lo que me extraña es que no me hayas echado la bronca por videoconferencia."
    mc "What surprises me is that you didn't chew me out over a video call."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3061
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_994fcea3:

    # sam "No lo sabía. El primer cargo llegó ayer."
    sam "I didn't know. The first charge came through yesterday."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3062
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_5f4527ef:

    # sam "Los bancos sólo me habían avisado de que las deudas se habían subrogado a una empresa llamada MILFS. El nombre me pareció divertido."
    sam "The banks had only notified me that the debts had been transferred to a company called MILFS. I thought the name was funny."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3063
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_8e77513d:

    # sam "No es la primera vez que me subrogan un crédito."
    sam "It's not the first time a loan of mine has been transferred."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3065
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_256874df:

    # sam "Cuando ayer vi los cargos, creía que había un error."
    sam "When I saw the charges yesterday, I thought there was a mistake."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3066
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_4fb97c4f:

    # sam "Hasta que vi que MILFS era el acrónimo de Marks Investment, Loan & Financial Services."
    sam "Until I saw that MILFS was an acronym for Marks Investment, Loan & Financial Services."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3067
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_025c94ef:

    # sam "Como te iba a ver hoy, decidí no decir nada. Quería echarte la bronca cara a cara."
    sam "Since I was going to see you today, I decided not to say anything. I wanted to chew you out face to face."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3068
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_636f942d:

    # mc "El nombre de la empresa fue idea de tu hijo."
    mc "The company name was your son's idea."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3070
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_e62145d1:

    # sam "¿Él estaba al tanto de esto? ¡Se va a quedar meses sin comer pastelillos!"
    sam "He knew about this? He's going to go months without cupcakes!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3071
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_d7760c7e:

    # mc "*Risa* Estoy tentado de decirte que sí solo para castigarlo."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm tempted to say yes just to punish him."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3072
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_8f8d4bef:

    # mc "Pero él solo sabía que iba a fundar una compañía financiera que iba a adquirir tus préstamos."
    mc "But he only knew that I was going to found a financial company that would acquire your loans."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3073
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_4cef7b37:

    # mc "Mi idea inicial era que pudieras dejar de pagar si un mes lo necesitabas, pero [nor] pensó que rebajar la cuota sería mejor."
    mc "My initial idea was that you could skip a payment any month if you needed to, but [nor] thought lowering the fee would be better."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3074
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_164f0b61:

    # mc "Nos dimos cuenta de que nunca dejarías de pagar, aunque tuvieras que comer ramen todos los días."
    mc "We realized you'd never stop paying, even if you had to eat ramen every day."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3076
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_18856adb:

    # sam "¡Por supuesto que no iba a dejar de pagar!"
    sam "Of course I wasn't going to stop paying!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3077
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_8c47bf67:

    # mc "Bueno, ahora no tienes por qué hacerlo. Son solo $20. *Risa* Y MILFS no te los va a perdonar."
    mc "Well, now you don't have to. It's only $20. *Laugh* And MILFS isn't going to let you off the hook."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3078
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_0494c8b2:

    # mc "Tú eres la primera clienta y [nor] actúa como administradora mientras estoy fuera, con lo que el nombre de la empresa va que ni pintado."
    mc "You're the first customer and [nor] is acting as the administrator while I'm away, so the company name fits perfectly."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3080
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_b5c2cf87:

    # sam "*Risa* ¡No lo había pensado! ¿Vas a ofrecer préstamos a todas las maduritas de Newport?"
    sam "*Laugh* I hadn't thought of that! Are you going to offer loans to all the MILFs in Newport?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3081
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a89a9c23:

    # mc "*Risa* Aún no he decidido si voy a tener más clientes. Supongo que los emails de [mc]@milfs.com acabarían en la bandeja de spam de mucha gente."
    mc "*Laugh* I haven't decided if I'm going to take on more clients yet. I guess emails from [mc]@milfs.com would end up in a lot of people's spam folders."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3082
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_9f7093a0:

    # mc "Y muchos maridos tendrían que dar explicaciones a sus mujeres si reciben correo de MILFS."
    mc "And a lot of husbands would have some explaining to do to their wives if they got mail from MILFS."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3086
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_adf4e5fc:

    # sam "Gracias por hacer esto, [mc]. Pero no vuelvas a hacer nada por el estilo sin mi consentimiento."
    sam "Thank you for doing this, [mc]. But don't ever do anything like this again without my consent."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3087
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_13a8d624:

    # mc "Si no pides préstamos nuevos, no tendré que volver a hacerlo."
    mc "If you don't take out any new loans, I won't have to do it again."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3089
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_0cd9f39c:

    # mom "Ah, estáis aquí. Os estaba buscando. [nor] me dio este paquete para ti."
    mom "Ah, there you are. I was looking for you. [nor] gave me this package for you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3090
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_f5b226b8:

    # mc "¿Qué es?"
    mc "What is it?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3091
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_6e4ac718:

    # mom "Como te decía en Navidad cuando eras un niño, ábrelo y lo sabrás."
    mom "Like I used to tell you on Christmas when you were a kid, open it and you'll see."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3093
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_f057ccd6:

    # mc "*Risa*"
    mc "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3094
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_b44e601d:

    # "Solo a [nor] se le podría haber ocurrido hacer merchandising de la nueva empresa."
    "Only [nor] could have come up with making merch for the new company."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3095
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_3178eb4c:

    # mom "¿Qué pasa? Solo es una taza."
    mom "What's wrong? It's just a mug."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3097
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_ad8835a8:

    # mc "[nor] tiene ideas muy locas de vez en cuando."
    mc "[nor] has some crazy ideas from time to time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3098
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_59ad6705:

    # sam "*Risa* ¡Me encanta!"
    sam "*Laugh* I love it!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3099
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_bb7a3c92:

    # mom "No entiendo nada."
    mom "I don't get it."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3100
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_f4929254:

    # mc "Es una larga historia. Aunque dudo que pueda convencer a [car] para que me haga el café en esta taza a partir de ahora."
    mc "It's a long story. Though I doubt I'll be able to convince [car] to make my coffee in this mug from now on."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3102
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_4b31185d:

    # mom "Cuéntanos la historia durante la cena. Y tengo ganas de conocer a [car]. [ama] está hablando con ella ahora mismo."
    mom "Tell us the story over dinner. And I can't wait to meet [car]. [ama] is talking to her right now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3103
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_86740687:

    # mc "¿Ha pasado algo?"
    mc "Did something happen?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3104
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_8cc34bdb:

    # mom "Le he pedido a [aar] que se quede a cenar, y no tenéis comida de verdad. [bet] me ha dicho que [car] envía la cena cada noche."
    mom "I've asked [aar] to stay for dinner, and you don't have any real food. [bet] told me that [car] sends dinner every night."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3106
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_39c4177f:

    # bet "*Risa* No mientas, [mar]. No le has pedido que se quede. Casi le has obligado."
    bet "*Laugh* Don't lie, [mar]. You didn't ask him to stay. You practically ordered him to."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3107
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_093e82a9:

    # bet "*Imitando a [mar]* 'Acabo de conocer al clon de mi niño. No voy a aceptar que te vayas a cenar rancho a la base.'"
    bet "*Imitating [mar]* 'I just met my baby boy's clone. I'm not going to accept you going back to eat military rations at the base.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3108
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_2bd72261:

    # bet "*Imitando a [mar]* 'Y ahora vete a lavar las manos mientras voy a buscar a [mc]. Tengo algo que darle'"
    bet "*Imitating [mar]* 'And now go wash your hands while I go get [mc]. I have something to give him.'"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3109
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_b3b94564_1:

    # todas "*Risa*"
    todas "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3112
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_3dbbedf1:

    # "La cena transcurre entre risas e historias compartidas."
    "Dinner passes with laughter and shared stories."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3113
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_f436b8be:

    # "[sam] y [mar] alaban la elección de platos de [car], aunque se sorprenden de que [bet] solo tenga una pizza."
    "[sam] and [mar] praise [car]'s choice of dishes, although they are surprised that [bet] only has a pizza."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3114
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_1a0b4d0d:

    # "También explican un montón de historias antiguas de la familia. Algunas son embarazosas para ti."
    "They also tell a bunch of old family stories. Some of them are embarrassing for you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3115
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_2a3775d2:

    # "[aar] las escucha todas ávidamente. Quizás es la primera vez que cena con una familia de verdad."
    "[aar] listens to all of them eagerly. Maybe it's the first time he's had dinner with a real family."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3116
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_d4100cfa:

    # "No será la última."
    "It won't be the last time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3118
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_a014ecc6:

    # "Después de cenar llegan las despedidas."
    "After dinner, it's time for goodbyes."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3119
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_745bd575:

    # "La incomodidad de [aar] con los abrazos sigue existiendo, pero esta noche ha hecho que, quizás, sea un poco más pequeña."
    "[aar]'s discomfort with hugs is still there, but tonight has made it, perhaps, a little bit smaller."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3120
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_283eb775:

    # "[mar] le pide que se una el día siguiente para la visita turística a la base y a la isla."
    "[mar] asks him to join you the next day for the sightseeing tour of the base and the island."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3121
translate english c32s004_MarSamArrival_052e7321:

    # "Para tu sorpresa, [aar] acepta encantado."
    "To your surprise, [aar] gladly accepts."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3130
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_e39d4b8c:

    # "Después de cenar y de darte una ducha..."
    "After having dinner and taking a shower..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3131
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3132
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_95219ae1:

    # mc "Pasad las dos."
    mc "Come in, both of you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3134
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_50406d75:

    # sam "Aún me da miedo preguntar cómo sabes quién llama. O cómo sabes que estábamos las dos."
    sam "I'm still afraid to ask how you know who's knocking. Or how you knew both of us were there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3135
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_85fa64ed:

    # mom "Hoy no me creo que sea porque has reconocido los nudillos."
    mom "Today, I don't believe it's because you recognized the knuckles."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3136
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_3beec4e1:

    # mc "Los nudillos eran los de [sam.nick]."
    mc "The knuckles were [sam.nick]'s."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3137
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_d0f7ffd8:

    # mc "Pero sabía que no podríais decidir quién iba a dormir aquí hoy. Yo tampoco hubiera podido."
    mc "But I knew you wouldn't be able to decide who was going to sleep here today. I wouldn't have been able to either."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3138
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_a2574667:

    # mc "*Risa* Y, viendo cómo venís vestidas, no creo que tengáis mucha intención de dormir ninguna de las dos."
    mc "*Laugh* And, seeing how you're both dressed, I don't think either of you has much intention of sleeping."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3144
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_30b9efa6:

    # sam "*Risita* Al menos por un rato..."
    sam "*Giggle* At least for a while..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3145
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_9fcbc552:

    # mc "Y supongo que ninguna estáis cansadas."
    mc "And I guess neither of you are tired."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3151
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_bea53bd8:

    # mom "*Risita* Para nosotras todavía es por la tarde."
    mom "*Giggle* It's still the afternoon for us."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3152
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_ff1e5e8b:

    # mc "*Risa* Bendito jet lag y benditas zonas horarias."
    mc "*Laugh* Blessed jet lag and blessed time zones."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3154
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_7d6d4581:

    # mc "Pero ninguna de las dos habéis traído tacones... a veces os odio."
    mc "But neither of you brought heels... Sometimes I hate you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3155
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_50e725bd:

    # sam "¡No cabían en la maleta!"
    sam "They didn't fit in the suitcase!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3156
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_1ae236a9:

    # mom "Mis tacones sí que cabían en la mía, pero no quería que [sam.nick] pareciera una enana."
    mom "My heels did fit in mine, but I didn't want [sam.nick] to look like a dwarf."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3157
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_96f6c364:

    # mc "[sam.nick], sabes que no hubieras pagado por exceso de equipaje si hubieras traído una maleta más grande, ¿no?"
    mc "[sam.nick], you know you wouldn't have to pay for excess baggage if you brought a bigger suitcase, right?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3159
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_0a5b87cd:

    # sam "Pero mis hijos se hubieran reído de mí si traigo una maleta grande para un fin de semana."
    sam "But my kids would have laughed at me, if I brought a big suitcase for a weekend."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3160
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_18e97175:

    # mom "*Risa* Tienes que dejar de permitir que tus hijos dirijan tu vida. Eres una mujer casada."
    mom "*Laugh* You have to stop letting your kids run your life. You're a married woman now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3161
translate english c32s005_MarSamThreesome_e071cdb7:

    # mc "Tú también. Y vuestro marido aún está esperando su beso."
    mc "You too. And your husband is still waiting for his kiss."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3163
