    "And, at night, [sam] decides to sleep with [bet], leaving the bed to [mar] and you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4281
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_15dcd509:

    # "Y, por la noche, [mar] decide dormir con [ama], dejándoos la cama a [sam] y a ti."
    "And, at night, [mar] decides to sleep with [ama], leaving the bed to [sam] and you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4284
