translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_4c7dd731:

    # "Es vuestra última noche juntos por una temporada, y ninguno de vosotros tiene prisa en dormir."
    "It's your last night together for a while, and none of you are in a hurry to sleep."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4288
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_d7198317:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 62 – DOMINGO{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 62 – SUNDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4290
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_d02f66e2:

    # "El día siguiente, el día de la partida, llega demasiado pronto."
    "The next day, the day of departure, arrives all too soon."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4291
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_0bc261c6:

    # ama "Les he dicho a los chicos del equipo de seguridad que estén aquí en una hora para presentároslos."
    ama "I've told the guys from the security team to be here in an hour to introduce them to you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4292
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_9da06f6e:

    # ama "Después iremos al aeropuerto. Volarán con vosotros de vuelta a Newport."
    ama "Then we'll go to the airport. They'll fly back to Newport with you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4293
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_be8a8715:

    # mc "¿A quién has escogido finalmente?"
    mc "Who did you finally choose?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4301
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_1999cf08:

    # ama "He escogido a chicos de diferentes series. [ces], [dam], [fra], [hen], [isr], [jan] y [kei]. Así no habrá problemas si los ven juntos. "
    ama "I've chosen guys from different series. [ces], [dam], [fra], [hen], [isr], [jan], and [kei]. That way there won't be any problems if they're seen together."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4302
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_8ec37b1a:

    # ama "Y, si se producen confusiones cuando se haga el relevo con otros chicos de la misma serie, siempre pueden pasar por gemelos."
    ama "And, if there's any confusion when they swap with the next guys from the same series, they can always pass for twins."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4303
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_0edc396d:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Tenías ganas de deshacerte de [dam]?"
    mc "*Laugh* Were you eager to get rid of [dam]?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4305
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_b82b1ec9:

    # ama "Su solicitud estaba la primera y creo que puede mostrar liderazgo en el equipo, después de lo que hizo en el viejo campo de tiro."
    ama "His application was first one in the pile, and I think he can show leadership in the team, after what he did at the old shooting range."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4306
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_e8eab591:

    # mc "Me parece una buena elección."
    mc "Sounds like a good choice to me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4307
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_3b51522d:

    # ama "Además, más que librarme de él, voy a tener que aguantarlo durante un mes cuando yo vuelva a Newport."
    ama "Besides, rather than getting rid of him, I'm going to have to put up with him for a month when I go back to Newport."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4309
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_338ada2b:

    # mar "¿Siete chicos? ¿Necesitamos tanta seguridad? ¿Dónde los vamos a alojar?"
    mar "Seven guys? Do we need that much security? Where are we going to house them?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4310
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_b4fea988:

    # mc "Se alojarán en la hacienda que [ama] y [eva] han usado como base. Ayudarán a reformarlo para que sea un sitio digno donde vivir."
    mc "They'll stay at the hacienda that [ama] and [eva] have been using as a base. They'll help renovate it so it's a decent place to live."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4311
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_e79cc878:

    # mc "Y son necesarios siete chicos porque no queremos que hagan lo mismo que hacían [eva] y [ama]. Se acabó estar de guardia 24 horas."
    mc "And seven guys are necessary because we don't want them doing the same thing [eva] and [ama] did. Being on watch 24 hours a day is over."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4312
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_ec5bd3bf:

    # mc "Con siete operativos y un octavo que se unirá en breve, se pueden montar turnos de descanso adecuados."
    mc "With seven operatives and an eighth joining shortly, proper rest shifts can be set up."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4314
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_06ff61a1:

