    # mc "Creo que hasta [aar] va a echarlas de menos."
    mc "I think even [aar] is going to miss them."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4407
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_d0b076f7:

    # aar "Son muy... agradables."
    aar "They are very... nice."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4408
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_ef3fcfbe:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que te tendremos que dar nosotros su ración de abrazos."
    mc "*Laugh* I think we'll have to give you their share of hugs ourselves."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4409
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_74a7d883:

    # bet "*Risa* Y yo creo que, si lo hacemos, [aar] va a pedir el traslado a alguna oscura base en la Antártida."
    bet "*Laugh* And I think if we do, [aar] will ask for a transfer to some obscure base in Antarctica."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4411
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_a184399d:

    # ama "*Risa* No tenemos bases en la Antártida, pero [aar] se acostumbrará a los abrazos antes de que te vayas, Tía [bet]."
    ama "*Laugh* We don't have bases in Antarctica, but [aar] will get used to hugs before you leave, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4412
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_99ad5ef5:

    # aar "¿Podéis dejar el tema de los abrazos de una vez?"
    aar "Can you drop the hug thing already?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4413
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_ba637e21:

    # mc "Sólo si vienes a cenar a casa. Órdenes de [mar]."
    mc "Only if you come over for dinner. [mar]'s orders."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4414
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_95df4376:

    # aar "Trato hecho."
    aar "Deal."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4415
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_b98328a6:

    # ama "*Risa* Entonces dejaremos los abrazos para después de cenar."
    ama "*Laugh* Then we'll save the hugs for after dinner."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4416
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_0d524ac6:

    # aar "*Gruñido*"
    aar "*Grunt*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4417
translate english c32s006_AmaSecTeam_b3b94564:

    # todas "*Risa*"
    todas "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4421
translate english c32s006_Hailey_6bd107c2:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 64 – MARTES{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 64 – TUESDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4422
translate english c32s006_Hailey_0b813ea9:

    # "Los días continúan con la rutina habitual, a la que se suman las cenas con [aar]."
    "The days continue with the usual routine, now including dinners with [aar]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4424
translate english c32s006_Hailey_14b8fb1e:

    # "También continúan las videoconferencias a casa. Después de la visita de [sam] y [mar], echas de menos incluso más a las chicas en casa."
    "Video calls back home also continue. After [sam] and [mar]'s visit, you miss the girls at home even more."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4425
translate english c32s006_Hailey_5986051d:

    # mc "¿Así que ya ha llegado la primera estudiante? ¿Cómo es?"
    mc "So the first student has already arrived? What's she like?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4426
translate english c32s006_Hailey_7c9f657a:

    # dap "*Risa* Guapísima."
    dap "*Laugh* Gorgeous."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4427
translate english c32s006_Hailey_059241e7:

    # mc "*Risa* No me refería a eso, sino a nivel de personalidad."
    mc "*Laugh* I didn't mean that, I meant personality-wise."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4429
translate english c32s006_Hailey_8928953d:

    # dap "Aún no lo sé. Es demasiado pronto para eso."
    dap "I don't know yet. It's too early for that."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4430
translate english c32s006_Hailey_f9a50126:

    # dap "Pero ya ha habido un par de anécdotas divertidas."
    dap "But there have already been a couple of funny anecdotes."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4431
translate english c32s006_Hailey_fd0578ac:

    # mc "Por ejemplo..."
    mc "For example..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4433
translate english c32s006_Hailey_3b2d1dc1:

    # dap "La primera ha sido cuando atravesábamos SLO y dice..."
    dap "The first one was when we were driving through SLO and she says..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4436
translate english c32s006_Hailey_2fd0409a:

    # hai "En esta ciudad hay más gente que en todo mi condado..."
    hai "There are more people in this city than in my entire county..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4437
translate english c32s006_Hailey_4db2fcf4:

    # hai "Mi hermano dice que voy a echar de menos los caballos, y creo que tiene razón."
    hai "My brother says I'm going to miss the horses, and I think he's right."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4439
translate english c32s006_Hailey_006d9bfc:

    # mc "Esta es la chica que venía de Alabama, ¿no? Si vive en el campo, el cambio de estilo de vida puede ser abrumador."
    mc "This is the girl from Alabama, right? If she lives in the country, the lifestyle change can be overwhelming."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4440
translate english c32s006_Hailey_3e47d165:

    # dap "Sí, pero no es eso lo que me ha parecido divertido. He pensado en si mi madre le dejaría tener un caballo en el jardín."
    dap "Yeah, but that's not what I found funny. I was thinking about whether my mother would let her keep a horse in the yard."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4441
translate english c32s006_Hailey_b23ab8a7:

    # dap "La respuesta, obviamente, es que no, pero eso ha llevado a lo realmente divertido."
    dap "The answer, obviously, is no, but that led to the really funny part."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4442
translate english c32s006_Hailey_29714f61:

    # mc "¿Qué ha pasado?"
    mc "What happened?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4444
translate english c32s006_Hailey_ffab185b:

    # dap "Cuando hemos llegado a Newport, la hemos llevado a la tienda de [mad.nick] a comprarse un bañador."
    dap "When we got to Newport, we took her to [mad.nick]'s store to buy a swimsuit."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4445
translate english c32s006_Hailey_e6fa8c53:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Ya la estáis presentando a toda la familia?"
    mc "*Laugh* Are you already introducing her to the whole family?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4447
translate english c32s006_Hailey_821d6e86:

    # dap "Aún no, pero una chica tiene que saber dónde comprar ropa en una ciudad nueva."
    dap "Not yet, but a girl needs to know where to buy clothes in a new city."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4448
translate english c32s006_Hailey_4ceccdba:

    # dap "Cuando lleguen todas, haremos una comida de bienvenida, para que conozcan a todo el mundo."
    dap "When they all arrive, we'll have a welcome lunch so they can meet everyone."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4449
translate english c32s006_Hailey_0527783e:

    # mc "Creo que es una buena idea. A [ama] le sigue preocupando cómo se van a integrar en la familia."
    mc "I think that's a good idea. [ama] is still worried about how they're going to fit into the family."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4450
translate english c32s006_Hailey_250cb9db:

    # mc "Pero no veo nada divertido en ir a comprar un bañador..."
    mc "But I don't see anything funny about going to buy a swimsuit..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4452
translate english c32s006_Hailey_cea486d0:

    # dap "*Risa* ¡Hombres...!"
    dap "*Laugh* Men...!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4453
translate english c32s006_Hailey_db1d11ea:

    # dap "Lo divertido es que... Espera. Te mando un vídeo."
    dap "The funny part is... Wait. I'll send you a video."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4456
translate english c32s006_Hailey_07543468:

    # mc "*Risa* Me recuerda a esa vieja peli de los 90 con la chica en el caballo de monedas."
    mc "*Laugh* Reminds me of that old 90s movie with the girl on the coin-operated horse."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4457
translate english c32s006_Hailey_27729f5e:

    # dap "Eso es lo que me ha parecido divertido. Tal y como iba vestida y diciendo que iba a echar de menos a los caballos..."
    dap "That's what I thought was funny. The way she was dressed and saying she was going to miss the horses..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4458
translate english c32s006_Hailey_e2e32ab4:

    # dap "En cuanto lo ha visto, me ha dicho..."
    dap "As soon as she saw it, she told me..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4460
translate english c32s006_Hailey_c776defd:

    # hai "Déjame subirme a ese caballo para mandarle una foto a mi hermano."
    hai "Let me get on that horse to send a picture to my brother."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4463
translate english c32s006_Hailey_794e2919:

    # dap "Y la he convencido para hacer un vídeo en vez de una foto."
    dap "And I convinced her to take a video instead of a picture."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4464
translate english c32s006_Hailey_6f79ef42:

    # dap "Iba poniendo caras, como si fuera a toda velocidad en el caballo, pero a cámara lenta. No sé si me explico."
    dap "She was making faces, like she was going full speed on the horse, but in slow motion. I don't know if I'm making sense."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4465
translate english c32s006_Hailey_66b8ad26:

    # mc "Parece una chica divertida. Y el caballo está hecho polvo. No lo recordaba así."
    mc "She seems like a fun girl. And the horse is beat up. I didn't remember it like that."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4466
translate english c32s006_Hailey_2115b405:

    # dap "Creo que necesita una mano de pintura."
    dap "I think it needs a coat of paint."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4468
translate english c32s006_Hailey_31fdfbc4:

    # dap "Pero hay algo de ella que no te va a gustar..."
    dap "But there's something about her you're not going to like..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4469
translate english c32s006_Hailey_19c6b5c7:

    # mc "¿Crees que puede ser problemática?"
    mc "Do you think she could be trouble?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4471
translate english c32s006_Hailey_b153d119:

    # dap "*Risa* No, nada de eso, pero..."
    dap "*Laugh* No, nothing like that, but..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4472
translate english c32s006_Hailey_1165d191:

    # dap "*Risa* [emm] la ha convencido para que el bañador que se estaba comprando fuera... rosa..."
    dap "*Laugh* [emm] convinced her to make the swimsuit she was buying... pink..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4473
translate english c32s006_Hailey_37b59b4c:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Otra mujer de rosa en casa! ¡Noooo!"
    mc "*Laugh* Another woman in pink in the house! Noooo!"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4475
translate english c32s006_Hailey_bc8f983b:

    # dap "Creo que ha cedido por la presión de [emm]. No la veía muy convencida con el color."
    dap "I think she gave in because of [emm]'s pressure. She didn't seem very convinced about the color."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4476
translate english c32s006_Hailey_c349a8fd:

    # dap "Ya conoces a [emm] y lo insistente que puede ser."
    dap "You know [emm], and how persistent she can be."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4477
translate english c32s006_Hailey_fbbb24ad:

    # mc "*Risa* Habrá que dejar que [hai] pase tiempo con tu hermana para contrarrestar la influencia de [emm]."
    mc "*Laugh* We'll have to let [hai] spend time with your sister to counteract [emm]'s influence."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4479
translate english c32s006_Hailey_219173ed:

    # dap "*Risa* Bueno, de momento nos han nombrado a [emm] y a mí como comité de recepción."
    dap "*Laugh* Well, for now, they've appointed [emm] and me as the welcoming committee."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4480
translate english c32s006_Hailey_96e71156:

    # dap "Creo que es porque [emm] no se separa de tu camioneta y porque yo puedo controlarla si hace muchas locuras."
    dap "I think it's because [emm] won't leave your truck alone and because I can control her if she does anything too crazy."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4481
translate english c32s006_Hailey_7c49f364:

    # dap "Con [eri] y [sca] trabajando, no quedaban muchas opciones."
    dap "With [eri] and [sca] working, there weren't many options left."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4482
translate english c32s006_Hailey_9e782ae4:

    # mc "¡Cómo habéis cambiado en los últimos meses! ¿Te acuerdas de cuando llegué?"
    mc "You guys have changed in the last few months! Do you remember how it was when I arrived?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4483
translate english c32s006_Hailey_111a8cd4:

    # mc "Las dos estabais buscándoos las cosquillas permanentemente."
    mc "You two were constantly pushing each other's buttons."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4485
translate english c32s006_Hailey_3deccfe6:

    # dap "Bueno, todo ha cambiado mucho en los últimos meses. Creo que las dos somos más maduras ahora."
    dap "Well, everything has changed a lot in the last few months. I think we're both more mature now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4486
translate english c32s006_Hailey_4abcf97d:

    # dap "Y, hablando de madurez, voy a dejarte y a ayudar a [hai] a deshacer las maletas."
    dap "And, speaking of maturity, I'm going to leave you and help [hai] unpack."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4487
translate english c32s006_Hailey_bb9513cf:

    # dap "Hemos llegado justo para la sesión de yoga de la tarde y ella ha decidido unirse. Supongo que habrá acabado de ducharse."
    dap "We arrived just in time for the afternoon yoga session and she decided to join. I guess she must be done showering by now."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4488
translate english c32s006_Hailey_5dd1f6e9:

    # mc "¿También hacéis yoga por la tarde?"
    mc "You guys do yoga in the afternoon too?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4490
translate english c32s006_Hailey_40529c7e:

    # dap "Con tanta gente y tantos horarios diferentes, hemos decidido hacer dos sesiones."
    dap "With so many people and so many different schedules, we decided to do two sessions."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4491
translate english c32s006_Hailey_6315c2d9:

    # dap "Así, las chicas que no pueden venir a la sesión de la mañana, se pueden apuntar por la tarde."
    dap "That way, the girls who can't make it to the morning session can join in the afternoon."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4492
translate english c32s006_Hailey_48095fe2:

    # mc "Supongo que es lo más lógico."
    mc "I guess that makes sense."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4494
translate english c32s006_Hailey_5a00f793:

    # dap "Me voy. Te veo mañana. Te quiero."
    dap "I'm off. See you tomorrow. Love you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4495
translate english c32s006_Hailey_6616e794:

    # mc "Yo también te quiero."
    mc "Love you too."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4499
translate english c32s006_Gav_81b66a7e:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 66 – JUEVES{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 66 – THURSDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4500
translate english c32s006_Gav_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4502
translate english c32s006_Gav_e61bf0ac:

    # mc "Dime, [ama]. ¿Vas a tardar mucho en venir a buscarme? Vamos a llegar tarde."
    mc "Hey, [ama]. Are you going to take much longer to pick me up? We're going to be late."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4504
translate english c32s006_Gav_343eeb9b:

    # ama "¿No te acuerdas de que te dije que estaría aquí toda la mañana?"
    ama "Don't you remember I told you I'd be here all morning?"

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4505
translate english c32s006_Gav_f977818d:

    # ama "Tienes que venir por tu cuenta. Hoy no te voy a hacer de chófer."
    ama "You have to come on your own. I'm not going to be your chauffeur today."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4506
translate english c32s006_Gav_d700bf3a:

    # mc "No me acordaba. Ahora cojo un coche y voy para allá."
    mc "I forgot. I'll grab a car now and head over there."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4507
translate english c32s006_Gav_e6c4b65b:

    # mc "Id empezando sin mí."
    mc "Go ahead and start without me."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4509
translate english c32s006_Gav_bd2a410d:

    # ama "Deberías estar aquí..."
    ama "You should be here..."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4510
translate english c32s006_Gav_c53d5136:

    # mc "Lo sé, pero no quiero retrasarlo más. Todo el mundo debe estar muy ansioso."
    mc "I know, but I don't want to delay it any longer. Everyone must be very anxious."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4511
translate english c32s006_Gav_1e600698:

    # ama "Sí, especialmente [gav]."
    ama "Yes, especially [gav]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4512
translate english c32s006_Gav_bff6628d:

    # mc "Por eso debéis empezar sin mí. Ha sido mi error. En quince minutos estaré ahí."
    mc "That's why you should start without me. It was my mistake. I'll be there in fifteen minutes."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4514
translate english c32s006_Gav_1bc6f0ed:

    # "Cuando llegas al campamento, [gav] está haciendo demostraciones del uso de su brazo."
    "When you arrive at the camp, [gav] is demonstrating the use of his arm."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4515
translate english c32s006_Gav_96b6372a:

    # "Hoy es el día en que la potencia se ha puesto al máximo por primera vez."
    "Today is the day the power has been set to maximum for the first time."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4516
translate english c32s006_Gav_e1e5ade6:

    # "Se ha despejado una zona donde puede hacer los ejercicios planeados y los operativos pueden observarlo."
    "An area has been cleared where he can do the planned exercises and the operatives can observe him."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4518
translate english c32s006_Gav_8deb53c4:

    # "La coordinación de movimientos y el manejo de objetos parece ir bien bajo la atenta mirada de [cal]."
    "Movement coordination and object handling seem to be going well under [cal]'s watchful eye."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4519
translate english c32s006_Gav_3aaa7291:

    # "Decides mantenerte a una distancia prudencial mezclado entre los clones que están mirando las pruebas en silencio."
    "You decide to keep a safe distance, blending in with the clones who are watching the tests in silence."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4520
translate english c32s006_Gav_b2e23ffc:

    # "No sólo para disimular que has llegado tarde, sino porque hoy el protagonista debe ser [gav]."
    "Not just to hide the fact that you're late, but because today [gav] should be the star of the show."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4521
translate english c32s006_Gav_7129abe1:

    # "Algunos te ven llegar y te dejan un hueco. Otros no se dan ni cuenta de tu presencia."
    "Some see you arrive and make room for you. Others don't even notice your presence."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4522
translate english c32s006_Gav_a309f127:

    # "Solo tienen ojos para su compañero. [gav] le cae bien a casi todo el mundo."
    "They only have eyes for their comrade. Almost everyone likes [gav]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4524
translate english c32s006_Gav_7e24f04c:

    # "Los ejercicios de fuerza también dan el resultado esperado."
    "The strength exercises also yield the expected results."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4525
translate english c32s006_Gav_dcae3a18:

    # "[gav] estaba especialmente ansioso con este desde que, hace tres días, no pudo completarlo."
    "[gav] was especially anxious about this exercise since he couldn't complete it three days ago."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4526
translate english c32s006_Gav_7882fe19:

    # "Los nuevos ajustes que ha introducido [cal] parecen funcionar mejor de lo previsto."
    "The new adjustments [cal] introduced seem to be working better than expected."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4528
translate english c32s006_Gav_531877ea:

    # "Cuando la serie de ejercicios prevista finaliza, [gav] hace un ejercicio que no estaba en el plan."
    "When the planned series of exercises finishes, [gav] does an exercise that wasn't in the plan."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4529
translate english c32s006_Gav_5cdbc14c:

    # "El chico quiere probar el brazo más allá de lo que [cal], siempre conservador, está dispuesto a añadir al plan de ejercicios."
    "The boy wants to test the arm beyond what [cal], always conservative, is willing to add to the exercise plan."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4530
translate english c32s006_Gav_53296186:

    # "Es un éxito, y puedes escuchar murmullos de sorpresa entre los clones que tienes alrededor."
    "It's a success, and you can hear murmurs of surprise among the clones around you."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4532
translate english c32s006_Gav_0fdb0d19:

    # "Cuando por fin acaba la serie de ejercicios, los clones se dispersan y te acercas a [cal] y a [gav]."
    "When the series of exercises finally ends, the clones disperse and you approach [cal] and [gav]."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4533
translate english c32s006_Gav_66735849:

    # "Ves que [bet], [ama], y [aar] también se acercan desde diversos puntos del campamento."
    "You see that [bet], [ama], and [aar] are also approaching from various points of the camp."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4536
translate english c32s006_Gav_0ffc38e0:

    # mc "Felicidades, [gav]. Parece que todo ha ido bien, por lo que he podido ver."
    mc "Congratulations, [gav]. It looks like everything went well, from what I could see."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4537
translate english c32s006_Gav_b503bb9c:

    # gav "Gracias, [mc]. [cal] dice que aún hay que ajustar unos parámetros, pero que el funcionamiento es mejor del esperado."
    gav "Thanks, [mc]. [cal] says there are still some parameters to adjust, but the performance is better than expected."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4538
translate english c32s006_Gav_5ba2afdf:

    # mc "Eso es genial, [gav]. ¿Significa eso que podrás incorporarte al servicio en breve?"
